"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTAvMjk3NTY5OWMtYWJkZC00ZjdiLWJkMzUtNzQyNjdhNTcwMTE3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221102eib2000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 why is Bitcoin price up\par \b \uc2 Why is Bitcoin price up today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Kyle White \par \uc2 918 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 October 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Is the bear market over now that Bitcoin and altcoins are showing shoots of green?\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price is up today, and a marketwide rally in crypto prices suggests that Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) could be aiming to wrap up the month of October in the black.\par \par \uc2 As of Oct. 26, most major cryptocurrencies are posting single-digit gains. Bitcoin recorded a 5.15% price increase over the previous 24 hours and a 5.48% gain over the previous seven days. While the current price is fluctuating, BTC is holding above the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-crosses-20k-as-daily-crypto-short-liquidations-pass-400m"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 psychologically important $20,000 level}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-crosses-20k-as-daily-crypto-short-liquidations-pass-400m"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-crosses-20k-as-daily-crypto-short-liquidations-pass-400m}}}\uc2 . The following chart shows the BTC rally since Oct. 24.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/a97b2bbd-a5dd-47f8-a086-1680d83813e6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC price. Source: Cointelegraph\par \par \uc2 Stocks are beginning the day down as Bitcoin continues to remain over $20,000. Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s momentum has continued for three days now and is seeing green candles on Oct. 26. The recent price spike pushed the total cryptocurrency market capitalization above the $1 trillion mark and comes after months of Bitcoin trading in a narrow sideways range of $18,000 to $20,000.\par \par \uc2 Hand in hand with Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s growth, most major cryptocurrencies \u8212\'20\'14 including Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), Solana\u8217\'20\'19s SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s MATIC ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ), XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) and Tron\u8217\'20\'19s TRX ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tron-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TRX}}}\uc2  ) \u8212\'20\'14 have registered price increases of more than 10% over the last 48 hours. There are several reasons for the crypto rally.\par \par \uc2 The current rally in BTC and other major cryptocurrencies may indicate an increase in confidence in the market following several key developments. Here are the key drivers of the growth.\par \par \uc2 $1 billion in short positions were liquidated\par \par \uc2 Since Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price crashed to $17,600 on June 18, the open interest of BTC futures contracts has been surging. The current price move triggered a wave of liquidations, and one data point to keep an eye on is if we see a sharp reduction in aggregate open interest.\par \par \uc2 Data shows that Bitcoin short liquidations {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-liquidates-over-1-billion-as-btc-price-hits-6-week-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 accounted for $550 million}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-liquidates-over-1-billion-as-btc-price-hits-6-week-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-liquidates-over-1-billion-as-btc-price-hits-6-week-highs}}}\uc2  over the past 24 hours. $704 million in cross-crypto shorts were liquidated on Oct. 25, with the Oct. 26 tally so far standing at $275 million.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/327783d2-8066-4d1a-8478-15dfa5d402e4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto liquidations chart. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 Short liquidations directly help push the price of Bitcoin higher by forcing automated buy pressure. The current rally is seeing open interest gaining momentum after remaining consistent since October, which explains much of the sideways trading as well as the current rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/abcda991-9a7b-4722-b13a-14a18896b39f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin options open interest. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 Macro movements are starting to turn in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s favor\par \par \uc2 Investors\u8217\'20\'19 confidence in the crypto market could also be rising due to their belief that the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  could roll out smaller-sized interest rate hikes in the next two months. According to MacroMicro, a firm that publishes investors\u8217\'20\'19 consensus estimates on expected changes in interest rates, interest rates may be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://en.macromicro.me/charts/39185/us-number-rising-rate-2022"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lower}}}\uc2  than previously anticipated in the near future.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/b76b981a-65ae-41ba-a7c7-9bdb46e2843e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Investors believe interest rates could fall. Source: MacroMicro\par \par \uc2 The graph points to a possible slowdown in interest rate hikes. The public sentiment shows that future rates may fall, and investors believe that this has created the possibility for a broad crypto market recovery.\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 provides a general overview of the economy in general. Currently, Bitcoin and the S&P 500 share a high correlation coefficient.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, if interest rates ease and the economy grows, Bitcoin could continue to rally if a similar turn-around takes place in equities markets. The better the macro climate, the better for Bitcoin price.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-the-crypto-market-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is the crypto market up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Stocks stage a multiday rally, and the U.K. gets a crypto-friendly leader\par \par \uc2 The selection of \uc2 Rishi Sunak\uc2  as the new prime minister of the United Kingdom appears to have boosted crypto \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2 . {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/wealthy-crypto-believer-and-incoming-uk-pm-rishi-sunak-once-commissioned-a-royal-nft"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Sunak is a crypto advocate}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/wealthy-crypto-believer-and-incoming-uk-pm-rishi-sunak-once-commissioned-a-royal-nft"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/wealthy-crypto-believer-and-incoming-uk-pm-rishi-sunak-once-commissioned-a-royal-nft}}}\uc2  and once commissioned a royal nonfungible token (NFT). As a result, many expect him to make {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/the-uk-has-a-new-name-for-stablecoins-and-a-new-bill-to-regulate-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/the-uk-has-a-new-name-for-stablecoins-and-a-new-bill-to-regulate-crypto}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/the-uk-has-a-new-name-for-stablecoins-and-a-new-bill-to-regulate-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 major reforms in the crypto sector}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 During his tenure as finance minister under the leadership of Boris Johnson, Sunak indicated his willingness to make the U.K. a cryptocurrency hub.\par \par \uc2 In April 2022, Sunak said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s my ambition to make the UK a global hub for crypto asset technology, and the measures we\u8217\'20\'19ve outlined today will help to ensure firms can invest, innovate and scale up in this country.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 It is still too early to determine whether or not the Oct. 26 rally is a sign of a trend change, but one thing is clear: Factors impacting Bitcoin price and the crypto market are clearly being driven by the forced unwinding of futures contracts, positive movement in macro markets, and investors\u8217\'20\'19 expectation that central bank policy and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-council-for-innovation-poll-sees-crypto-voters-as-a-force-to-be-reckoned-with"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto regulatory frameworks}}}\uc2  will improve.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTAvMjk3NTY5OWMtYWJkZC00ZjdiLWJkMzUtNzQyNjdhNTcwMTE3LmpwZw=