al. Currently, Bitcoin and the S&P 500 share a high correlation coefficient.\par \par \uc2 Therefore if interest rates ease and the economy grows, Bitcoin could continue to rally if a similar turn-around were to take place in equities markets. The better the macro climate, the better for Bitcoin price.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-the-crypto-market-up-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is the crypto market up today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Stocks stage a multi-day rally and the UK gets a crypto friendly leader\par \par \uc2 The selection of \uc2 Rishi Sunak\uc2  as the new UK prime minister appears to have boosted crypto \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Sunak is a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/wealthy-crypto-believer-and-incoming-uk-pm-rishi-sunak-once-commissioned-a-royal-nft"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto advocate}}}\uc2  and once commissioned a royal NFT. As a result, the world expects him to make {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/the-uk-has-a-new-name-for-stablecoins-and-a-new-bill-to-regulate-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 major reforms}}}\uc2  in the crypto sector.\par \par \uc2 During his tenure as the Finance Minister under the leadership of \uc2 Boris Johnson\uc2 , Sunak indicated his willingness to make the UK a cryptocurrency hub.\par \par \uc2 In April 2022 Sunak said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s my ambition to make the UK a global hub for crypto asset technology, and the measures we\u8217\'20\'19ve outlined today will help to ensure firms can invest, innovate and scale up in this country.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 It is still too early to determine whether or not the October 26 rally is a sign of a trend change, but one thing is clear.Factors impacting Bitcoin price and the crypto market are clearly being driven by the forced unwinding of futures contracts, positive movement in macro markets and investors\u8217\'20\'19 expectation that central bank policy and potential {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-council-for-innovation-poll-sees-crypto-voters-as-a-force-to-be-reckoned-with"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto regulatory frameworks}}}\uc2  will improve.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTAvMjk3NTY5OWMtYWJkZC00ZjdiLWJkMzUtNzQyNjdhNTcwMTE3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221026eiaq000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/21: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,967 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 October 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Buyers have defended the immediate support levels in S&P 500 and Bitcoin, but they may face stiff resistance from the bears at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 The 10-year Treasury yield in the United States rose to its highest level since 2008. Although this type of rally is usually negative for risky assets, the U.S. stock markets recovered ground after the Wall Street Journal reported that some {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-hits-1-week-lows-as-fed-rate-hike-rumors-unsettle-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 officials of the Federal Reserve were concerned}}}\uc2  about the pace of the rate hikes and the risks of over-tightening.\par \par \uc2 While it is widely accepted that the U.S. will enter a recession, a debate rages on about how long it could last. On that, \uc2 Tesla\uc2  CEO {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/global-recession-may-last-until-near-2024-bitcoin-halving-elon-musk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Elon Musk recently said on Twitter}}}\uc2  that the recession could last \u8220\'20\'1Cprobably until spring of \u8216\'20\'1824,\u8221\'20\'1D and added that it would be nice to spend \u8220\'20\'1Cone year without a horrible global event.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/2fb48563-cc7a-4681-a0cd-cfbd32bc50b4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price has witnessed a massive drop from its all-time high but its hash rate remains strong. This has increased {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-s-discount-to-hash-rate-highest-since-early-2020-mike-mcglone"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s discount relative to its hash rate}}}\uc2  in October to its highest since the first quarter of 2020, according to Bloomberg Intelligence senior commodity strategist \uc2 Mike McGlone\uc2 . The previous instance of the huge discount was followed by a massive rally that lasted till 2021. McGlone believes the same could happen again this time and Bitcoin may outperform most major assets.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the S&P 500 index (SPX), the U.S. dollar index (DXY) and the major cryptocurrencies to spot any reversals.\par \par \uc2 SPX\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 index rose above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($3,702) on Oct. 18 but the bulls could not build upon this strength and challenge the downtrend line. This suggests that the bears have not given up and are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/fe555214-b157-48e4-beeb-cacaa01f5866.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is trying to flatten out and the relative strength index is above 46, suggesting a possible range-bound action in the near term. Buyers are likely to defend the zone between $3,568 and $3,491 while the bears will try to stall the recovery in the $3,762 to $3,800 zone.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up and breaks above $3,800, it will break the lower lows and lower highs pattern. The index could then rise to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($3,885).\par \par \uc2 The bears will regain their hold if they manage to sink the price below $3,491. That could start the next leg of the down move to $3,325.\par \par \uc2 DXY\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar index remains in a strong uptrend as the bulls are not allowing the price to break below the 20-day EMA (112).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/f843c993-74ab-4cea-b8ef-99fae487c005.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to propel the price above the $113.92 to $114.77 zone to resume the uptrend. Buyers tried to do that on Oct. 21 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that bears are aggressively defending the overhead zone.\par \par \uc2 The sellers will attempt to gain the upper hand in the near term by pulling the price below the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the index could sink to $110. Buyers are likely to defend this level and a bounce off it could keep the index range-bound between $110 and $114.77 for some time.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, a break and close below the uptrend line could point to a trend change. Alternatively, a rally above $114.77 could indicate the start of the next leg of the uptrend to $117.14.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bounced off the nearest support at $18,843 on Oct. 20 but the bulls could not overcome the obstacle at the 20-day EMA ($19,318). This suggests that the bears want to further cement their hold.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/97041c2a-5382-4a77-b2d3-6a955ae75bb4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price slips and sustains below $18,843, the BTC/USDT pair could drop to $18,125. The bulls are expected to defend the zone between $18,125 and $17,622 vigorously because if they fail to do that, the pair could resume its downtrend. The next stop on the downside could be $15,750.\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the Oct. 21 candlestick shows that buyers purchased the dip below $18,843. They will try to propel the price above the moving averages. A break above the 50-day SMA ($19,616) could clear the path for a possible rally to $20,500. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break above it could signal the start of a strong recovery to $22,800 and then $25,211.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is struggling to rise above the 20-day EMA ($1,313) but a minor positive is that the bulls have not allowed the price to sustain below the immediate support at $1,263.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/229b2503-ef55-432f-b49b-4cdd328fa0c6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to the downtrend line of the descending channel. Buyers will have to thrust the price above this resistance to indicate the start of a new up-move.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price continues lower and breaks below the $1,220 to $1,190 support zone, the selling could intensify and the pair could drop to the psychological level at $1,000 and then to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below both the moving averages and the bears are trying to sink the price to the support of the range at $258.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/3060dc58-a07e-4a25-b097-cda00002e8bc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The gradually downsloping 20-day EMA ($274) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the negative territory indicate advantage to bears. The $258 level is likely to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears. If sellers come out on top, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to $216.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns up from the current level or the $258 support, the bulls will try to push the pair above the moving averages. If that happens, the pair could attempt a rally to $300. This level is likely to act as a strong barrier but if bulls overcome it, the pair could rally to $338.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the developing symmetrical triangle pattern on Oct. 20 but the long tail on the candlestick shows that the bulls are buying the dips to the 50-day SMA ($0.43). Buyers again defended the 50-day SMA on Oct. 21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/fa35c31d-3549-4744-90ab-c4043981e75f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.46) has started to turn down and the RSI has slipped into negative territory, indicating that the bears have a slight edge. If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to pull the XRP/USDT pair to the breakout level of $0.41. This level is likely to attract strong buying.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break and close above the 20-day EMA will be the first indication of strength. The pair could then rise to $0.51 and later to the resistance line. A break and close above the triangle could improve the prospects of the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been in a downtrend for the past several days. After a two-day relief rally, the selling resumed on Oct. 18 and the bears have pulled the price to the support line of the wedge.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/e8d83ddc-39e4-4812-bd9b-3868e97590ee.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sharp selling of the past few days has sent the RSI tumbling deep into the oversold territory. This suggests that the selling may have been overdone in the near term and a relief rally or consolidation may be around the corner.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the support line, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair will attempt to rise to $0.36 and then to the 20-day EMA ($0.38). A break above this level will be the first indication that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, if the price breaks below the support line, the selling could further pick up momentum and the pair could plummet to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-historically-accurate-bitcoin-on-chain-metrics-are-flashing-bottom"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 3 historically accurate Bitcoin on-chain metrics are flashing 'bottom'}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) dropped below the $29.42 support on Oct. 19, indicating increased selling pressure from the bears. The selling continued and the $27.87 support was taken out on Oct. 21. This clears the path for a retest of the crucial support at $26.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/cc2d7d27-db77-4ab4-828c-7646fdb495ba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears are in control. If the SOL/USDT pair does not rebound sharply off $26, the possibility of a break below it increases. The pair could then decline to the next support at $22.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level or $26 and breaks above $30, it will signal accumulation at lower levels. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up in the near term after the pair breaks above the 50-day SMA ($32.28).\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Attempts by the bulls to push Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the moving averages have met with significant resistance from the bears. The sellers will now try to sink the price to the support near $0.06.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/c39d33c9-44ea-473d-933c-d74247e20ee8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.06) and the RSI below 45 suggest that bears have the upper hand. If sellers sink the price below the support, the DOGE/USDT pair could plunge to the June low near $0.05. The bulls will have to defend this level with all their might because if the support cracks, the pair could start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent a collapse, they will have to quickly push the price above the moving averages. The pair could then rise to $0.07 where the bears may again mount a strong resistance.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $0.88 on Oct. 19 and broke below the moving averages on Oct. 21. The failure of the bulls to defend the moving averages on the retest is a negative sign.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/8a6466b7-2578-4516-a0f4-4cd7e57ffcd2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below the moving averages, the likelihood of a drop to the $0.71 to $0.69 support zone increases.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this zone, it will suggest that the MATIC/USDT pair may consolidate in a tighter range between $0.69 and $0.88 for a few days. The flattish moving averages and the RSI just below the midpoint also suggests a consolidation in the near term.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price quickly reverses direction and breaks above $0.88, it will suggest a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips. The pair could then climb to $0.94 and later to $1.05.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTAvM2QzZGI4N2YtNjUwZC00NzM2LWEzNWYtOTk2MzllNTczNWVmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221021eial000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
