an invest with \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  and buy $HDWY today. In that case, it's an easy choice when you consider the potential for over 1000x - yes, one thousand!\par \par \uc2 Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.thehideaways.io"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.thehideaways.io}}}\par \par \uc2 Presale: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://ticket.thehideaways.io/register"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://ticket.thehideaways.io/register}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/thehideawayscrypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/thehideawayscrypto}}}\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hdwycrypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://twitter.com/hdwycrypto}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020221020eiak000gq\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 markets\par \b \uc2 2 key Ethereum price indicators point to traders opening long positions\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Marcel Pechman \par \uc2 754 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 October 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Ether price is still in a bear trend, but data shows traders adding to their long positions.\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) price has been unable to close above $1,400 for the past 29 days and has been trading in a relatively tight $150 range. At the moment, the $1,250 support and the $1,400 resistance seem difficult to break, but two months ago, Ether was trading at $2,000. The current price range for Ether simply reflects how volatile cryptocurrencies can be.\par \par \uc2 From one side, investors are calm as Ether trades 50% above the $880 intraday low on June 18. However, the price is still down 65% year-to-date despite the most exciting upgrade in the network\u8217\'20\'19s seven-year history.\par \par \uc2 More importantly, Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s biggest rival, BNB Chain, suffered a cross-chain security exploit on Oct. 6. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bnb-chain-responds-with-next-steps-for-cross-chain-security-after-network-exploit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $568 million exploit}}}\uc2  caused BNB Smart Chain to temporarily suspend all transactions on the network, which holds $5.4 billion in smart contracts deposits.\par \par \uc2 Ether underperformed competing smart contract network coins such as Binance Chain\u8217\'20\'19s BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ), Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2 , and Solana\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) by 14% since September, even though its TVL in ETH terms increased by 9% during the period. This suggests that the Ethereum network\u8217\'20\'19s issues, such as the $3 average transaction fees, weighed on the ETH price.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/4768214d-5d66-4536-8bd2-eb5e6bb14132.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Ether vs. MATIC, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , BNB: Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Traders should look at Ether's derivatives markets data to understand how whales and market makers are positioned.\par \par \uc2 Options traders remain moderately risk-averse\par \par \uc2 The 25% delta skew is a telling sign whenever professional traders overcharge for upside or downside protection. For example, if traders expected an Ether price crash, the options markets skew indicator would move above 12%. On the other hand, generalized excitement reflects a negative 12% skew.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/96deab48-3260-4fcb-b7b1-abf9e3a966b5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Ether 60-day options 25% delta skew: Source: Laevitas\par \par \uc2 In layperson\u8217\'20\'19s terms, the higher the index, the less inclined traders are to offer downside risk protection. The indicator has been signaling fear since Sept. 19, when it last held a value below 10%. That day marked the temporary bottom of a 28% weekly correction, as the $1,250 support strengthened after such a test.\par \par \uc2 Long-to-short data show traders adding longs\par \par \uc2 The top traders\u8217\'20\'19 long-to-short net ratio excludes externalities that might have solely impacted the options markets. By aggregating the positions on the spot, perpetual and quarterly futures contracts, one can better understand whether professional traders are leaning \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  or \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 There are occasional methodological discrepancies between different exchanges, so viewers should monitor changes instead of absolute figures.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/b33670f7-407f-4562-9ee8-1ea9f317eb6a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Exchanges' top traders Ether long-to-short ratio. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 Binance\uc2  displayed a modest increase in its long-to-short ratio between Oct. 13 and 17, as the indicator moved from 1.04 to 1.07 in those four days. Thus, those traders slightly increased their \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  bets.\par \par \uc2 Huobi\uc2  data shows a stable pattern as the long-to-short indicator stayed near 0.98 the whole time. Lastly, at the OKX exchange, the metric plunged to 0.72 on Oct. 13, largely favoring shorts only to rebound to the current 1.00.\par \par \uc2 On average, according to the long-to-short indicator, the top traders from those three exchanges have been increasing long positions since the $1,200 support test on Oct. 13.\par \par \uc2 Skew and leverage are critical to sustaining the $1,250 support\par \par \uc2 There was no significant improvement in pro traders\u8217\'20\'19 derivatives positions despite Ether gaining 12% since the Oct. 13 crash down to $1,185. Moreover, options traders fear that a move below $1,250 remains feasible, considering the skew indicator remains above the 10% threshold.\par \par \uc2 If these whales and market makers had firm convictions of a sharp price correction, that would have been reflected in the top traders\u8217\'20\'19 long-to-short ratio.\par \par \uc2 Investors should closely monitor both metrics. The 25% delta skew should remain at 18%, and the long-to-short ratio above 0.80 to sustain the $1,250 support strength. These indicators are a telling sign of whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment from top traders is gaining momentum.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTAvNzI5Y2M3OTQtNDgyOS00MGViLWE4Y2YtOWEzNDRmYjBlOWNmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221017eiah000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, MATIC, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,807 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 October 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 These altcoins are carving out gains as Bitcoin price continues to trade within a tightening range.\par \par \uc2 The United States equities markets have made a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  start to the new week. The S&P 500 is up about 2.60% and the Nasdaq Composite has rallied more than 3%. This indicates that the markets have shrugged off September's high inflation reading and shifted focus onto the third-quarter earnings.\par \par \uc2 The stock market\u8217\'20\'19s recovery could pave the way for Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) to break out of the range it has been stuck in for the past several days. A positive sign for the bulls is that the amount of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/get-ready-for-btc-volatility-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin held in cold storage or lost}}}\uc2  has risen to a five-year high, according to Glassnode data.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/adfd7a7a-9c25-4968-a6c7-1a4334faa053.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While long-term investors do not seem to be in the mood to sell their holdings at lower levels, smaller investors appear to be making the most of the depressed prices. Glassnode data shows that the number of wallets holding one whole Bitcoin or more has risen sharply in 2022.\par \par \uc2 What are the levels to watch on the upside that could signal the start of a sustained recovery in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke above the 20-day exponential moving average ($19,410) on Oct. 17 and the bulls are trying to extend the recovery above the zone between the 50-day simple moving average ($19,691) and the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/745e2e5c-5f9a-4d8a-86be-48ca4b8ffedc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the BTC/USDT pair could rise to the stiff resistance at $20,500. This level has acted as a strong barrier since Sept. 14. Therefore, a break and close above $20,500 could indicate that the selling pressure could be reducing. The pair could then sprint to $22,800 as there is no major resistance in between.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down from the downtrend line and plummets below $18,843. Such a move will indicate that bears continue to sell at higher levels. The pair could then drop to the strong support zone between $18,125 and $17,622.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) recovery has reached the breakdown level from the triangle. The 20-day EMA ($1,323) is located close to this level hence the bears are expected to defend the level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/75bcb228-20e3-4820-b244-c534ff3ea300.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level and breaks below $1,263, the ETH/USDT pair could retest the Oct. 13 intraday low at $1,190. A break below this level could pull the pair to the support line of the descending channel.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if buyers drive the price above the overhead resistance at the 20-day EMA, the pair could rise to the downtrend line of the channel. This is an important obstacle for the bulls to overcome if they want to signal a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating between $258 and $300 for the past several days. The bulls are trying to push the price above the moving averages on Oct. 17.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/bccf8901-fe32-44a2-81de-dde3ace6e2e5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they can pull it off, the BNB/USDT pair could attempt a rally to the resistance of the range at $300. The bears are likely to defend this level with all their might. A strong rejection at this level will indicate that the pair may remain stuck inside the range for a while.\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to sink the price below $258 to gain the upper hand. If they do that, the pair could decline to the next support at $216. Contrarily, if buyers propel the price above $300, the pair could rise to $338.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days has formed a large symmetrical triangle in XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ). Buyers tried to push the price toward the resistance line of the triangle on Oct. 14 but the long wick on the candlestick shows aggressive selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/20c9ba9a-75d3-4e04-9b81-d37cd8751ab8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below the 20-day EMA ($0.47), the XRP/USDT pair could slide to the support line of the triangle. This level could attract buyers and a strong rebound off it will suggest that the pair may continue to trade inside the triangle. On the other hand, a break below the support line could sink the pair to $0.41.\par \par \uc2 Trading inside a triangle is usually random and volatile. Although the triangle usually acts as a continuation pattern, it is better to wait for the price to break above the triangle before placing large bets.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has formed a falling wedge pattern. The price bounced off the support line of the wedge on Oct. 13 and the bulls are attempting to push the price to the 20-day EMA ($0.40).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/c3d2840a-ee5f-4a50-aa10-4565306650a8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 In a downtrend, the bears try to vigorously defend the 20-day EMA. If the price turns down from this resistance, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could again drop to the support line. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the oversold territory indicate that bears are in control.\par \par \uc2 To gain the upper hand in the near term, the buyers will have to push the price above the 20-day EMA. The pair could thereafter reach the downtrend line. This level could act as a strong resistance but if bulls push the price above it, the pair could soar to $0.52.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) dipped and closed below the $30 support on Oct. 15 but the bears could not capitalize on this weakness. This suggests that selling dries up at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/8cdfc50b-392c-4dd1-bc3c-cc106d2c5c24.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed the price back above the breakdown level of $30 on Oct. 16 and are attempting to extend the recovery to the downtrend line. The bears are likely to mount a strong defense at this level.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the downtrend line, the SOL/USDT pair could drop to $29.42. A break below this level could pull the pair to $27.87. On the upside, if buyers thrust the price above the downtrend line, the pair could rally to $35.50.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) recovery is nearing the moving averages. This is an important level for the bears to defend because a break above the 50-day SMA ($0.06) could clear the path for a potential rally to $0.07.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/d8948176-6e92-4c3a-a9c0-b3c8db9e836d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $0.07, the DOGE/USDT pair could again drop to the support near $0.06. That could keep the pair stuck between these two levels for a few more days. The flattening 20-day EMA ($0.06) and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a consolidation in the near term.\par \par \uc2 If bulls pierce the overhead resistance at $0.07, the pair could attempt a rally to $0.09. Such a move will bring the large $0.05 to $0.09 range into play. Another possibility is that the price turns down sharply from the moving averages. If that happens, the bears will make one more attempt to pull the pair to the support at $0.05.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/post-midterm-elections-dump-bitcoin-will-see-12k-if-this-2018-btc-chart-fractal-is-correct"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Post-midterm elections dump? Bitcoin will see $12K if this 2018 BTC chart fractal is correct}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to sustain Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) below $6 on Oct. 13 started a recovery that has reached the 20-day EMA ($6.29) on Oct. 17. This level is likely to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/5b352cf2-a5c4-4676-857f-007522ab0943.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls come out on top, the DOT/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally toward the overhead resistance at the 50-day SMA ($6.69). This level could again attract strong selling by the bears. If the price turns down from this resistance, the pair could extend its stay inside the $6 to $6.64 range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move is likely to begin after the bulls push the price above the 50-day SMA or bears sink the pair below $6. If the price slips below $6, the decline could extend to $5.36.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 After several unsuccessful attempts in the past few days, the bulls have finally managed to push Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) above the downtrend line on Oct. 17. This is the first sign of a potential trend change.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/23e43147-c593-4299-9609-429c47a9539f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The MATIC/USDT pair could first rise to $0.86 and if this level is crossed, the relief rally could reach $0.94. Although the flattish moving averages suggest a balance between supply and demand, the RSI in the positive territory suggests that the momentum could be turning in favor of the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if buyers fail to sustain the price above the downtrend line, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels. The sellers will have to sink the price below $0.75 to gain the upper hand in the near term.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) is attempting to bounce off the support at $0.000010 but the recovery lacks strength. This suggests that traders are in no hurry to buy at the current levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/99e9ab15-4b10-437c-965a-cf22ba485a4e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping down and the RSI is in the negative territory, indicating advantage to sellers. If the price turns down from the current level or the moving averages, the bears will again try to sink the SHIB/USDT pair below $0.000010. If they manage to do that, the selling could intensify and the pair may drop toward the vital support at $0.000007.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if buyers drive the price above the moving averages, the pair could rise to the overhead resistance at $0.000014. A break above this level could suggest that the bulls are on a comeback. The pair could then rise to $0.000018.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTAvOGY4YTMxOWYtYzUyNS00ZjY0LThlYzAtZjA3OWY5NTJjMDA4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221017eiah000dz\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18No emotion\u8217\'20\'19 \u8212\'20\'14 Bitcoin metric gives $35K as next BTC price macro low\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By   William Suberg \par \uc2 501 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 October 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Stochastic indicator shows key similarities to previous BTC price bear markets.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is showing textbook macro bottom signs in a \u8220\'20\'1Cbusiness as usual\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/trading-for-beginners/bull-vs-bear-crypto-market-what-is-the-difference-and-how-to-handle-both"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bear market}}}\uc2 , data suggests.\par \par \uc2 In fresh findings {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/TATrader_Alan/status/1580543266218332160/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 published}}}\uc2  on Oct. 13, popular \uc2 Twitter\uc2  trader Alan revealed that BTC price action is closely mimicking prior cycles.\par \par \uc2 Trader on Stoch data: \u8220\'20\'1CDon\u8217\'20\'19t be shaken out\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 While some are concerned about the current state of Bitcoin and crypto markets, on-chain indicators have long suggested that the 2022 bear market is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/insane-evidence-bitcoin-has-capitulated-in-past-2-months-analysis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 comfortingly similar to previous ones}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Eyeing the 