NB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 SOL\uc2 , DOGE, DOT, MATIC, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,757 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 October 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins are stuck in a range as investors await the release of the October 13 CPI data.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  has been aggressively hiking rates in an attempt to cool down inflation and that has kept the U.S. equities markets under pressure. Investors have been watching the inflation figures closely for early signs of topping out but to no avail.\par \par \uc2 Wholesale prices {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2022/10/12/producer-price-index-september-2022.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rose}}}\uc2  0.4% in September, exceeding the Dow Jones' estimate for a 0.2% gain. This suggests that inflation is yet to respond to the Fed\u8217\'20\'19s monetary tightening. All eyes will now be fixed on the Consumer Price Index data to be released on Oct. 13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/f441a94a-096e-41c0-9764-d9db34150d5b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Equity traders can expect \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  to pick up following the release of the numbers but for the crypto traders, it is difficult to predict whether this trigger is sufficient for Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) to break out of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-analysts-and-traders-say-btc-s-low-volatility-is-a-calm-before-the-storm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the $18,500 to $24,500 range}}}\uc2  it has been stuck in for the past several days.\par \par \uc2 What are the critical levels on the upside and downside that could signal the start of a trending move in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is attempting to bounce off the first support at $18,843 but the relief rally is likely to hit a wall at the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($19,482). If the price turns down from this resistance, it will suggest that bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/c0abbf57-9161-4fa9-b472-de5c2886ebb2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break and close below $18,843 could pull the price to the $18,125 to $17,622 support zone. Bulls are expected to defend this zone with all their might because if they fail to do that, the BTC/USDT pair could resume its downtrend. The pair could then drop to $15,800 and later to $15,000.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of relief for the bulls will be a break above the downtrend line and the recovery could pick up steam after the pair rises above $20,500. That could set the stage for a possible rally to $22,800.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the symmetrical triangle on Oct. 11 but a positive sign is that the bulls purchased the dip and are trying to push the price back into the triangle on Oct. 12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/ed87e846-5e2d-45da-bd57-7111f8d2ce14.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($1,339) is sloping down and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the negative territory, indicating that bears are in control. The sellers will try to stall the recovery at the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA and breaks below $1,267, it will suggest the resumption of the down move. The ETH/USDT pair could then decline to the next support at $1,109.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the triangle. That could pave the way for a possible rally to the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  formed a Doji candlestick pattern on Oct. 11, suggesting indecision among the bulls and the bears. Buyers are attempting to start a rebound from the support at $266.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/f1271320-5135-4ea8-bf1a-09e9b580c1cc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bounce is likely to face stiff resistance at the moving averages. If the price turns down from the current level or the moving averages, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to the strong support at $258. The bulls are expected to vigorously defend this level because a break and close below it could sink the pair to $216.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns up and breaks above the moving averages. That could clear the path for a potential rally to the stiff overhead resistance at $300.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) failure to clear the overhead hurdle at $0.56 on Oct. 9 may have attracted profit-booking by the short-term traders. That pulled the price to the 20-day EMA ($0.47) on Oct. 11.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/eae7053d-64fa-46c3-9c87-29d34affd03c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the rebound fails to climb above $0.51, it will suggest that the bulls are not viewing the dip as a buying opportunity. That could increase the odds of a break below the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the selling could intensify and the XRP/USDT pair may drop to the breakout level of $0.41. The bulls are likely to forcefully defend this level.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up and rises above $0.51, the bulls will again strive to drive the pair above $0.56. If they can pull it off, the pair could rally to $0.66.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned down sharply and broke below the critical support of $0.40 on Oct. 10. That was followed by further selling on Oct. 11, which pulled the price to $0.38. The break and close below $0.40 signal the start of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/212a7f6b-e5f8-4677-a6c0-06a204ee124f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers have an opportunity to salvage the situation by quickly pushing the price above the breakdown level of $0.40. That could trap the aggressive bears and the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to the 20-day EMA ($0.42).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from $0.40, it will suggest that bears have flipped the level into resistance. That could enhance the prospects of the continuation of the downtrend toward the next major support at $0.33.\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rose above the moving averages on Oct. 10 but that proved to be a bear trap. The price quickly turned down and dipped below the support at $31.65 on Oct. 11.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/e1f6360d-da6f-42e5-ad9d-474381151c2b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers purchased the drop and are attempting to push the price back above the breakdown level of $31.65. If they manage to do that, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair will again rise to the moving averages. The bears may again try to stall the recovery at this level.\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory suggest that bears have the upper hand. A break and close below the support at $30 could increase the likelihood of a drop to the vital support at $26.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) dropped close to the support line on Oct. 11. This attracted buying by the bulls as seen from the long tail on the candlestick. Buyers are trying to push the price back above the moving averages on Oct. 12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/cecd3b5d-af61-409b-b478-8adb2ff31fe5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair could rise to the overhead resistance at $0.07. This level may again act as a strong barrier but if bulls overcome it, the pair could pick up momentum and rise toward $0.09.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will show that the bears continue to sell on rallies. That could again pull the price toward the support below $0.06. If this level gives way, the pair could rest the June low near $0.05.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-wobbles-on-us-ppi-as-bitcoin-futures-open-interest-hits-peak"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC price wobbles on US PPI as Bitcoin futures open interest hits peak}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) nudged above the 20-day EMA ($6.40) on Oct. 10 but the bears sold aggressively at higher levels. That pulled the price below the immediate support at $6.25.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/f56a9a4f-1311-446f-85f5-87b1762f424c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now attempt to sink the price to the critical level of $6. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if the support cracks, the DOT/USDT pair could signal the resumption of the downtrend. The next support on the downside is $5.36.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA remains the short-term resistance to watch out for on the upside. If bulls push the price above this obstacle, the pair could rally to the overhead zone between $6.64 and the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($6.79). A break above this zone could lead to a strong recovery.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) failed to break above the downtrend line on Oct. 10, indicating that bears continue to defend the level with vigor. That may have attracted profit-booking by short-term traders, which pulled the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.80) on Oct. 11.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/2c30b6d0-d680-4154-95db-8a95da84608b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers are trying to arrest the decline and push the price back above the moving averages. If they do that, the bulls may make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at the downtrend line. The repeated retest of a resistance level tends to weaken it.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks and sustains above the downtrend line, the MATIC/USDT pair could attempt a rally to $0.94. On the other hand, if the price turns down from the moving averages or the downtrend line, the pair could drop to $0.75 and then to $0.69.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) turned down sharply from the 20-day EMA ($0.000011) on Oct. 10 and slipped below the immediate support at $0.000010 on Oct. 11. A minor positive is that lower levels attracted buying.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/aa2f6553-3f57-4109-8eb4-d0be671eacb8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is sloping down and the RSI is in the negative territory, indicating advantage to bears. The current rebound could again face strong selling at the 20-day EMA. If the price turns down from this resistance, the possibility of a break below $0.000010 increases. The SHIB/USDT pair could then start its decline toward $0.000007.\par \par \uc2 To avoid this \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view, buyers will have to push and sustain the price above the moving averages. That could open the doors for a possible rise to $0.000014.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTAvNjMwNGU0YzQtZTc3MC00OWY3LTkwNjktZDE4ZGE5ZmU2MTg5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221012eiac000e8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 SOL\uc2 , DOGE, DOT, MATIC, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,756 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 October 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins are stuck in a range as investors await the release of the October 13 CPI data.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  has been aggressively hiking rates in an attempt to cool down inflation and that has kept the U.S. equities markets under pressure. Investors have been closely watching the inflation figures for early signs of topping out but to no avail.\par \par \uc2 Wholesale prices {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2022/10/12/producer-price-index-september-2022.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rose}}}\uc2  0.4% in September, exceeding the Dow Jones' estimate for a 0.2% gain. This suggests that inflation is yet to respond to the Fed\u8217\'20\'19s monetary tightening. All eyes will now be fixed on the Consumer Price Index data to be released on Oct. 13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/f441a94a-096e-41c0-9764-d9db34150d5b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Equity traders can expect \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  to pick up following the release of the numbers but for the crypto traders, it is difficult to predict whether this trigger is sufficient for Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) to break out of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-analysts-and-traders-say-btc-s-low-volatility-is-a-calm-before-the-storm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the $18,500 to $24,500 range}}}\uc2  it has been stuck in for the past several days.\par \par \uc2 What are the critical levels on the upside and downside that could signal the start of a trending move in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is attempting to bounce off the first support at $18,843 but the relief rally is likely to hit a wall at the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($19,482). If the price turns down from this resistance, it will suggest that bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/c0abbf57-9161-4fa9-b472-de5c2886ebb2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break and close below $18,843 could pull the price to the $18,125 to $17,622 support zone. Bulls are expected to defend this zone with all their might because if they fail to do that, the BTC/USDT pair could resume its downtrend. The pair could then drop to $15,800 and later to $15,000.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of relief for the bulls will be a break above the downtrend line and the recovery could pick up steam after the pair rises above $20,500. That could set the stage for a possible rally to $22,800.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the symmetrical triangle on Oct. 11 but a positive sign is that the bulls purchased the dip and are trying to push the price back into the triangle on Oct. 12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/ed87e846-5e2d-45da-bd57-7111f8d2ce14.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($1,339) is sloping down and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the negative territory, indicating that bears are in control. The sellers will try to stall the recovery at the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA and breaks below $1,267, it will suggest the resumption of the down move. The ETH/USDT pair could then decline to the next support at $1,109.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the triangle. That could pave the way for a possible rally to the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  formed a Doji candlestick pattern on Oct. 11, suggesting indecision among the bulls and the bears. Buyers are attempting to start a rebound from the support at $266.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/f1271320-5135-4ea8-bf1a-09e9b580c1cc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bounce is likely to face stiff resistance at the moving averages. If the price turns down from the current level or the moving averages, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to the strong support at $258. The bulls are expected to vigorously defend this level because a break and close below it could sink the pair to $216.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns up and breaks above the moving averages. That could clear the path for a potential rally to the stiff overhead resistance at $300.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) failure to clear the overhead hurdle at $0.56 on Oct. 9 may have attracted profit-booking by the short-term traders. That pulled the price to the 20-day EMA ($0.47) on Oct. 11.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/eae7053d-64fa-46c3-9c87-29d34affd03c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the rebound fails to climb above $0.51, it will suggest that the bulls are not viewing the dip as a buying opportunity. That could increase the odds of a break below the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the selling could intensify and the XRP/USDT pair may drop to the breakout level of $0.41. The bulls are likely to forcefully defend this level.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up and rises above $0.51, the bulls will again strive to drive the pair above $0.56. If they can pull it off, the pair could rally to $0.66.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned down sharply and broke below the critical support of $0.40 on Oct. 10. That was followed by further selling on Oct. 11, which pulled the price to $0.38. The break and close below $0.40 signals the start of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/212a7f6b-e5f8-4677-a6c0-06a204ee124f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers have an opportunity to salvage the situation by quickly pushing the price above the breakdown level of $0.40. That could trap the aggressive bears and the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to the 20-day EMA ($0.42).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from $0.40, it will suggest that bears have flipped the level into resistance. That could enhance the prospects of the continuation of the downtrend toward the next major support at $0.33.\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rose above the moving averages on Oct. 10 but that proved to be a bear trap. The price quickly turned down and dipped below the support at $31.65 on Oct. 11.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/e1f6360d-da6f-42e5-ad9d-474381151c2b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers purchased the drop and are attempting to push the price back above the breakdown level of $31.65. If they manage to do that, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair will again rise to the moving averages. The bears may again try to stall the recovery at this level.\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory suggest that bears have the upper hand. A break and close below the support at $30 could increase the likelihood of a drop to the vital support at $26.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) dropped close to the support line on Oct. 11. This attracted buying by the bulls as seen from the long tail on the candlestick. Buyers are trying to push the price back above the moving averages on Oct. 12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/cecd3b5d-af61-409b-b478-8adb2ff31fe5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair could rise to the overhead resistance at $0.07. This level may again act as a strong barrier but if bulls overcome it, the pair could pick up momentum and rise toward $0.09.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will show that the bears continue to sell on rallies. That could again pull the price toward the support below $0.06. If this level gives way, the pair could rest the June low near $0.05.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-wobbles-on-us-ppi-as-bitcoin-futures-open-interest-hits-peak"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC price wobbles on US PPI as Bitcoin futures open interest hits peak}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) nudged above the 20-day EMA ($6.40) on Oct. 10 but the bears sold aggressively at higher levels. That pulled the price below the immediate support at $6.25.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/f56a9a4f-1311-446f-85f5-87b1762f424c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now attempt to sink the price to the critical level of $6. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if the support cracks, the DOT/USDT pair could signal the resumption of the downtrend. The next support on the downside is $5.36.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA remains the short-term resistance to watch out for on the upside. If bulls push the price above this obstacle, the pair could rally to the overhead zone between $6.64 and the 50-day simple moving average ($6.79). A break above this zone could lead to a strong recovery.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) failed to break above the downtrend line on Oct. 10, indicating that bears continue to defend the level with vigor. That may have attracted profit-booking by short-term traders which pulled the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.80) on Oct. 11.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/2c30b6d0-d680-4154-95db-8a95da84608b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers are trying to arrest the decline and push the price back above the moving averages. If they do that, the bulls may make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at the downtrend line. The repeated retest of a resistance level tends to weaken it.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks and sustains above the downtrend line, the MATIC/USDT pair could attempt a rally to $0.94. On the other hand, if the price turns down from the moving averages or the downtrend line, the pair could drop to $0.75 and then to $0.69.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) turned down sharply from the 20-day EMA ($0.000011) on Oct. 10 and slipped below the immediate support at $0.000010 on Oct. 11. A minor positive is that lower levels attracted buying.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/aa2f6553-3f57-4109-8eb4-d0be671eacb8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is sloping down and the RSI is in the negative territory, indicating advantage to bears. The current rebound could again face strong selling at the 20-day EMA. If the price turns down from this resistance, the possibility of a break below $0.000010 increases. The SHIB/USDT pair could then start its decline toward $0.000007.\par \par \uc2 To avoid this \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view, buyers will have to push and sustain the price above the moving averages. That could open the doors for a possible rise to $0.000014.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTAvNjMwNGU0YzQtZTc3MC00OWY3LTkwNjktZDE4ZGE5ZmU2MTg5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221012eiac000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/10: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, MATIC, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,725 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 October 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has stayed above $19,000 even as the Nasdaq hit a two-year low, indicating the possibility of further near-term outperformance.\par \par \uc2 The United States equities markets have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2022/10/09/stock-futures-are-down-as-market-exits-rollercoaster-week.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 started}}}\uc2  the week on a weak note as investors remain unconvinced that the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  will pull back its aggressive monetary policy. The Nasdaq Composite index fell to its lowest level since September 2020.\par \par \uc2 All eyes will be fixated on the U.S. Consumer Price Index data for September to be released on Oct. 13 as that could influence the Fed\u8217\'20\'19s decision on the size of the rate hike in the next meeting in November.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/cb6e2042-7bd2-4898-b0e4-49f5c855d701.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Depending on how the market perceives the reading, legacy markets and the cryptocurrency markets may {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-poised-for-very-big-move-as-cpi-due-to-spark-volatility"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 witness a pick-up in \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 . A minor positive for the bulls is that Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has not tested its June lows and has outperformed the Nasdaq and the S&P 500 in the short term.\par \par \uc2 A positive trigger could start a strong recovery in Bitcoin and select altcoins. Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to determine the key resistance levels to watch out for.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke below the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($19,584) on Oct. 7 and then successfully defended the level between Oct. 8 to 10. The sellers are trying to strengthen their position further by pulling the price below the uptrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/3816ed5d-59e4-4f1d-a952-b56d50642a0f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the BTC/USDT pair could drop to the $18,125 to $17,622 support zone. Buyers are likely to defend this zone with all their might because if they fail to do that, the pair could start the next leg of the downtrend. The pair could then plummet to $15,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price rebounds off the uptrend line, the bulls will try to push the pair above the moving averages and challenge the downtrend line. A break and close above this level will be the first indication that the bears may be losing their grip. The pair could then attempt a rally to $22,800.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is struggling to rise above the 20-day EMA ($1,351). This suggests that the bears are selling on rallies and will try to sink the price to the strong support at $1,220.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/7a0b9539-fae1-4aa6-9d43-dbacee952ff5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The gradually downsloping 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) in the negative territory indicate an advantage to bears. If the price slips below $1,220, the selling could intensify and the ETH/USDT pair may drop to the support line of the descending channel pattern.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rise to $1,410. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the channel to signal a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  has been trading between $258 and $300 for the past several days. The break below the moving averages on Oct. 8 paves the way for a possible decline to the strong support at $258.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/49c9049e-4607-492e-90b8-bb8da00ee4f7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $258, it will suggest that the range-bound action may continue for some more time. The longer the time spent in the range, the stronger will be the eventual breakout from it.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move will begin on a break above $300 or a drop below $258. It is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout with certainty. Therefore, it is better to wait for the breakout to happen before taking directional bets.\par \par \uc2 If the price plummets below $258, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to $216. On the other hand, a break above $300 could push the pair to $342.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  above the overhead resistance of $0.56 but the bears did not budge. The sellers will attempt to pull the price to the 20-day EMA ($0.47).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/9ff0d556-512d-41a7-9571-229095eedf2b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to maintain the upper hand, they will have to buy the dips to the 20-day EMA. If the price rebounds off this support with strength, the likelihood of a break above $0.56 increases. The pair could then resume its uptrend and rally to $0.66.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could be invalidated if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. The XRP/USDT pair could then decline to the breakout level of $0.41. A bounce off this support will indicate that the pair may remain stuck between $0.41 and $0.56 for some time.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been gradually sliding toward the vital support at $0.40. This level has held on two previous occasions; hence, the bulls are again expected to mount a strong defense at this support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/e1a34482-f540-4fc8-8efa-417e36d1b75b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Any rebound is likely to face selling at the 20-day EMA ($0.43) and again at the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($0.45). The bulls will have to clear this resistance to indicate the start of a possible sustained recovery. The pair could then rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price breaks below the support at $0.40, it will signal the resumption of the downtrend. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then decline to the strong support at $0.33 where buying is likely to emerge.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been oscillating between $31.65 and $35.50 for the past few days. The flattish moving averages and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/1d436989-0caf-47b8-8625-d3c467a51632.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the overhead resistance at $35.50. If this level is crossed, the SOL/USDT pair could attempt a rally to $39. The previous recovery had stalled at this level; hence, the bears will again try to defend this level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the zone between $31.65 and $30 is likely to attract strong buying by the bulls. If bears want to keep control, they will have to sink the price below $30. That could extend the decline to the next support at $26.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) tumbled and closed below the 20-day EMA ($0.06) on Oct. 8 and the bulls failed to push the price back above the 50-day SMA ($0.06) on Oct. 9.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/8ed1bc04-85af-4218-ab44-7e7dc4b9a8a1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling resumed on Oct. 10 and the bears will now attempt to sink the price to the support near $0.06. Buyers had successfully defended this support on Sept. 19 and again on Sept. 21; hence, the bulls are likely to buy the dip to this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level or the support, the bulls will try to push the DOGE/USDT pair to the overhead resistance at $0.07. The next major trending move could begin on a break above $0.07 or below $0.05.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-traders-expect-sharp-volatility-here-s-how-to-profit-from-it"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin traders expect sharp \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22 , here\u8217\'20\'19s how to profit from it}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating between $6 and $6.64 for the past few days. The bears are trying to further cement their advantage by not allowing the price to rise above the 20-day EMA ($6.46).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/4c3b7dc6-1c60-4b70-867f-94e4acb17ff4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price continues lower and breaks below $6.25, the DOT/USDT pair could retest the crucial support at $6. If this level cracks, the pair could start the next leg of the downtrend. The pair could then slide to $5.36.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to negate this \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view, they will have to quickly push the price above the resistance zone between $6.64 and the 50-day SMA ($6.85). If they succeed, the pair could pick up speed and rally toward the next resistance at $8.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the downtrend line but the bears could not sink the price below the moving averages. This suggests that bulls are buying the dips to the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/2cfcb54d-d62c-46e2-9d5a-bbf170801bbf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to push and sustain the price above the downtrend line to indicate a potential change in the short-term trend. The MATIC/USDT pair could then attempt a rally to $0.94 where it may again encounter selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the moving averages, it could tilt the short-term advantage in favor of the bears. The pair could then decline to $0.75 where buying is likely to emerge.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the 20-day EMA ($0.000011) on Oct. 6. Buyers attempted to push the price back above the 20-day EMA on Oct. 9 and 10 but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/4b649651-2f51-4b97-a2be-54149ca097d4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The SHIB/USDT pair has strong support in the zone between $0.000011 and $0.000010. If the price rebounds off this zone, the bulls will again try to thrust the pair above the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the 50-day SMA ($0.000012) will suggest that the recovery may be picking up steam. The pair could then rise to $0.000014.\par \par \uc2 The bears may find it difficult to sink the price below the psychological support at $0.000010 but if they manage to do that, the pair could decline toward $0.000007.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTAvN2YzNzFlMjUtZWQyNS00Yzg3LTk3NmUtNDhmYTZkZTRmNjI4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221010eiaa000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 10/7: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 SOL\uc2 , DOGE, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,933 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 October 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 A relief rally in U.S. equities markets and Bitcoin could be delayed due to investors' fear the Fed will continue its aggressive rate hikes.\par \par \uc2 The United States nonfarm payrolls {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2022/10/07/jobs-report-september-2022.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increased}}}\uc2  by 263,000 in September, marginally below the Dow Jones estimate of 275,000, but the unemployment rate dropped to 3.5% compared to the forecast of 3.7%.\par \par \uc2 Some analysts believe the report shows that the jobs market remains strong in spite of the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s efforts to slow down the economy and that could encourage the Fed to go ahead with another aggressive rate hike in its next meeting in November. This led to a sharp fall in the U.S. equities markets on Oct. 7.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/b1c91776-6d8b-4083-8aea-ac6ec0b012b7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Although Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has traded in close correlation with the U.S. equities markets for most of 2022, it could {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-to-outperform-most-major-assets-in-h2-2022-bloomberg-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 change in the second half of the year}}}\uc2  and Bitcoin could \u8220\'20\'1Cshift toward becoming a risk-off asset, like gold and \uc2 US Treasury\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s,\u8221\'20\'1D said Bloomberg Intelligence senior commodity strategist \uc2 Mike McGlone\uc2  in the Oct. 5 Bloomberg Crypto Outlook report.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the S&P 500 index, the U.S. dollar index (DXY) and the major cryptocurrencies to determine the short-term price outlook.\par \par \uc2 SPX\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 index (SPX) plunged and closed below the June low of $3,636 on Sept. 30, but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. Buyers aggressively purchased the dip and pushed the price back above the breakdown level of $3,636 on Oct. 3. This may have caught the aggressive bears off-guard resulting in a short squeeze, which pushed the price to the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($3,779) on Oct. 4.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/16c8dbe5-679d-4b2b-9747-5422a45f068a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 In a bear market, experienced traders continue to sell on rallies and that is what happened with the index. The bears stalled the recovery at the 20-day EMA and the price turned down sharply on Oct. 7.\par \par \uc2 The zone between $3,636 and $3,584 is vital for the bulls to defend because a break and close below it could signal the resumption of the downtrend. The index could then decline to $3,500 and thereafter to $3,325.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the support zone, it will suggest accumulation by the bulls at lower levels. Buyers will then again try to push the price above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the index could rise to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to overcome this barrier to indicate that the short-term corrective phase may be over. The index could then start a rally to $4,100.\par \par \uc2 DXY\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar index remains in a strong uptrend. The sellers pulled the price below the 20-day EMA (111) on Oct. 4 but could not sustain the lower levels. Aggressive buying on dips pushed the price back above the 20-day EMA on Oct. 5.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/892b98be-063a-4791-820e-90b9e9db49a6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to stall the up-move in the zone between the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $112.41 and the 61.8% retracement level of $112.96. If the price turns down sharply from this zone, it will suggest that traders are selling on rallies. That could again pull the price to the 20-day EMA and then to $110.05.\par \par \uc2 If the support at $110.05 gives way, it will suggest that the short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. The price could then drop to the uptrend line. A close below this support could indicate that the index may have topped out.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if bulls drive the price above $112.96, the index could retest the multi-year high at $114.77. A break above this resistance could suggest the resumption of the uptrend. The next target on the upside is $117.14.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s relief rally is facing strong resistance in the zone between the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($20,019) and the downtrend line. This shows that bears are selling on rallies and will try to pull the price to $18,626.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/49a32f45-d344-4a59-88bf-92b88dfe9f3a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The repeated retest of a support level tends to weaken it. If bears sink the price below the strong support at $18,626, the BTC/USDT pair may witness panic selling. That could open the doors for a possible retest of the June low at $17,622.\par \par \uc2 To invalidate this \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view, the bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the downtrend line. If that happens, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up and the pair could rally to $22,799. The bears may pose a strong challenge at this level.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the 20-day EMA ($1,364) since Oct. 4. The bears are defending the level but a positive sign is that the bulls have not given up much ground. This suggests that buyers expect the recovery to extend further.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/63ff8b93-285c-4df9-b113-f345faf47161.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers thrust the price above the 20-day EMA and the horizontal resistance at $1,410, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to the resistance line of the descending channel. This level may attract strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from the resistance line, it will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the channel for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may pick up after bulls propel the price above the channel. Alternatively, the selling could intensify if bears sink the price below the $1,220 support.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  broke above the moving averages on Oct. 3 but the bulls could not push the price above the next hurdle at $300. This suggests that bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/da9487a4-e5eb-4acb-9dc3-609c4af1511c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below the moving averages, it will suggest that the BNB/USDT pair could remain stuck between $258 and $300 for some more time. The flattening 20-day EMA ($283) and the relative strength index (RSI) near the midpoint hint at a consolidation in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will again attempt to force the price above the overhead resistance zone between $300 and $308. If they manage to do that, the pair could rally to the stiff overhead resistance at $338.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has been attempting to clear the first overhead hurdle near $0.51 and retest the intraday high of $0.56 made on Sept. 23. This is the critical level to watch on the upside because a break above it could signal the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/04a64a4a-af09-4e96-b272-026cc6ccde9e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers push the price above $0.56, the XRP/USDT pair could further pick up momentum and rally to $0.66.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance at $0.56, the bears will attempt to pull the pair to the 20-day EMA. A strong rebound off this level could keep the advantage in favor of the buyers but a break below this support could pull the pair to $0.41.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke below the uptrend line on Sept. 30 and the bears successfully defended the level during the retest from Oct. 4\u8211\'20\'136. This suggests that bears have flipped the uptrend line into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/43c2230a-3c36-4c6f-a795-006e4dae9d04.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will attempt to challenge the crucial support at $0.40. If this support breaks down, the selling could pick up momentum and the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could start the next leg of the downtrend. The pair could then decline to $0.35.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to avoid another leg down, they will have to quickly push the price above the moving averages. If that happens, the pair could climb to the downtrend line. Buyers will have to surpass this obstacle to suggest a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-the-crypto-market-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is the crypto market down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rose above the moving averages on Oct. 4 but the bulls could not build upon this strength. This suggests that bears continue to view rallies as a selling opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/5c9475bf-39a5-413c-9a93-2254de4eead9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($33.17) is flat and the RSI is near the midpoint, suggesting a balance between supply and demand. If the price sustains below the moving averages, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could decline to $31.65. If the price rebounds off the support with strength, it will suggest the range-bound action may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to push the price above the overhead resistance at $35.50 to clear the path for a possible rally to $39. On the other hand, if the price slips below $31.65, the pair could retest the important support at $30.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) soared above the moving averages on Oct. 4 but the bulls could not extend the momentum. The price turned down from $0.07 and has reached the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/78df7a62-af6f-443c-b560-92fcf4b67615.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the moving averages with strength, it will suggest that the bulls are attempting to form a higher low. The buyers will then try to push the price above $0.07 and seize the advantage in the near term. As there is no major resistance between $0.07 and $0.09, the DOGE/USDT pair may cover this journey quickly.\par \par \uc2 In contrast, if the price breaks below the moving averages, the bears will again try to sink the pair below the support near $0.06. The break below this support may pull the pair to the June low near $0.05.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) ascended above the moving averages on Oct. 4 and reached the downtrend line on Oct. 5. The bears are trying to stall the recovery at the downtrend line but a minor positive is that the bulls have not ceded ground to the sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-10/842e3ede-a180-4ac9-abe7-5c14511adac1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.80) is gradually sloping up and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating that bulls have the upper hand. This improves the prospects of a break above the downtrend line. If that happens, the MATIC/USDT pair could rise to $0.94 and thereafter to $1.05.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. The pair could then decline to the strong support at $0.69. The bears will have to pull the price below this level to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by HitBTC exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTAvNWEyODc5M2MtOGI0YS00NDZkLTlmZDgtNWYzOWRmMzc4Mzg3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020221007eia7000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
