\par\par \b \uc2 Uniglo.io (GLO) Price Surge Leads To Outstanding Gains For Holders Outperforming Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) And Solana (SOL)\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 619 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 October 2022\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2022, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 A little-known DeFi token called Uniglo (GLO) has been outperforming leaders like Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ). In fact, GLO is up 45% and hasn\u8217\'20\'19t seen a red candle in two months. And it\u8217\'20\'19s expected to maintain its value for the next months as well. How is it possible for a cryptocurrency to have not seen a red candle in months? It\u8217\'20\'19s because you won\u8217\'20\'19t find it on exchanges. Uniglo is currently hosting a private initial coin offering. \u8220\'20\'1CNo fair,\u8221\'20\'1D you\u8217\'20\'19re saying, \u8220\'20\'1Cif it can\u8217\'20\'19t be sold, then it doesn\u8217\'20\'19t count.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 That\u8217\'20\'19s not entirely true because Uniglo tokenomics are designed in such a way as to minimize \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  even after it hits the market. In fact not only is the GLO token supply eternally deflationary, but the treasury that backs GLO will be eternally growing. And the more volatile the markets become, the faster GLO grows.\par \par \uc2 This neat trick is made possible by borrowing a mechanism from the world of NFTs called royalties. Whenever anyone buys or sells GLO 5% is collected by the treasury, 2% is burned automatically, and 3% goes toward operations and marketing to grow the community. Thus, no matter whether we\u8217\'20\'19re in a bear market or a bull market the treasury is growing and the supply of the token is shrinking. And the more the price swings, the faster money goes into the treasury.\par \par \uc2 So, what do we mean by \u8220\'20\'1Ccommunity\u8221\'20\'1D? Uniglo is a DAO, a decentralized autonomous organization. That means that it\u8217\'20\'19s run not by a board and shareholders and C-suite executives but rather by holders of the GLO token. All holders get to vote on the investment activities of the DAO including how the treasury is invested, when to sell an asset, and when to buy back tokens off exchanges.\par \par \uc2 The treasury can be invested into anything that can be tokenized. Unlike DAOs such as BitDAO which is focused solely on investing in Web3 projects and will go up and down in price with the market, the GLO treasury will be invested in a wide array of assets with high potential for long-term appreciation. Alongside cryptocurrencies and investment-grade NFTs, this could include tokenized equities and even real-world assets like real estate and gold.\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s been proven time and time again that slow and steady dollar-cost averaging and long-term holding outperform any other investment schemes. And Uniglo is aimed squarely at long-term investors. The 10% royalty not only keeps the snowball growing but it also discourages speculative trading while encouraging early adoption and hodling. And it\u8217\'20\'19s the ICO investors who will benefit the most from this project.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 ICO\uc2  runs up until the platform launch in mid-November. That is if it hasn\u8217\'20\'19t sold out by then. And we do expect it to sell out, so if you\u8217\'20\'19re interested in doing more research head on over to the uniglo.io website and check out their whitepaper. While you\u8217\'20\'19re there, you can pick up some GLO for just $0.0145. Even a small investment today could turn into a heap of value over the coming years and decades.\par \par \uc2 Learn more here\par \par \uc2 Join Presale: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://presale.uniglo.io/register"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://presale.uniglo.io/register}}}\par \par \uc2 Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://uniglo.io"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://uniglo.io}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/GloFoundation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/GloFoundation}}}\par \par \uc2 Discord: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://discord.gg/a38KRnjQvW"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://discord.gg/a38KRnjQvW}}}\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/GloFoundation1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://twitter.com/GloFoundation1}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020221003eia30005l\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/30: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,892 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 September 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Equities markets have extended their decline, but Bitcoin and select altcoins have not given up much ground. Some think the bottom is in.\par \par \uc2 The United States equities markets have been under a firm bear grip for a large part of the year. The S&P 500 and the Nasdaq Composite have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2022/09/29/stock-futures-are-flat-following-thursdays-broad-sell-off.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 declined}}}\uc2  for three quarters in a row, a first since 2009. There was no respite in selling in September and the Dow Jones Industrial Average is on track to record its worst September since 2002. These figures outline the kind of carnage that exists in the equities market.\par \par \uc2 Compared to these disappointing figures, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and select altcoins have not given up much ground in September. This is the first sign that selling could be drying up at lower levels and long-term investors may have started bottom fishing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/c2fce537-8e55-4d69-850e-2424a1995288.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 In the final quarter of the year, investors will continue to focus on the inflation data. Any indication of inflation topping could bring about a sharp recovery in risk assets, but if inflation remains stubbornly high, then a round of sell-offs could follow.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the S&P 500 index, the U.S. dollar index (DXY) and the major cryptocurrencies to determine if a recovery is on the cards.\par \par \uc2 SPX\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 index (SPX) has been under intense selling pressure for the past few days but the bulls have held their ground. This indicates that bulls are buying the dips near $3,636.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/517d7d6b-a276-48ed-963e-69b5ca4153d5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The first resistance on the upside is $3,737. If bulls thrust the price above this level, the index could rise to the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($3,818). In a downtrend, this is the important level to keep an eye on because a break and close above it will suggest that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 Sharp declines are usually followed by strong rallies. That could carry the index to the downtrend line and then to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($4,012).\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to extend the downtrend by sinking and sustaining the price below $3,636. If they manage to do that, the index could plummet to $3,500 and later to $3,325.\par \par \uc2 DXY\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar index surged to $114.77 on Sept. 28, which pushed the relative strength index (RSI) into deeply overbought territory. This may have attracted profit-booking by the short-term traders that pulled the price near the 20-day EMA (111).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/26d00886-d09a-4c64-9709-999163c33b67.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to yank the price below the 20-day EMA to suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could be weakening. That could clear the path for a possible drop to the 50-day SMA (108).\par \par \uc2 The zone between the 50-day SMA and the uptrend line is likely to witness aggressive buying by the bulls because if they fail to defend the zone, it will indicate that the index may have topped out.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the bulls continue to buy on dips. Buyers will then again attempt to thrust the price above $114.77 and resume the uptrend. The next target objective on the upside is $118.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bounced off the strong support at $18,626 on Sept. 28, indicating that the bulls continue to fiercely defend this level. The long tail on the candlestick of the past two days shows that bulls are buying the intraday dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/df7a464b-3379-4699-b5fe-c9071c46be80.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price above the 20-day EMA ($19,602) on Sept. 30 but are struggling to sustain the higher levels. This shows that bears are selling near the 50-day SMA ($20,621).\par \par \uc2 If bulls do not allow the price to drop below the 20-day EMA, the likelihood of a rally to the downtrend line increases. The bears are expected to mount a strong resistance at this level but if bulls clear this hurdle, the BTC/USDT pair could signal a short-term trend change. The pair could then rise to $22,799.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level or the 50-day SMA ($20,625), the pair could again drop to the $18,626 to $17,622 support zone.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been declining in a descending channel pattern for the past several days. In the short term, the price has been stuck between $1,250 and $1,410, indicating demand at lower levels but selling near the resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/0baa3f74-1324-4bc8-a455-c8ea1cc10150.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price action inside the range is usually random and volatile. Hence, it is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout with certainty.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks above $1,410, it will suggest that the bulls have absorbed the supply. That could propel the price to the resistance line of the channel. The bulls will have to overcome this barrier to suggest a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down and breaks below $1,250, the bears will attempt to cement their advantage by pulling the ETH/USDT pair below the channel. If they succeed, the pair could drop to $1,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  turned up sharply from $266 and broke above the 20-day EMA ($278) on Sept. 28. This indicates that lower levels are attracting strong buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/45d45514-9e46-4e13-99c3-6f22b219e5e1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price above the resistance line of the descending channel on Sept. 29 but are facing resistance at the 50-day SMA ($288). If bulls do not allow the price to plummet back below the 20-day EMA, it will improve the prospects of a break above the 50-day SMA. The BNB/USDT pair could then rally to $300 and later to $338.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears continue to sell at higher levels. The pair could then decline to the strong support at $258.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($0.43) on Sept. 28, indicating a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips. However, the bears are unlikely to give up as they will try to stall the recovery in the $0.52 to $0.56 zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/60134546-d367-4265-80cc-0a53edb89a56.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers do not give up much ground from the current level, the possibility of a break above the overhead zone increases. A break above $0.56 will signal the resumption of the uptrend. The XRP/USDT pair could then rise to $0.66.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price continues lower, the pair could drop to the breakout level of $0.41. The bulls are likely to defend this level vigorously. If the price rebounds off this level, the pair may enter a range-bound action for a few days.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) Sept. 28 and 29 candlestick shows that the bulls bought at lower levels in an attempt to defend the uptrend line. Although the price rose above the uptrend line on Sept. 29, buyers could not sustain the recovery.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/add02720-8133-4585-ad0e-906ea77303fb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has again tumbled below the uptrend line on Sept. 30. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory suggest that the path of least resistance is to the downside. If the price breaks below $0.42, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could decline to the crucial support at $0.40. The bulls are expected to defend this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up from the current level and closes above the uptrend line, it will suggest strong buying at lower levels. The bulls will then again try to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.45) and challenge the resistance at the 50-day SMA ($0.47).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-surges-above-20k-after-6-btc-rally-gains-steam-ahead-of-the-monthly-close"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin surges above $20K after 6% BTC rally gains steam ahead of the monthly close}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Buyers are attempting to form a higher low in Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ). The price rebounded off $31.65 on Sept. 28 and reached the 50-day SMA ($34.70) on Sept. 30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/6451708f-eff8-4296-9b3f-7d91c20f494e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($33.30) is trying to turn up and the RSI is just above the midpoint, suggesting that the bulls are attempting a comeback. If the price breaks and sustains above the 50-day SMA, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up and the SOL/USDT pair could rally to $39. The bears are expected to mount a strong resistance at this level.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the 50-day SMA, the pair could drop to $31.65. A break below this support could sink the pair to $30.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) dipped below the 20-day EMA ($0.06) on Sept. 25 and the bears thwarted attempts by the bulls to resume the recovery on Sept. 27.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/f5ca3df7-6ae8-4eae-8be8-fbc6a16fb062.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattish and the RSI is just below the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. This balance could tilt in favor of the bears if they sink the price below the support near $0.06. The price could then plunge to $0.05.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will gain the upper hand if they drive and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.06). The DOGE/USDT pair could then attempt a rally to $0.07 where the bears may again mount a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been trading in a tight range between $6 and $6.64 for the past few days. This indicates a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/25ba5611-c412-4117-ac89-cd035b6263d2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The gradually downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory suggest that bears have a slight edge. If the price drops below $6, the DOT/USDT pair could start the next leg of the downtrend. The pair could then slide to $4.\par \par \uc2 To invalidate this negative bias, bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($6.64). If they do that, it will suggest that the consolidation near the support may have been an accumulation phase. The pair could then rise to the 50-day SMA ($7.26) and later to $8.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by HitBTC exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDkvNjM0NDhiYTktNmU3NS00NTIyLTk3NmYtMmE3ZmUzOTk3NWZlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220930ei9u000e5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/28: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, MATIC, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,884 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 September 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC price caught a bid, leading to a like-sized boost in select altcoins, but on a macro level, $20,000 remains a strong overhead resistance.\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 fell for six days in a row and made a new year-to-date low on Sept. 27, but Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) maintained its outperformance and stayed well above its June low. This could be a positive sign because markets that show strength on the way down are the ones that outperform in the event of a recovery.\par \par \uc2 The United States equities markets {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2022/09/27/stock-market-news-open-to-close-futures-live-updates.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rebounded}}}\uc2  sharply on Sept. 28 after the \uc2 Bank of England\uc2  announced a bond-buying program and the \uc2 U.S. Treasury\uc2  yields pulled back from multi-year highs. As this occurred, strong buying in Bitcoin took place, but BTC was unable to break above its overhead resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/5168f675-cd64-4629-8f82-84da78e18ec5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 A ray of hope for cryptocurrency traders is that October has historically been a strong month for Bitcoin. Barring 2014 and 2018, Bitcoin has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-gains-5-to-reclaim-20k-eyes-first-green-september-since-2016"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 managed a positive close in October}}}\uc2  every year since 2013, according to data from Coinglass.\par \par \uc2 Although history favors a bounce in October, traders should be careful because the macroeconomic situation is unprecedented and remains a challenge.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins close September on a strong note? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin soared above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($19,576) on Sept. 27 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This evaporated all intraday gains. The bears pounced on this opportunity and tried to sink the price below the immediate support of $18,626 on Sept. 28 but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows strong buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/c7cfda61-229a-4d8b-ade2-416c73e8c26d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The positive divergence on the relative strength index (RSI) remains intact and is pointing to a possible recovery. If the price breaks and sustains above the 20-day EMA, the likelihood of a rally to the downtrend line increases. The bears are likely to defend this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the downtrend line, the BTC/USDT pair could drop to the 20-day EMA. A bounce off this level will suggest that the sentiment could be changing from selling on rallies to buying on dips. If buyers push the price above the downtrend line, the pair could reach $22,799.\par \par \uc2 To invalidate this \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  bias, the bears will have to sink the price below $18,125. The pair could then retest the June low of $17,622. A break below this support could signal the resumption of the downtrend. The pair could then decline to $14,500.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down sharply from the 20-day EMA ($1,411) on Sept. 27 but rebounded off the $1,262 support on Sept. 28. This shows that bears are selling on rallies and bulls are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/9debb72b-824c-46f8-8167-ceba41350355.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair is currently stuck between $1,250 and $1,410. If bulls push the price above the overhead resistance, the pair could rally to the resistance line of the descending channel. The bulls will have to surmount this obstacle to suggest a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the support at $1,250, it will suggest that the selling pressure is building up. This could increase the likelihood of a break below the channel. The pair could then slide to the psychological level of $1,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls nudged {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  above the resistance line of the descending channel pattern on Sept. 27 but they could not go past the 50-day SMA ($287). This attracted heavy selling and the price slipped back below the 20-day EMA ($276).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/ed362289-4ca1-4215-951d-9ed32a2b85e6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the Sept. 28 candlestick shows that the bulls have not given up and may make another attempt to pierce the overhead resistance at the 50-day SMA. If they can pull it off, it will suggest a potential trend change in the short term. The BNB/USDT pair could first move up to $300 and then attempt a sprint to $338.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the recovery turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that the bears are active at higher levels. The pair could then retest the immediate support at $258.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s sharp rally to $0.56 has retraced to the breakout level of $0.41. The 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level is close to this level and the 20-day EMA ($0.41) is also nearby. Hence, buyers are likely to defend the level with all their might.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/9ec6a5d3-6212-4e11-a710-9c2cb1cd72b3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level, the XRP/USDT pair could attempt a rally to $0.47 and then to $0.52. The bears could offer a stiff resistance in this zone. If the price turns down from this zone, the pair could consolidate in a range for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The failure to defend the breakout level of $0.41 will suggest that the recent rally may have been a bear trap. The pair could then drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.37). If this support also cracks, the pair could complete a 100% retracement and tumble to $0.32.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) Sept. 27 candlestick shows that bears continue to sell the recovery to the 20-day EMA ($0.46). The bears are trying to cement their advantage by sustaining the price below the uptrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/6eb87270-d5d0-4191-9a7d-0b03f382e85d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could slide to the crucial support of $0.40. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if they fail in their endeavor, the pair could resume its downtrend. The pair could then decline to $0.33.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, buyers will have to push the price above the moving averages to suggest that the selling pressure could be reducing. The pair could then rise to the downtrend line. A break above this level could open the doors for a possible recovery to $0.60.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) attempted to break above the 50-day SMA ($35) on Sept. 27 but the bears were in no mood to let go of their advantage. They sold aggressively and pulled the price back below the 20-day EMA ($33).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/df5e7a38-0262-4606-861b-ea1102ed87a3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the SOL/USDT pair does not give up much ground from the current level, the buyers may again attempt to push the price above the 50-day SMA. The repeated retest of a resistance level tends to weaken it and improves the prospects of a break above it. If the price rises above the 50-day SMA, the pair could rally to $39.\par \par \uc2 The bears may have other plans as they will try to sink the pair to the strong support at $30. If this support collapses, the pair could retest the June low at $26.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) recovery faded just above the 50-day SMA ($0.07) on Sept. 24 and the price slipped back near the strong support at $0.06 on Sept. 28.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/d8b83946-a377-436c-a725-31bd9b103b70.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.06) is flattening out and the RSI is just below the midpoint, suggesting a balance between supply and demand. If bears want to assert their dominance, they will have to sink and sustain the price below the immediate support near $0.06. That could result in a retest of the June low near $0.05.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to tilt the advantage in their favor in the near term, they will have to push and sustain the price above the overhead resistance at $0.07. The DOGE/USDT pair could then start its journey to $0.09.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-holds-19k-but-volatility-expected-as-friday-s-2-2b-btc-options-expiry-approaches"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin holds $19K, but \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22  expected as Friday's $2.2B BTC options expiry approaches}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) rebound off the strong support at $6 fizzled out near the 20-day EMA ($6.68) on Sept. 27. This indicates that the bears have not given up and are selling on every minor rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/3ded417b-72e9-4202-b781-97dfa6554a11.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price is getting squeezed between the 20-day EMA and the support at $6. This uncertainty could resolve with a strong range breakout but it is difficult to predict the direction with certainty. Therefore, it is better to wait for the breakout to happen before taking directional bets.\par \par \uc2 If the price plummets below $6, the DOT/USDT pair could start the next leg of the downtrend and dive to $4. On the contrary, if the price explodes above the 20-day EMA, the pair could climb to the 50-day SMA ($7.37) and then to the overhead resistance at $8.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($0.78) on Sept. 27, indicating that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies to resistance levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/6ceb2a79-93a9-4100-ada1-bbee1cf0209a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will attempt to strengthen their position by pulling the price below the $0.72 to $0.69 support zone. If this zone gives way, the selling could pick up momentum and the MATIC/USDT pair could drop to $0.62. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory indicate a minor advantage to bears.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the support zone, the bulls will again try to drive the pair above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($0.84).\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the 20-day EMA ($0.000011) for the past few days, indicating that the bulls are not dumping their positions as they anticipate the price to move higher.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/67090b7f-525a-4c9a-ab85-f7863f3f4a09.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls propel the price above the 20-day EMA, the SHIB/USDT pair could rise to the overhead resistance at $0.000014. The bears may mount a strong resistance at this level but if bulls overcome this barrier, the pair could start its march toward $0.000018.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate in the near term if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the support at $0.000010. The pair could then drop toward the important support at $0.000007.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDkvNjljNGVkOTUtMjg1NC00NjAxLTk0MTYtMWJjMmEyY2E3MTBlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220928ei9s000e3\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/26: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, MATIC, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,877 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 September 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins are holding up well even as the S&P 500 retests its June lows and historic \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  hits currency markets.\par \par \uc2 The United Kingdom is in focus following the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/gbp-follows-euro-the-pound-dollar-rate-hits-all-time-low"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 British pound\u8217\'20\'19s fall to a new all-time low}}}\uc2  against the United States dollar. The sell-off was triggered by the aggressive tax cuts announced by Prime Minister \uc2 Liz Truss\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s government. The 10-year gilt yields have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2022/09/26/pound-tanking-massive-tax-cuts-and-talk-of-emergency-rate-hikes.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 soared}}}\uc2  by 131 basis points in September, on track for its biggest monthly increase since 1957, according to Reuters.\par \par \uc2 The currency crisis and the soaring U.S dollar index (DXY) may not be good news for U.S. equities and the cryptocurrency markets. A ray of hope for Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) investors is that the pace of decline has slowed down in the past few days and the June low has not yet been re-tested.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/9ee948af-c33c-4827-8bda-9b00d1c17b2d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 That could be because Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s long-term investors {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/the-bond-market-bubble-has-burst-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 do not seem to be panicking}}}\uc2 . Data from on-chain analytics firm Glassnode shows that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s Coin Days Destroyed (CDD) metric, which gives {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/the-bond-market-bubble-has-burst-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 more weightage to coins dormant}}}\uc2  for a long time, hit a new low. This indicates that coins held for the long-term \u8220\'20\'1Care the most dormant they have ever been.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins continue their short-term outperformance? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls continue to defend the $18,626 to $17,622 support zone with all their might. This is a positive sign as it shows that buyers are accumulating on dips to the support zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/3621d16e-f328-46f1-823a-4171815418e5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price rebounded off the support zone on Sept. 26 and the bulls will attempt to push the BTC/USDT pair above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($19,653). A close above this overhead resistance will be the first indication of strength. The pair could then rise to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($20,960).\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to pose a strong challenge in the zone between the 50-day SMA and $22,799. Buyers will have to thrust the price above this zone to clear the path for a possible rally to $25,211.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could be invalidated if the price turns down from the moving averages and breaks below $17,622. That could signal the start of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a tight range of $1,262 and $1,360 for the past three days. This suggests indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/4cc20aaf-df19-44e4-9c1f-43f114e429b3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls thrust the price above $1,360, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to the 20-day EMA ($1,430). This is an important level to watch out for because a break above it will suggest that the bears may be losing their grip. The pair could then rally to the resistance line of the descending channel.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from $1,360 or the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will then again try to sink the price to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  above the 20-day EMA ($276) on Sept. 24 and 25 but they could not sustain the higher levels. The price formed a Doji candlestick pattern on Sept. 25, indicating that traders are undecided about the next move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/90432c20-e4f6-4518-bf37-14f056df828b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, as the price has been trading close to the 20-day EMA for the past few days, it improves the prospects of a rally to the resistance line of the descending channel.\par \par \uc2 This level may witness aggressive selling by the bears but if bulls do not allow the price to break below the 20-day EMA, the BNB/USDT could break above the 50-day SMA ($289). Such a move could suggest a potential trend change in the near term.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA or the resistance line of the channel, the bears will try to pull the pair to the strong support at $258.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  surged to $0.56 on Sept. 23 when profit-booking set in. The bulls tried to resume the up-move on Sept. 25 but the long wick on the candlestick shows selling on intraday rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/baa084a4-b0d4-4e7d-806c-98fd8fc857c4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair could next drop to the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.44. If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will make one more attempt to push the price above $0.56 and resume the up-move to $0.66.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks below $0.44, the pair could drop to the breakout level of $0.41. The 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level is also near $0.41; hence, the bulls are likely to defend this support aggressively.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  soared above the 20-day EMA ($0.46) on Sept. 23 but the bulls could not pierce the 50-day SMA ($0.48). The long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/5e0132ab-0585-4bd1-9845-a588ebe892b2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers again tried to push the price back above the 20-day EMA on Sept. 24 and 25 but the bears held their ground. That has pulled the price to the uptrend line. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if they fail to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could slump to the vital support at $0.40.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the uptrend line, the bulls will again try to drive the pair above the downtrend line. If they manage to do that, the pair could jump to $0.52.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the 20-day EMA ($33) on Sept. 23 but the bulls could not build upon this strength. The failure to push the price above the 50-day SMA ($35) attracted selling on Sept. 24. That pulled the price back below the 20-day EMA on Sept. 25.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/392af8de-6321-4158-97e8-a922a7cb214e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls have not yet given up and are trying to push the price back above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the SOL/USDT pair could rally to the 50-day SMA. The bulls will have to surpass this obstacle to set the stage for a possible rally to $39.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that bears are in no mood to relent. That could heighten the risk of a break below $30. If that happens, the pair could retest the important support at $26.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the 20-day EMA ($0.06) on Sept. 23, which is the first sign that the selling pressure could be reducing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/8ba9f6ea-466d-4a89-a16b-17dee8ab0dd3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers maintained their momentum and propelled the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.07) on Sept. 24 but could not sustain the higher levels. This shows that the bears have not yet given up and are selling on rallies.\par \par \uc2 The price dipped back to the 20-day EMA on Sept. 25 but a minor positive is that the bulls are trying to defend this level. If bulls flip this level into support, the pair could rally to $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price continues lower and breaks below the strong support, the DOGE/USDT pair could retest the June low at $0.05.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-bulls-run-out-of-steam-after-vasil-hard-fork-40-ada-price-crash-in-play"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano bulls run out of steam after Vasil hard fork \u8212\'20\'14 40% \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  price crash in play}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) once again bounced off the critical support at $6 on Sept. 26, suggesting that bulls are defending this level aggressively. The price could jump to the 20-day EMA ($6.74) where the bears will try to stall the recovery.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/a5d4a21d-5839-4231-90b1-06957da5a06e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will increase the likelihood of a break below the support at $6. If that happens, the selling could pick up momentum and the DOT/USDT pair could resume the downtrend. The pair could then slide to $4.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent this fall, they will have to quickly push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA. The pair could then rally to the overhead resistance zone between the 50-day SMA ($7.48) and $8. A break and close above the zone could open the doors for a possible rally to $9.17 and then $10.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) relief rally stalled near the 20-day EMA ($0.79) on Sept. 23, indicating that bears continue to sell on minor rallies. The price has dipped to the strong support at $0.72 where buyers are likely to step in to arrest the decline.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/aa8fe847-d666-47ab-bc9c-759d7bf54181.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A strong bounce off the current level will suggest accumulation near $0.72. The bulls will then make another attempt to drive the price above the 20-day EMA. If they can pull it off, the MATIC/USDT pair could climb to the 50-day SMA ($0.84) and then to $0.94.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down and breaks below the $0.72 to $0.69 support zone, it will indicate that the $0.72 to $1.05 range has resolved to the downside. That could pull the pair down to $0.62 and after that to $0.52.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls propelled Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.000011) on Sept. 24 but the long wick on the candlestick shows that bears continue to sell at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/92eb3805-f473-47a3-8c99-b9047463b011.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will attempt to sink the price to the immediate support at $0.000010. This level has acted as strong support previously; hence, the bulls are likely to defend it with vigor.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to push the price above the moving averages to suggest that the selling pressure could be reducing. The SHIB/USDT pair could then rise to $0.000014 where the bears may again mount a strong resistance. If bulls overcome this barrier, the pair could rise to $0.000018.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, a break below $0.000010 could intensify selling and the pair could slide to the crucial support at $0.000007.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by HitBTC exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDkvZmJkNWZhN2QtNjU5MS00NmMxLTk2MTMtMjQzMDgxOGVlMjUwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220926ei9q000e6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Finance\par \b \uc2 European stock exchange to list Bitcoin carbon-neutral ETP\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  David Attlee \par \uc2 337 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 September 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Valour\uc2  positions its ETP as a \u8220\'20\'1Csustainable and climate-friendly\u8221\'20\'1D exposure to Bitcoin with a management fee of 1.49%.\par \par \uc2 A subsidiary of \uc2 DeFi Technologies\uc2 , \uc2 Valour\uc2 , will debut its new Carbon Neutral Bitcoin Exchange-Traded Product (ETP) on the Frankfurt Stock Exchange. Trading of the ETP begins on Friday.\par \par \uc2 The company {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://stockhouse.com/news/press-releases/2022/09/23/valour-announces-debut-of-bitcoin-carbon-neutral-exchange-traded-product-etp-on"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 positions}}}\uc2  its ETP as a \u8220\'20\'1Csustainable and climate-friendly\u8221\'20\'1D exposure to Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) with a management fee of 1.49%. The alignment with global environmental goals and Environmental, Social and Corporate Governance (ESG) is reportedly achieved through funding certified carbon removal and offset initiatives to neutralize the associated BTC carbon footprint.\par \par \uc2 To structure the ETP, \uc2 Valour\uc2  partnered with Patch \u8212\'20\'14 a platform that provides climate action infrastructure and has previously worked with \uc2 Andreessen Horowitz\uc2  and other notable institutional investors. The announcement states:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAll carbon emissions linked to the investment will be automatically targeted to achieve carbon neutral output using Patch's API-based solution, which takes into account various inputs, such as the efficiency of mining equipment, distribution of hash power, and nation level carbon emission data, to estimate the amount of carbon emissions the \uc2 Valour\uc2  portfolio has.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Patch will be responsible for selecting the projects upon based on their environmental integrity. These criteria will include \u8220\'20\'1Cadditionality, real and verifiable permanence, and negativity.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/market-will-decide-on-post-merge-ethereum-etps-says-crypto-executive"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Market will decide\u8217\'20\'19 on post-Merge Ethereum ETPs, says crypto executive}}}\par \par \uc2 Valour\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s existing offering of ETPs includes Valour Binance ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ), Valour Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/uniswap-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ), Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ), Cosmos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/cosmos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ATOM}}}\uc2  ) and Enjin (ENJ). In March 2022, the company reported that it {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/defi-technologies-subsidiary-valour-surpasses-274-million-in-aum"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 has reached $274.2 million}}}\uc2  in assets under management.\par \par \uc2 Despite crypto markets tanking this year, the interest in crypto-related financial products isn't fading. In July, Swiss crypto investment firm \uc2 21Shares\uc2  launched two new ETPs offering investors exposure to the largest cryptocurrencies \u8212\'20\'14 Bitcoin and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) \u8212\'20\'14 while aiming to soften \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  via rebalancing assets to the United States dollar.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDkvMmM0Mjk1OTItMGQ2NS00ZDhmLTkzNzAtY2FjZDU4NDJmOGJkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220923ei9n0008i\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
