\par\par \b \uc2 2023 Price Predictions: ApeCoin (APE) vs. Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 )\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 612 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 September 2022\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2022, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 We take a look at the 2023 price prediction of APE and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Is ApeCoin a good investment? Is Cardano a good investment? Keep reading to see which cryptocurrency is the best investment of 2023.\par \par \uc2 Interested in picking up projects at \uc2 ICO\uc2  stage? We\u8217\'20\'19ve found a project that looks destined to be a huge winner. As an added bonus, they\u8217\'20\'19re running a massive event this weekend to celebrate the introduction of their new VIP tiers. Keep reading to find out more!\par \par \uc2 ApeCoin (APE): A good investment for 2023?\par \par \uc2 ApeCoin (APE) led recent market gainers and hiked 5.84% to $5.93 in the latest charts. The coin\u8217\'20\'19s 7-day, 30-day, and 90-day charts are all in the green, with 17%, 14%, and 36% ROI increase, respectively.\par \par \uc2 Trading volume has also improved to $165 million from $124 million in the previous session. At press time, ApeCoin (APE) is targeting to break the $6.5 level. It successfully managed to hit the target briefly during the day but was met with a strong buying pressure.\par \par \uc2 Analysts say the coin has a huge chance of making it above the hard resistance as more buyers will buy into the momentum. On the other hand, it will remain in the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  zone as charts show a clear consolidation of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  symmetrical triangle pattern.\par \par \uc2 Is APE a good investment? We think there are better opportunities in the market if you\u8217\'20\'19re looking to make a winning investment.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Shows Signs of Weakening\par \par \uc2 What could have been a day of huge price recovery turned lukewarm for Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ). A day ahead of the Vasil upgrade that will make the blockchain more efficient than its current performance, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined 0.67% to $0.43.\par \par \uc2 This only shows investors are pricing over their doubts of what the change could bring into the Cardano network.\par \par \uc2 Still, interest in the project is very evident with the token\u8217\'20\'19s trading volume which nearly doubled during the session. More than $789 million worth of Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) had exchanged between hands in the last 24 hours.\par \par \uc2 Our Cardano price prediction? Don\u8217\'20\'19t hold out for huge gains. This is a great project but it looks like it will remain quiet.\par \par \uc2 50% token bonus this weekend at The Hideaways\par \par \uc2 Investors wanting to keep their toes firm from the stagnating Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) can turn to The Hideaways (HDWY).\par \par \uc2 The crypto project has recently rewarded investors with a 100% increase after the HDWY price hit $0.02 from $0.01 as its presale event continues to pump. Leaked information has confirmed that a \b \highlight22\uc2 price rise\b0 \highlight\uc2  to $0.03 will occur next week and there is a huge opportunity to secure bonus tokens this weekend.\par \par \uc2 Investing just $2,500 will see total tokens uplifted by 50% - that\u8217\'20\'19s on top of the 25% bonus already on offer! With the price set to increase, this is a fantastic opportunity for investors to generate a huge return on their investment in a short period of time.\par \par \uc2 The project offers crypto investors the opportunity to benefit from real-world real estate through the generation of monthly rental income from luxury properties sourced at under market value. A $230 trillion market, we think The Hideaways could 23x by 2024.\par \par \uc2 Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.thehideaways.io"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.thehideaways.io}}}\par \par \uc2 Pre-Sale: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://ticket.thehideaways.io/register"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://ticket.thehideaways.io/register}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/thehideawayscrypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/thehideawayscrypto}}}\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hdwycrypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://twitter.com/hdwycrypto}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020220923ei9n000p1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Finance\par \b \uc2 European stock exchange to list Bitcoin carbon neutral ETP\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  David Attlee \par \uc2 338 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 September 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Valour\uc2  positions its ETP as a \u8220\'20\'1Csustainable and climate-friendly\u8221\'20\'1D exposure to Bitcoin with a management fee of 1.49%.\par \par \uc2 A subsidiary of \uc2 DeFi Technologies\uc2 , \uc2 Valour\uc2 , will debut its new Carbon Neutral Bitcoin Exchange Traded Product (ETP) on the Frankfurt Stock Exchange. Trading of the ETP begins on Sept. 23.\par \par \uc2 The company {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://stockhouse.com/news/press-releases/2022/09/23/valour-announces-debut-of-bitcoin-carbon-neutral-exchange-traded-product-etp-on"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 positions}}}\uc2  its ETP as a \u8220\'20\'1Csustainable and climate-friendly\u8221\'20\'1D exposure to Bitcoin with a management fee of 1.49%. The alignment with global environmental goals and Environmental, Social and Corporate Governance (ESG) is reportedly achieved through funding certified carbon removal and offset initiatives to neutralize the associated BTC carbon footprint.\par \par \uc2 To structure the ETP, \uc2 Valour\uc2  partnered with Patch \u8212\'20\'14 a platform that provides climate action infrastructure and has previously worked with \uc2 Andreessen Horowitz\uc2  and other notable institutional investors. The announcement states:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAll carbon emissions linked to the investment will be automatically targeted to achieve carbon neutral output using Patch's API-based solution, which takes into account various inputs, such as the efficiency of mining equipment, distribution of hash power, and nation level carbon emission data, to estimate the amount of carbon emissions the \uc2 Valour\uc2  portfolio has.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Patch will be responsible for selecting the projects upon based on their environmental integrity. These criteria will include \u8220\'20\'1Cadditionality, real and verifiable permanence, and negativity.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/market-will-decide-on-post-merge-ethereum-etps-says-crypto-executive"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Market will decide\u8217\'20\'19 on post-Merge Ethereum ETPs, says crypto executive}}}\par \par \uc2 Valour\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s existing soffering of ETPs includes Valour Binance (BNB), Valour Uniswap (UNI), Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Polkadot (DOT), Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ), Avalanche (AVAX), Cosmos (ATOM) and Enjin (ENJ). In March 2022, the company reported that it {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/defi-technologies-subsidiary-valour-surpasses-274-million-in-aum"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 has reached $274.2 million}}}\uc2  in assets under management.\par \par \uc2 Despite crypto markets tanking this year, the interest in crypto-related financial products isn't fading. In July, Swiss crypto investment firm \uc2 21Shares\uc2  launched two new ETPs offering investors exposure to the largest cryptocurrencies \u8212\'20\'14 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) \u8212\'20\'14 while aiming to soften \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  via rebalancing assets to the United States dollar.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDkvMmM0Mjk1OTItMGQ2NS00ZDhmLTkzNzAtY2FjZDU4NDJmOGJkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220923ei9n0005o\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 This Bitcoin long-term holder metric is nearing the BTC price 'bottom zone'\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Yashu Gola \par \uc2 628 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 September 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin accumulation appears healthy during the downtrend despite BTC eyeing a technical downside target of $14,000 next.\par \par \uc2 A Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) on-chain indicator, which tracks the amount of coin supply held by long-term holders (LTHs) in losses, is signaling that a market bottom could be close.\par \par \uc2 Eerily accurate Bitcoin bottom pundit\par \par \uc2 As of Sept. 22, approximately 30% of Bitcoin's LTHs were facing losses due to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-9-21-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-ada-sol-doge-dot-matic-shib"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-9-21-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-\b  \highlight22ada\b0 \highlight22 -sol-doge-dot-matic-shib}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-9-21-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-ada-sol-doge-dot-matic-shib"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC's decline from $69,000}}}\uc2  in November 2021 to around $19,000 now. That is about 3%\u8211\'20\'135% below the level that previously coincided with Bitcoin's market bottoms.\par \par \uc2 For instance, in March 2020, Bitcoin price declined below $4,000 amid the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coronavirus-financial-crash-is-bitcoins-biggest-test-bitmex-says"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 COVID-19-led market crash}}}\uc2 , which happened when the amount of BTC supply held by LTH in loss climbed toward 35%, as shown below.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/3c0fe244-1551-4dd0-9999-7f9cb9e6d07f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin long-term holder supply in losses. Source: Glassnode\par \par \uc2 Similarly, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/a-year-after-20k-all-time-highs-bitcoin-price-sees-a-small-rally-above-35k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin's December 2018 bottom}}}\uc2  of around $3,200 concurred alongside the LTH loss metric rising above 32%. In both cases, BTC/USD followed up by entering a long \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  cycle.\par \par \uc2 Hence, the number of LTHs in loss during a typical bear market tends to peak in the 30%\u8211\'20\'1340% range. In other words, Bitcoin's price still has room to drop \u8212\'20\'14 likely into the $10,000\u8211\'20\'13$14,000 range \u8212\'20\'14for "LTHs in loss" to reach the historic bottom zone.\par \par \uc2 Coupled with the LTH supply metric, which tracks the BTC supply held by long-term holders, it appears that these investors accumulate and hold during market downturns and distribute during BTC price uptrends, as illustrated below.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/3f2f06a9-a7fb-4aee-96a2-e15f5debdc34.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin total supply held by LTH. Source: Glassnode\par \par \uc2 Therefore, the next bull market may begin when total supply held by LTHs begins to decline.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin accumulation is strong\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the number of accumulation addresses has been increasing consistently during the current bear market, data {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://studio.glassnode.com/metrics?a=BTC&category=&m=addresses.AccumulationCount"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shows}}}\uc2 . The metric tracks addresses that have "at least two incoming non-dust transfers and have never spent funds."\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/066bb940-699c-4a63-a247-b3ce60505c63.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin number of accumulation addresses. Source: Glassnode\par \par \uc2 Interestingly, this is different from the previous bear cycles that saw the number of accumulation addresses drop or remain flat, as shown in the chart above, suggesting that "hodlers" are unfazed by current price levels.\par \par \uc2 In addition, the number of addresses with a non-zero balance stands around 42.7 million versus 39.6 million at the beginning of this year, showing consistent user growth in a bear market.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/e31da38c-c380-4eaa-a9d5-9886533140d1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin number of addresses with a non-zero balance. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 BTC price technicals hint at more downside\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is nevertheless struggling to reclaim $20,000 as support in a higher interest rate environment. Its correlation with U.S. equities also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-nuke-warning-as-fed-rate-hike-decision-looms-dollar-index-hits-20-year-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hints at more downside}}}\uc2  in 2022.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-analysts-give-three-reasons-why-btc-price-below-20k-may-be-a-bear-trap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin analysts give 3 reasons why BTC price below $20K may be a 'bear trap'}}}\par \par \uc2 From a technical perspective, Bitcoin could {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/elon-musk-cathie-wood-sound-deflation-alarm-is-bitcoin-at-risk-of-falling-below-14k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 drop further toward $14,000}}}\uc2  in 2022 if its cup-and-handle breakdown pans out, as shown below.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/91f2b081-de1d-4fe6-bae5-56339615ca32.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD three-day price chart featuring cup-and-handle pattern. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Such a move should push the aforementioned "LTH in loss" metric toward the 32%\u8211\'20\'1335% capitulation region, which could ultimately coincide with the bottom in the current bear market.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDkvYmFkNmY5MTEtMWU0Zi00ZTJhLWIxZTMtYmNmODEwYjI2YWEyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220922ei9m0008e\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/21: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, MATIC, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,816 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 September 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins rallied ahead of the Fed\u8217\'20\'19s rate hike decision, indicating traders viewed the 0.75% rate hike as a \u8220\'20\'1Cpriced-in\u8221\'20\'1D event.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Federal Reserve{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2022/09/21/fed-rate-hike-september-2022-.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hiked}}}\uc2  rates by 75 basis points on Sept. 21 and Fed Chair \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  projected another 125 basis points increase before the end of the year. If that happens, it will take the benchmark rate to 4.4% by the end of the year, which is sharply higher than the June estimates of 3.8%. The Fed also intimated that it only expects rate cuts to be considered in 2024.\par \par \uc2 The expectation of higher rates pushed the 2-year Treasury to 4.1%, its highest level since 2007. This could attract several investors who are looking for safety in this uncertain macro environment. Higher rates are also likely to reduce the appeal of risky assets such as stocks and cryptocurrencies and may delay the start of a new uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/8af797f2-c632-4097-a8e9-debacf678958.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Even though Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) faces several headwinds in the near term, it did not deter {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/michael-saylor-can-t-stop-microstrategy-now-holds-130-000-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MicroStrategy from buying more coins}}}\uc2 . After the latest purchase of 301 Bitcoin, the company\u8217\'20\'19s stash has risen to 130,000 Bitcoin. This shows that \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  and its executive chairman, \uc2 Michael Saylor\uc2 , remain \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the long-term prospects of Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins are trying to stabilize after the Fed\u8217\'20\'19s announcement. Could they start a recovery? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin plunged below the immediate support at $18,626 on Sept. 19 but the long tail on the candlestick shows strong buying at lower levels. The bulls again defended the level on Sept. 21, which is a positive sign.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/597b80a2-fb53-4c97-aa87-19cf7f231d67.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to push the price above the 20-week exponential moving average (EMA) ($20,100) to indicate that the sellers may be losing their grip. The BTC/USDT pair could then rise to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($21,363). This level may again act as a stiff resistance but if bulls overcome this barrier, the pair could rally to $25,211.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will again try to sink the pair below the strong support zone between $18,626 and $17,622. If they succeed, the pair may witness panic selling and could drop to $14,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been declining in a descending channel pattern for the past few days. The price bounced off the support line of the channel on Sept. 19, indicating buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/0c35ce85-b598-4738-8b9e-fe45a1abbc89.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to start a relief rally, which could pick up strength above $1,400. If this level is conquered, the ETH/USDT pair could rise to the 20-day EMA ($1,513). This level could be the real test for the bulls in the near term because a break above it could clear the path for a possible rally to the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. That could sink the price to the support line of the channel. If this support fails to hold up, the pair could plummet to $1,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  is correcting inside a descending channel pattern. The strong bounce off $258 is a positive sign as it indicates demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/3976de68-b7f7-4d21-9244-410eb3f1942a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will attempt to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($278) and challenge the resistance line of the channel. The 50-day SMA ($293) is placed just above the channel; hence, the bears are expected to defend the level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the resistance line, the BNB/USDT pair could again drop to $258. If this support cracks, the pair could slide to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the channel to improve the prospects of a rally to the stiff overhead resistance at $338.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the overhead resistance at $0.41 on Sept. 20 but the bulls could not build upon this strength. The bears pulled the price back into the range on Sept. 21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/08a9e11e-9cb9-4f24-984d-15f9b97bf0e6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the bulls do not give up much ground from the current level, it will increase the possibility of a break above $0.41. The 20-day EMA ($0.36) has started to turn up and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If the price breaks and sustains above $0.41, the XRP/USDT pair could reach $0.46 and then $0.52.\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to sink the price below the moving averages to suggest that the pair may continue to oscillate inside the range for some more time.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Buyers are trying to sustain Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the uptrend line. The bulls tried to push the price higher on Sept. 21 but the long wick on the candlestick shows that bears are selling on intraday rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/1d7d9143-e451-4419-bce5-a4d42daa2cb4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price continues lower and slips below the uptrend line, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to the pivotal level at $0.40. If bears sink the price below this support, the pair could start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, if bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rally to the downtrend line. Buyers will have to thrust the price above this resistance to gain the upper hand. The pair could then rise to $0.52 and thereafter to $0.60.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the immediate support at $30 but the bulls could not push the price above the 20-day EMA ($33). This indicates that bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/213b5799-4de6-4488-912b-7828100d5539.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor positive is that the bulls have not given up and are again trying to propel the price above the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the SOL/USDT pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($36). The bears may attempt to defend the zone between the 50-day SMA and $39 because if they fail to do so, the pair may soar to $48.\par \par \uc2 To invalidate this \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view, bears will have to pull the price below $30. That could sink the pair to the important level at $26. If this support gives way, the pair could resume the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) is getting squeezed between the 20-day EMA ($0.06) and the immediate support at $0.06. This suggests that the bulls are buying the dips but they continue to face strong resistance from the bears on every minor rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/2c03ec27-9658-4a37-bd3e-bc1279723f12.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that buyers are making a comeback. The DOGE/USDT pair could then rise to the 50-day SMA ($0.07) where the bears will again try to stall the recovery. The bulls will have to overcome this obstacle to open the doors for a possible rally to $0.09.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below the strong support at $0.06, it will indicate that the uncertainty has resolved in favor of the bears. The pair could then decline to the crucial support at $0.05.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-and-stocks-soften-ahead-of-fed-rate-hike-but-xrp-algo-and-ldo-look-interesting"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto and stocks soften ahead of Fed rate hike, but XRP, ALGO and LDO look \u8216\'20\'18interesting\u8217\'20\'19}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating between $6 and $10 for the past several days. The price has slipped to the critical support at $6, which had held successfully in mid-July.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/3fbe01ec-3f0c-49e6-b2c0-24337cb22e1a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers are expected to defend the $6 level with vigor because a break and close below it could signal the resumption of the downtrend. The DOT/USDT pair could then decline to the next major support at $4.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. The pair could then rise to the 50-day SMA ($7.69). A break above this level could clear the path for a possible rally to $10.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a large range between $0.72 and $1.05 for the past several days. The price has currently reached the support of the range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/df3e0ef9-95a4-47f3-aa24-51b98ca48e67.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off $0.72, the pair could reach the 20-day EMA. This is an important level to keep an eye on in the short term. If the price turns down from this resistance, the likelihood of a break below $0.72 increases. The MATIC/USDT pair could then drop to $0.62 and later to $0.52.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rises above the moving averages, it will suggest strong demand at lower levels. That could keep the pair stuck inside the range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the immediate support at $0.000010 on Sept. 18 but the bears stalled the recovery at $0.000011. The bears will again attempt to sink the price below the support at $0.000010.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/eccd283f-41e5-4e16-b921-d14a6b5f34a8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.000012) and the RSI in the negative zone suggest that bears are in command. If the price slips and sustains below $0.000010, the SHIB/USDT pair could extend its decline to the vital support at $0.000007.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to avert this collapse, they will have to quickly push the price above the 20-day EMA. The pair could then rise to $0.000014 where the bears may again mount a stiff resistance. If the price turns down from this level, the pair may consolidate between $0.000010 and $0.000014 for some time.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDkvMDg5YTk3N2EtMDhlMi00ZTNhLWJiYjQtZTRlZjk0M2U2YTUxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220921ei9l000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/19: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, MATIC, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 2,049 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 September 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Uncertainty over the Fed\u8217\'20\'19s next rate hike is pressuring Bitcoin and altcoins under p. This could change if the expected 0.75% bps hike is selected.\par \par \uc2 The United States equities markets and the crypto markets are likely to remain volatile in the near term because traders remain nervous about the size of the next Federal Reserve rate hike on Sept. 20 and 21. While the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-market-bloodbath-leads-to-432m-in-liquidation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 majority favors a 75 basis point rate hike}}}\uc2 , according to the \uc2 CME\uc2  FedWatch Tool, some analysts expect the Fed to hike rates by 100 basis points, the first such instance since the early 1980s.\par \par \uc2 Many expect Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) to continue its slide and drop below the June low in the future. Although anything is possible in the markets, many times, the markets do not oblige the majority. If the Fed does not surprise the markets, traders who may be cautious and sitting on the sidelines could jump right back in, resulting in a brief relief recovery.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/cde03452-b84e-46cc-a2a2-ec09da6bb780.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Bear markets offer an opportunity for investors to accumulate in the long term. It is futile to catch the bottom, hence, traders may be on the lookout to start accumulating during periods of extreme pessimism. A strong stomach is needed to tide over the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  but the ones who do that are likely to benefit when the next bull run begins.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins stage a turnaround or is a deeper decline possible? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been in a strong downtrend for several months. Buyers started a recovery from the June low at $17,622 and pushed the price above the 200-week simple moving average (SMA) but they could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/2f898993-7dfb-48e8-823e-28b3ece34282.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls again tried to push the price above the 200-week SMA last week but the bears held their ground. This shows that bears are defending the 200-week SMA with vigor. Hence, this level becomes a key resistance to watch for on the upside.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the bulls are expected to aggressively defend the support at $17,622. The first sign of strength will be a break and close above $20,000. That will suggest a range-bound action for the BTC/USDT pair between $17,622 and $25,211.\par \par \uc2 A trend change will be signaled after buyers propel the price above $25,211. The pair could then rally to $32,000.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bears sink and sustain the price below $17,622, it could signal the resumption of the downtrend. The pair could then decline to $14,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears have been defending the 20-week exponential moving average (EMA) ($1,732) for the past few weeks. This suggests that the sentiment in Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/921eb9e5-c189-4bbc-9462-5ef269f6eb15.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair turned down sharply from the 20-week EMA last week and has reached the 200-week SMA ($1,283). Buyers are expected to defend this level vigorously.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-week EMA to indicate that the bears may be losing their grip. A potential trend change could be signaled on a break above $2,030. Until then, the bears are likely to sell on every rally.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below the 200-week SMA, the selling could intensify and the bears will try to pull the price to the June low of $881. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break below it could result in panic selling.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  is one of the outperformers among the major cryptocurrencies as it is trading well above its 200-week SMA ($175). Buyers pushed the price above the 20-week EMA ($295) but they could not build upon this strength. The bears stalled the recovery at $338 and pulled the price back below the 20-week EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/99d5356e-f616-4027-8edf-f6b9da7e4622.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Since then, the bears have thwarted several attempts by the bulls to drive the price back above the 20-week EMA. This indicates that bears are selling the rallies to the 20-week EMA. The bears will attempt to sink the BNB/USDT pair to the 200-week SMA, which is likely to attract strong buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break above the 20-week EMA. That could clear the path for a retest of $338. The bulls will have to clear this overhead hurdle to suggest the start of a new up-move.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating in a downtrend for the past few weeks. Buyers attempted to push the price above the resistance of the range at $0.41 last week but the bears successfully defended the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/2c802d8c-d4ee-424f-a4a6-df8051d4dc2f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers will try to pull the price to the support at $0.30. This remains the important level to keep an eye on because if bears sink the price below $0.30, the XRP/USDT pair could begin the next leg of the downtrend. The pair could then decline to $0.24 and later to $0.17.\par \par \uc2 The 20-week EMA is flattening out, indicating that the selling pressure could be weakening. If the price rebounds off $0.30, the pair could extend its stay inside the range for a few more days. Buyers will have to push and sustain the price above the 200-week SMA ($0.48) to indicate that the pair may have bottomed out.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the moving averages for the past few weeks. Attempts by the bulls to push the price above the 200-week SMA ($0.57) were met with strong selling by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/41aab2c1-d263-4366-b022-40f28bf723dc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Although the bulls have held the $0.40 support for the past several weeks, the failure to push the price above the 200-week SMA indicates that bears are selling on rallies. The bears will try to sink the price below the support at $0.40. If they succeed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could resume its downtrend. The next support on the downside is $0.33 and then $0.28.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to avert this catastrophe, they will have to quickly push the price above the 200-week SMA. The bears may again attempt to pose a strong challenge at $0.70 but if bulls overcome this barrier, the pair may indicate the start of a new uptrend. The pair could first rise to the 50-week SMA ($0.96) and thereafter to $1.25.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rallied from the June low of $26 but the recovery fizzled out near $48. The failure of the bulls to push the price to the 20-week EMA ($46) suggests that bears are selling on minor rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/2abffeb7-8bba-4bd7-bf87-349c07f9513f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price to the crucial support of $26, which has not been tested since June. If this support cracks, the selling could pick up momentum and the SOL/USDT pair could drop to $20. The bulls are likely to defend this level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off $26, the bulls will again try to drive the pair to the overhead resistance at $48. Buyers will have to clear this obstacle to indicate the start of a new uptrend. The pair could then attempt a rally to $78.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) recovered from $0.05 in June and reached the 20-week EMA ($0.08) in August but the bulls could not push the price above this resistance. The bears aggressively defended the level and are trying to sink the price back to $0.05.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/b576d60e-5168-45a6-ba44-8a0e7d9758e0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the $0.05 support gives way, the DOGE/USDT pair could resume its downtrend. The next support on the downside is at $0.04 but if bulls fail to defend this level, the selling could intensify and the pair could collapse below $0.01.\par \par \uc2 There is a small ray of hope for the bulls because the RSI is attempting to form a positive divergence. This suggests that the selling pressure could be reducing. If the price rebounds off $0.05, the bulls will again try to propel the pair above $0.09. If that happens, the pair could rise to the 50-week SMA ($0.13).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-price-risks-30-decline-despite-ripple-s-legal-win-prospects"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP price risks 30% decline despite Ripple's legal win prospects}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating between $6 and $10 for the past few weeks. Usually in a range, traders buy the dips to the support and sell near the overhead resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/94fb6efb-4709-40d7-9951-c88838ade71b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the $6 support with strength, it will suggest that buyers are accumulating on dips. That could keep the DOT/USDT pair stuck inside the range for some more time. The longer the price trades inside a range, the stronger will be the eventual breakout from it.\par \par \uc2 If buyers propel the price above $10, it will suggest that the downtrend could be ending. That could clear the path for a possible rally to the 50-week SMA ($19).\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price slips below the $6 support, the pair could start the next leg of the downtrend. The pair could then drop to the $3.50 to $4 support zone.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) moved up sharply from $0.31 in June and broke above the 20-week EMA ($0.87) but the buyers could not extend the recovery. The bears stalled the relief rally at $1.05 and pulled the price back below the 20-week EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/37f18f86-1fcf-4b71-8fc3-c01efd5a0d77.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls again tried to thrust and sustain the price above the 20-week EMA last week but the bears did not relent. They sold aggressively and have pulled the price to the immediate support of $0.72. If this support breaks down, the MATIC/USDT pair could slide to $0.45 and then to $0.31.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rises from the current level and breaks above the 20-week EMA, the pair could challenge the overhead resistance at $1.05. A break and close above this level will suggest that the downtrend may be over. The price could then rally to the 50-week SMA ($1.31) and after that to $1.75.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) rallied sharply from its June low and rose above the 20-week EMA ($0.000013) in August. However, the breakout proved to be a bear trap as the price turned down from $0.000018 and slipped back below the 20-week EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/81c43015-46fc-4ed9-8f5b-2754a2dbf410.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Even though the price has been trading below the 20-week EMA, the bulls have not allowed the SHIB/USDT pair to retest the June low at $0.000007. This indicates that buyers are attempting to form a higher low.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-week EMA. The pair could then rally to $0.000018. If bulls drive the price above this resistance, it will suggest a potential trend change. The pair could then surge to $0.000030.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate if the price continues lower and breaks below $0.000007. That could sink the pair to $0.000005.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDkvNjg1YWYyZjctMDdlYS00NTE1LWFhZDctYTQ1YzAwMzJlNGM1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220919ei9j000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/16: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 SOL\uc2 , DOGE, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,918 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 September 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Equities markets are marked by aggressive selling due to \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  macroeconomic factors, adding sell pressure to Bitcoin and altcoin prices.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 World Bank\uc2  has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.worldbank.org/en/news/press-release/2022/09/15/risk-of-global-recession-in-2023-rises-amid-simultaneous-rate-hikes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 warned}}}\uc2  of a possible global recession in 2023. In a press release on Sept. 15, the bank said that the current pace of rate hikes and policy decisions is unlikely to be enough to bring inflation down to pre-pandemic levels.\par \par \uc2 Ray Dalio\uc2 , the billionaire founder of \uc2 Bridgewater Associates\uc2  said in a blog post on Sept. 13 that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-threatens-19-6k-as-ray-dalio-predicts-30-stocks-crash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 if rates were to rise to about 4.5%}}}\uc2  in the United States, it would \u8220\'20\'1Cproduce about a 20 percent negative impact on equity prices.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The negative outlook for the equity markets does not bode well for the cryptocurrency markets as both have been closely correlated in 2022.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/1479c702-ea52-41aa-bb2f-47a189e18f02.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 The macroeconomic developments seem to be worrying cryptocurrency investors who sent 236,000 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) to major cryptocurrency exchanges on Sept. 14, according to Glassnode data. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-exchange-inflows-see-biggest-one-day-spike-since-march-2020"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 inflow was the highest since March 2020}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the S&P 500 index, the U.S. dollar index (DXY) and the major cryptocurrencies to determine the key levels that could signal the start of a trending move.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 index (SPX) attempted a rebound off the uptrend line on Sept. 14 but the weak rebound showed a lack of urgency to defend the level. Sellers took advantage of this situation and pulled the price below the uptrend line on Sept. 15.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/f14a2e75-5a66-4b7b-b8a3-3dfb1896724f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The level of 3,886 from where the index had bounced on Sept. 6 also failed to provide any support, indicating that traders are in a hurry to sell their positions. Usually, the breakdown from a level tends to retest it.\par \par \uc2 In this case, the price could rise to the uptrend line. If the price turns down from this level, it will suggest that bears have flipped the uptrend line into resistance. That could increase the possibility of a drop to 3,700.\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) (4,006) and the relative strength index below 37 suggest that bears are in command.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up and rises above the uptrend line, it will suggest that the breakdown on Sept. 15 may have been a bear trap. That could propel the index to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 DXY\par \par \uc2 The DXY is in a strong uptrend. The bears tried to pull the price below the moving averages but the bulls vigorously defended the 50-day simple moving average (SMA(107) on Sept. 13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/0b917192-ca25-45e8-9e92-99f929755761.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is in the positive territory indicating advantage to buyers. The bulls will next attempt to push the price above the overhead resistance at 110.78. This is an important level to keep an eye on because if the price sustains above this level, the rally could extend to 115.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the 20-day EMA (109), it will suggest a consolidation in the near term. The price could then range between 107.58 and 110.78 for a few days. A potential trend change could be signaled if bears sink the price below 107.58.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin formed a Doji candlestick pattern on Sept. 14, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. The uncertainty resolved to the downside on Sept. 15 but the bears have failed to build upon this advantage. This indicates that the selling pressure reduces at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/0db88078-c6e9-4550-9d11-1a07bd218176.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will attempt to salvage the situation by pushing the price above the 20-day EMA ($20,529). If that happens, the BTC/USDT pair could rise to the overhead resistance at $22,799. The bears may defend this level aggressively but if bulls thrust the price above it, the pair could rally to $25,211.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are viewing rallies as a selling opportunity. That could sink the pair to the strong support at $18,510. The zone between $18,510 and $17,622 could witness aggressive buying from the bulls because the failure to defend this zone may start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the support line on Sept. 14 but the joy of the bulls proved to be short-lived. The price turned down sharply from the 20-day EMA ($1,609) and plunged below the support line on Sept. 15.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/8dea65a7-a5a8-498d-8612-5e5c4562f046.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn down and the RSI has slipped below 39, indicating that bears are in control. The sellers have pulled the price to $1,422 and if this support cracks, the ETH/USDT pair could drop to $1,280.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level, the pair could recover to the moving averages, which may act as a strong resistance. The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to suggest that the selling pressure could be reducing.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  below the immediate support at $275 but they are struggling to keep the price down. This indicates that lower levels are attracting buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/15136a67-288d-4a91-ae4a-790125241f1e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above $275, the BNB/USDT pair could be in the early stages of forming a symmetrical triangle. This suggests uncertainty about the next directional move among the bulls and the bears. That could keep the price inside the triangle for some time.\par \par \uc2 If the price rises above the 20-day EMA ($283), the pair could rally to the resistance line of the triangle. A break above the triangle could push the pair to $338.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns down from the 20-day EMA and plummets below the support line of the triangle. That could start a decline to $258 and later to $239.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been range-bound between $0.30 and $0.39 for the past several weeks. In the past few days, the range has shrunk further with bulls buying the dips to $0.32 and bears selling the recovery to the 50-day SMA ($0.35).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/7c8bdd0d-39a6-4415-958f-3571c1a63dc9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price action inside a range is usually volatile and difficult to call. Still, as the buyers had successfully defended the $0.32 support between Aug. 28 and Sept. 7, they will again try to do that. If the price rises from the current level, the XRP/USDT pair could rally to the 20-day EMA ($0.34) and later to the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 If bulls drive the price above the 50-day SMA, the likelihood of a rally to $0.39 increases. The bears are expected to defend this level aggressively. On the downside, if the price slips below $0.32, the crucial support of $0.30 may be retested.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears are attempting to build upon their advantage in Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ). They sold the recovery to the 20-day EMA ($0.48) on Sept. 14 and are trying to pull the price below the immediate support at $0.45.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/215376ab-6eda-45a1-b07c-2538a7ac913d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Although moving averages are not a valuable tool in a ranging market, they tend to be helpful to determine the short-term trend. The 20-day EMA has started to turn down and the RSI is in the negative territory, indicating advantage to bears. If the price slips and sustains below $0.45, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to $0.42.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to gain the upper hand, they will have to arrest the decline and push the price above the moving averages. That could clear the path for a rally to the downtrend line. A break above this resistance could indicate that the bulls are back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/does-ethereum-s-new-ethpow-fork-stand-a-chance-ethw-price-falls-65-post-merge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Does Ethereum's new ETHPoW fork stand a chance? ETHW price falls 65% post-Merge}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($33.84) on Sept. 15, indicating that the sentiment remains negative and bears are selling on minor rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/b9b996cc-dd51-4a83-86e3-6d1915c51898.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could decline to the strong support at $30. This level was resilient during the onslaught between Aug. 28 and Sept. 7 and gave a bounce to $39 on Sept. 13. Short-term traders may again expect a bounce off $30 and are likely to buy the dips to this level.\par \par \uc2 The rebound off the support could continue to face hurdles at the 20-day EMA and then again at the 50-day SMA ($36.95). If the price closes above this resistance, it could open the doors for a possible up-move to $48. Conversely, if the $30 level cracks, the pair could slide to the vital support at $26.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has continued its slide and is near the strong support of $0.06. The price rebounded off this level on Sept. 7; hence, it may again attract buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/4c623b59-0285-44f9-88a2-c44890b8675a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the 20-day EMA ($0.06) will be the first sign of demand building up at higher levels. The DOGE/USDT pair could then rise to $0.07. This level may again act as a resistance but if bulls push the price above it, the pair could rise to $0.08 and thereafter to $0.09.\par \par \uc2 If the price slips below the immediate support at $0.06, the pair could slide to the June low near $0.05. The bears will have to sink and sustain the price below this level to signal the start of the next leg of the downtrend. The pair could then extend the decline to $0.04.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls attempted to start arecovery on Sept. 14 but higher levels attracted selling by the bears. Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) turned down on Sept. 15 and the bears are trying to sink the price below the immediate support of $6.75.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/fdcfbffb-27b5-4360-89cd-f8c61694f292.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers had successfully defended the $6.75 level on two previous occasions; hence, a break and close below it may intensify selling. The DOT/USDT pair could first drop to $6.50 and later to the crucial support at $6.\par \par \uc2 As the previous three recoveries have turned down from the 50-day SMA ($7.86), it remains the key level to watch out for on the upside. The bulls will have to overcome this barrier to start a rally to $9.17 and then to $10.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDkvMjhlNjk0NDctNWRiYi00YzcxLWI4NjItNjljYjA3NjczYzBiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220916ei9g000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 9/14: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, MATIC, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,804 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 September 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is struggling to find support in the $20,000 zone, which is negatively impacting \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2  and weighing on altcoin prices.\par \par \uc2 The United States equities markets and the cryptocurrency markets had been rising leading up to the Sept. 13 release of the August Consumer Price Index data, but the rally fell apart once the data showed inflation rising, rather than falling.\par \par \uc2 The negative data dashed any hope of a Federal Reserve pivot in the near term and it triggered a sharp decline in risky assets. The market capitalization of U.S. stocks plunged by about $1.6 trillion on Sept. 13 and the market cap of the cryptocurrency markets slipped below $1 trillion.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/d9cc3454-6f65-4f3c-aef5-259d12732452.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Statistician and independent market analyst Willy Woo believes that Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) may have to fall further before it reaches the maximum pain experienced during previous bottoms. Woo expects {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/analyst-on-17-6k-btc-price-bottom-bitcoin-not-there-yet"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price to decline below $10,000}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins resume their downtrend? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke above the 50-day simple moving average (SMA)($21,902) on Sept. 12, but this proved to be a bull trap. Buyers attempted to extend the recovery on Sept. 13 but the rally reversed direction from $22,799.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/7a28112f-9197-4f39-965d-17d31911b948.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Aggressive selling by the bears pulled the price back below the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($20,722). A minor positive is that the bulls are attempting to stall the decline at $20,000.\par \par \uc2 If buyers push the price back above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that lower levels continue to attract buyers. The BTC/USDT pair will then attempt to rise to the 50-day SMA and later retest $22,799. A break and close above this resistance could open the doors for a possible rally to $25,211.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price slips below $19,860, the pair could drop to the $18,510 to $17,622 zone. The bulls are expected to defend this zone with vigor.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down and plummeted below the moving averages on Sept. 13, tilting the short-term advantage in favor of the bears. A minor positive is that the bulls are attempting to defend the support line of the rising wedge pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/f4116f1e-67f1-4dbf-9e8d-5637ff15bc47.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level and rises above the moving averages, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to the resistance line of the wedge. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the wedge to clear the path for a possible rally to $2,030.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price fails to cross above the moving averages, the likelihood of a drop below the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  wedge pattern increases. If that happens, the selling pressure could pick up and the pair could drop to $1,422 and later to $1,280. Buyers are expected to mount a strong defense at this level.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  turned down from $300 on Sept. 12 and plunged below the moving averages on Sept. 13. This tilted the short-term advantage in favor of the bears but the bulls have not yet given up.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/cd36d731-8160-4e5b-b413-3f1cf1e71e01.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers are attempting to defend the immediate support at $275 and push the price above the 20-day EMA ($285). If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could challenge the $300 to $307.50 resistance zone. If buyers clear this zone, the rally could pick up momentum.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls fail to push the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears are selling on minor rallies. That could enhance the prospects of a break below $275. If that happens, the pair could decline to $258 and then to $240.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 After trading near the 50-day SMA ($0.35) for three days, Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned down and broke below the moving averages on Sept. 13. This pulled the price below the breakout level of $0.34.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/e8dab823-7b5d-44d7-8e82-0041f341ebaf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers are trying to push the price back above the 20-day EMA ($0.34) on Sept. 14. If they succeed, it will suggest that the XRP/USDT pair has formed a higher low at $0.33. The pair could then retest the overhead resistance at $0.36. A break and close above this level could push the pair toward $0.39.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears are selling on minor rallies. That could pull the price down to the strong support at $0.32.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rose above the 50-day SMA ($0.49) on Sept. 9 but the bulls could not continue the recovery and push the price to the downtrend line. This indicates hesitation by the bulls to buy at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/7a534882-a4c1-4596-97d1-83c3bd4bd6c3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure to extend the recovery may have tempted short-term traders to book profits. That pulled the price back below the moving averages on Sept.13.\par \par \uc2 A minor positive is that the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair rebounded off $0.46 and the bulls are attempting to push the price back above the moving averages. This indicates that lower levels continue to attract strong buying by the bulls. If the price rises above the 50-day SMA, the pair could reach the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 This view will invalidate in the near term if the price turns down from the moving averages and plummets below $0.45. The pair could then decline to $0.42.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above the 50-day SMA ($37.30) on Sept. 13 and 14 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This shows that bears are defending the 50-day SMA with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/510cbce4-4030-421a-870a-ffaadd64d684.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Strong selling on Sept. 13 pulled the price below the 20-day EMA ($34). The bears will now try to sink the SOL/USDT pair to the immediate support at $30. The repeated retest of a support level tends to weaken it. If the $30 level cracks, the pair could start its descent to the vital support at $26.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rise to the 50-day SMA. The bulls will have to clear this overhead hurdle to indicate the start of an up-move to $48.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the support zone near $0.06 on Sept. 7 but the recovery fizzled out at the 20-day EMA ($0.06). This indicates that bears are defending the moving averages aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/3b7db96f-931f-46f7-af0b-6c90c3f7d007.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price turned down from the 20-day EMA on Sept. 13 and reached the support at $0.06. The bulls are expected to defend the level aggressively as a break and close below it could sink the DOGE/USDT pair to the June low at $0.05. If this support cracks, it could signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 This negative view could invalidate if the price rebounds off the current level and rises above the moving averages. If that happens, the pair could attempt a rally to $0.09.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-s-merge-will-affect-more-than-just-its-blockchain"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s Merge will affect more than just its blockchain}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) repeatedly tried to rise and sustain above the 50-day SMA ($7.90) Sept. 9\u8211\'20\'1313 but the bears held their ground. This indicates that the sentiment remains negative and bears are selling on rallies to resistance levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/e643292c-553e-4c30-a915-52804ecff233.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure to rise above the 50-day SMA may have attracted strong selling by the bears and profit-booking by the short-term bulls. That pulled the price back below the 20-day EMA ($7.43) on Sept. 13. The bears will now attempt to sink the DOT/USDT pair below the immediate support at $6.75 and challenge the crucial level at $6.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bulls continue to buy on dips. The bulls will then again try to overcome the barrier at the 50-day SMA and start a rally toward $10.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck inside a large range between $0.75 and $1.05 for the past several weeks. Both moving averages have flattened out and the relative strength index is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between buyers and sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/cc73937a-7418-48c8-8616-64ae81b5773d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The MATIC/USDT pair has been attempting to rise inside an ascending channel for the past few days. If the price plummets below the channel, it will signal a minor advantage to the bears. The pair could then decline to the strong support at $0.75.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the current level and rises above the moving averages, the pair could reach the resistance line of the channel. A break and close above the channel could open the doors for a possible rally to $1.05.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) managed to stay above the moving averages between Sept. 9 and12 but the bulls could not build upon this strength and clear the overhead hurdle at the downtrend line. This indicates a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-09/a62c190c-d595-4462-95f6-0b9b93034570.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price plunged back below the moving averages on Sept. 13 and the bears will now attempt to pull the SHIB/USDT pair below the strong support at $0.000012. If they succeed, the pair will complete a descending triangle pattern. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a target objective of $0.000009.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the current level and breaks above the moving averages, the pair could reach the downtrend line. A break and close above this level will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup and clear the path for a rally to $0.000018.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involve