of the Cardano blockchain, we think there are better investments out there.\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) Unending Lawsuits Affecting Prices\par \par \uc2 The continuous lawsuits against \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) have had a great effect on the coin over the last few years, leaving investors in a state of confusion.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) price has been pulled down by the bear market and currently trades in a sideways holding pattern, with investors not spotting much opportunity for it to break out.\par \par \uc2 Until the lawsuits come to an end, analysts aren't certain about the direction the \uc2 Ripple\uc2  price is heading.\par \par \uc2 Our analysts think the \uc2 Ripple\uc2  price should be added to your shortlist whilst the lawsuits against \uc2 Ripple\uc2  potentially come to an end. If they fall in \uc2 Ripple\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s favour, our analysts predict the \uc2 Ripple\uc2  price could jump and make \uc2 Ripple\uc2  a good investment in 2023.\par \par \uc2 100% Gains if You Invest In The Hideaways Before Friday\par \par \uc2 The Hideaways (HDWY), ties the knot between web3 technology and web2 real estate investment and rewards crypto investors with real world rental income paid as crypto and also crypto staking rewards.\par \par \uc2 The presale has been on fire, with close to 60m tokens being sold. Still in Phase 1 of their presale, the token price has been confirmed as increasing from $0.01 to $0.02 this Friday. You still have time to invest now and make 100%!\par \par \uc2 We wanted to focus on their Diamond tier membership and the rewards on offer as we think they\u8217\'20\'19re the best available in the current market.\par \par \uc2 For just $50,000 you can secure 1 of 25 Diamond tier memberships. These offer best in class rewards such as a free annual private jet flight, a free 2 week 5* holiday including flights, a luxury concierge service worth $50,000 per year, access to an exclusive investment network and much much more.\par