owntrend line on Aug. 31.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/375aafbd-0b01-486a-9032-a385cddd8a57.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the BTC/USDT pair could rally to the 20-day exponential moving average ($21,325), which is an important level to keep an eye on. If the price turns down from this level, the bears will attempt to pull the pair to the strong support zone of $18,910 to $18,626. A break and close below this zone could open the doors for a retest of the critical support at $17,622.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rise to the 50-day simple moving average ($22,333). If bulls clear this hurdle, the pair could pick up momentum and rally toward the overhead resistance at $25,211. The bulls have to overcome this barrier to indicate that the bottom may be in place.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether turned up from $1,422 on Aug. 29 and climbed back above the neckline of the head and shoulders pattern. This suggests that the breakdown on Aug. 26 may have been a bear trap.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/03bc51a1-4a90-4cb7-8cd0-c7e3d461c387.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to push the price above the moving averages. If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair could rise to the overhead resistance at $1,700. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close above it could open the doors for a possible rally to $2,000.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the price turns down from the overhead resistance and breaks below $1,422. Such a move will suggest that the recovery may be over. The pair could then decline to $1,280 and later to $1,050.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the strong support at $275 on Aug. 29, indicating that the bulls are defending this level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/b707706f-dd86-4ee9-95d1-4225a71b2bbe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls attempted to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($292) on Aug. 30 and 31 but the bears held their ground. If the price breaks and closes below the $275 support, the BNB/USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders pattern. That could start a decline to $240 and later to the pattern target at $212.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off $275 and breaks above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rise to $308. A break and close above this resistance could clear the path for a rally to $338.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Buyers have been defending the $0.32 level for the past three days but have failed to achieve a strong rebound. This suggests a lack of demand for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/c3ff7adc-aca4-424d-991b-8981d5219d79.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.34) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the negative territory indicate that bears have a slight edge. If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA and breaks below $0.32, the XRP/USDT pair could slide to the vital support at $0.30.\par \par \uc2 The bulls are expected to defend this level with all their might because a break below this support could signal the resumption of the downtrend. Conversely, if bulls drive the price above the moving averages, the pair may rally to $0.39.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) bounced off $0.42 on Aug. 29 and reached the 20-day EMA ($0.47) where the bears are mounting a stiff resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/ef85b56a-f365-43ed-b1d8-9f71b9d0d52f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that bears continue to sell on minor rallies. The bears will then try to sink the price to the crucial support at $0.40. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close below it could signal the start of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if buyers thrust the price above the moving averages, it will suggest strong demand at lower levels. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off $30 and rose above the $32 level on Aug. 29 but the bears again pulled the price back below the level on Aug. 30. This suggests that bears are selling on every minor rise.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/7221c0b5-1107-48d3-8b03-77f20fafd3eb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are again trying to push the price to the 20-day EMA ($35) which is an important level to watch out for in the short term. If bulls drive the price above this level, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($39).\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative territory indicate advantage to sellers. If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA and breaks below $30, the pair could drop to the crucial support at $26.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully defended the support at $0.06 in the past few days but have failed to achieve a strong rebound off it. This suggests a lack of demand for Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/2ad71283-913d-4679-8ea9-fca8d178496c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A tight consolidation near a strong support increases the possibility of a breakdown. If that happens, the DOGE/USDT pair could start its downward move toward the June 18 low near $0.05. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break and close below it could resume the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rises from the current level and breaks above the moving averages, it will suggest that the latest leg of the corrective phase may be over. The pair could then attempt a rally to $0.09.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/potential-bitcoin-price-double-bottom-could-spark-btc-rally-to-30k-despite-extreme-fear"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Potential Bitcoin price double-bottom could spark BTC rally to $30K despite \u8216\'20\'18extreme fear\u8217\'20\'19}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the moving averages since Aug. 19 but the bears have not been able to sink the price to the strong support at $6. This suggests that selling dries up at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/89a88140-7677-4522-b484-1166c7f209ed.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will again try to push the price above the moving averages. If they succeed, it will suggest that the DOT/USDT pair could rally to $9.17 and then to the overhead resistance at $10. The bears are likely to mount a strong defense at this level.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns down from the moving averages and breaks below $6.79. If that happens, the bears will try to sink the pair to the crucial support of $6. A break and close below this level could indicate the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the $0.75 support on Aug. 29 and reached the 20-day EMA ($0.83) on Aug. 30 but the Doji candlestick pattern indicates indecision among buyers and sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/33b1cbf3-0c02-4a54-bb0e-a8090977885a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls drive and sustain the price above the moving averages, the MATIC/USDT pair could start its northward march toward the overhead resistance at $1.05. This level is again likely to face stiff resistance from the bears.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that bears are defending the level vigorously. The pair could then again decline toward the strong support of $0.75. If this support cracks, the pair could drop to $0.63.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) climbed back above the important level of $0.000012 on Aug. 29, indicating that bulls are buying on dips. Buyers tried to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.000013) on Aug. 30 but the bears did not relent.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/dc0f625b-5251-4d01-8468-b135f7f94fd9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price is stuck between the 20-day EMA and $0.000012. This tight-range trading is unlikely to continue for long. If bears sink and sustain the price below $0.000012, the SHIB/USDT pair could drop to $0.000010.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price breaks above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $0.000014. The bulls have to overcome this barrier to open the doors for a possible rally to $0.000018.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDgvZWE1MTdiOGEtYmE3Mi00OWVjLWE5YzAtZjlhNjQzMjY4ZThhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220831ei8v000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/29: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, SHIB, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,807 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 August 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bulls are fighting to hold the $20,000 level and several altcoins have seized upon the range-bound trading by rallying up to 10%.\par \par \uc2 The United States equities markets are attempting to stabilize after the carnage on Aug. 26. On similar lines, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is also witnessing a see-saw battle near the psychological level of $20,000 with both the bulls and the bears vying for supremacy.\par \par \uc2 Although several analysts are \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Bitcoin in the near term, it has not stopped the whales from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-dollar-hits-new-20-year-high-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 accumulating at lower levels}}}\uc2 . Data from on-chain research firm Santiment shows that the number of whale addresses holding between 100 to 10,000 Bitcoin has risen by 103 in the past 30 days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/7939d22f-a690-4e94-86d6-9a6a43edaaf6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 In bear markets, rumors spread fast and could result in quick declines, but many times, the fears are unfounded. \uc2 Mt. Gox\uc2  creditors confirmed on \uc2 Twitter\uc2  that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/mt-gox-creditors-dismiss-rumors-of-massive-bitcoin-dump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rumor of a 137,000 Bitcoin dump}}}\uc2  spread on social media was false. The creditors said that the infrastructure needed to start the repayment was still notin place.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and major altcoins sustain the rebound? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin closed below the psychological level of $20,000 on Aug. 28 but the bears could not build upon their advantage. Buyers have pushed the price back above $20,000 on Aug. 29, which shows strong demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/aea43c30-02d3-4f79-ab0a-03602df7146a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair could rise to the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($21,620), which is an important level to keep an eye on. If bulls push the price above this resistance, it could signal that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is weakening. A break and close above the moving averages could open the doors for a possible rally to $25,211.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the downtrend line or the moving averages, it will suggest that bears are selling on every minor rise. The pair could then decline to the strong support zone of $18,910 to $18,626. The bulls are expected to defend this zone with all their might because if the support cracks, the pair could drop to the June low at $17,622.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($1,638) on Aug. 26 and broke below the neckline of the head and shoulders pattern. This completed the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup, indicating that the sellers are in control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/ffd4b967-60e1-484e-a5eb-230e7d503b70.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the bears could not sustain the price below the neckline, indicating buying on dips. The bulls are attempting to push and sustain the price above the neckline and challenge the overhead resistance at $1,700. If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to the psychological level of $2,000.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level or the moving averages, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels. If the price turns down and breaks below the neckline, the pair could drop to the strong support at $1,280. The bulls are expected to defend this level aggressively but if they fail to do that, the pair could plunge to $1,050.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($293) on Aug. 25 attracted heavy selling. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  turned down sharply on Aug. 26 and broke below the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($284).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/0cdc5c1c-b1d4-4a4e-8dc6-d07eadb8dae0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor positive is that the bulls did not allow the price to sustain below the strong support at $275. The buyers are attempting to push the price above the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could rally to the 20-day EMA where the bears may pose a strong challenge. The bulls will have to push the pair above $308 to open the doors for a possible rally to $338.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the moving average and breaks below $275, it will complete a head and shoulders pattern. This negative setup could start a decline to $240 and then to the target objective at $212.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls failed to sustain Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the moving averages on Aug. 26, indicating that the breakout may have been a bull trap. That intensified selling and the bears are attempting to pull the price to the strong support at $0.30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/da2a907e-b218-4575-9b1f-2b5cb6831779.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers are likely to defend the $0.30 support aggressively because if the support cracks, the XRP/USDT pair could start the next leg of the downtrend. The pair could then decline to $0.25 and later to the pattern target of $0.21.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off $0.30 with strength, it will indicate strong demand at lower levels. The bulls will then again attempt to push the price above the moving averages. If they can pull it off, the pair could rally to the strong overhead resistance at $0.39.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) continues to gradually slide toward strong support at $0.40. The bulls have bought the dips to this level on two previous occasions; hence, it may again attract buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/85f97a69-9012-4484-9fb9-6d8d0cabdefe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to push the price above the moving averages. If they succeed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to the downtrend line and later attempt an up-move to the $0.70 to $0.74 resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price once again turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest a lack of demand at higher levels. The bears will then try to sink the price below $0.40 and resume the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the strong support at $32 on Aug. 26, indicating that the range has broken down in favor of the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/a827cf70-99e6-4118-a2f1-e945ef494627.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to push the price back above the breakdown level of $32. If they succeed, the SOL/USDT pair could rise to the 20-day EMA ($36). This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close above it could increase the possibility of the pair remaining inside the $32 to $48 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears are in control. The pair could then decline to the vital support at $26. A break and close below this level could indicate the start of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the trendline of the ascending triangle pattern on Aug. 26, which invalidated the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. The price has dropped to the immediate support at $0.06.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/7d2ce24d-bd20-4be6-b7c0-84f357762cac.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level, it will suggest that bulls may be accumulating on dips. The buyers will then again try to push the price above the moving averages. If they manage to do that, the DOGE/USDT pair could rally to $0.08. A break and close above this level will be the first sign that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price breaks below $0.06, the selling could intensify and the pair could drop to the critical support at $0.05. The bulls are likely to defend this support with all their might because if the level cracks, the pair could resume its downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/these-3-altcoins-have-completely-ignored-the-bear-market-in-the-last-90-days"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 These 3 altcoins have completely ignored the bear market in the last 90 days}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) remains stuck inside the large range between $10 and $6. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($7.68) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate an advantage to bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/74269328-fe03-42bb-9ebb-be640aaa44d6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to push the price above the moving averages. If they manage to do that, the DOT/USDT pair could rally toward $9.17 and then to the overhead resistance at $10.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price once again turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that bears are selling on rallies. The pair could then decline to the crucial support at $6. The bears will have to sink and sustain the price below this level to suggest the start of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the immediate support at $0.000012 on Aug. 28 but the bears could not build upon the advantage. This suggests that bulls are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/615fb589-4a4a-459f-ade2-3c4002e4ebd8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.000012), the SHIB/USDT pair could attempt a rally to the overhead resistance at $0.000014. If the price turns down from this level, the SHIB/USDT pair could remain stuck between $0.000012 and $0.000014 for some time.\par \par \uc2 If bulls thrust and sustain the price above $0.000014, the pair could rally to the stiff resistance of $0.000018. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and plummets below the Aug. 28 intraday low.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) rebound met with stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($0.83) on Aug. 28, indicating that bears are defending the level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/56ed5e03-2c97-4d61-8991-bcdaddd5542d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The MATIC/USDT pair bounced off the strong support at $0.75 on Aug. 29, indicating that the bulls are buying the dips to the support of the range. The pair is stuck between the 20-day EMA and $0.75 but this tight-range trading is unlikely to continue for long.\par \par \uc2 If buyers drive the price above the moving averages, the pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $1.05 where the bears may again pose a strong challenge. Alternatively, if the price plummets below $0.75, the pair could decline to the strong support at $0.63.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDgvOWZjMDBjNDItMTMzNy00OGI1LTg3ZTItNTI1YTYzNjJiNTA3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220829ei8t000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/26: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 SOL\uc2 , DOGE, DOT, SHIB, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,689 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 August 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins followed stocks lower after the Fed's hawkish statements confirmed the central bank is serious about cuttin inflation.\par \par \uc2 Federal Reserve Chairman \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  warned that the central bank will continue to use the \u8220\'20\'1Ctools forcefully\u8221\'20\'1D to bring down inflation, which is close to its highest level in 40 years. He cautioned that the restrictive policy may remain for some time and warned that it could \u8220\'20\'1Cbring some pain to households and businesses.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The United States equities markets reacted negatively to Powell\u8217\'20\'19s comments with the Dow Jones Industrial Average {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2022/08/25/stock-market-futures-open-to-close-news.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dropping}}}\uc2  more than 600 points. The cryptocurrency markets also witnessed sharp selling with Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and most altcoins threatening to break below their immediate support levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/a22f8be9-fb22-400b-98c4-14ca8a05f558.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Along with a not-so-supportive macro environment, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s historical data for September also presents a negative picture. According to CoinGlass data, Bitcoin has witnessed an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-september-is-shaping-up-to-be-a-potentially-ugly-month-for-bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 average decline of 6% in September}}}\uc2  and barring 2015 and 2016, the month has produced negative returns for investors between 2013 and 2021.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and major altcoins remain weak in the near term? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s shallow rebound off the support line of the ascending channel indicated that bulls are cautious at higher levels. The downsloping 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($22,249) and the relative strength index (RSI) in the negative territory, indicate that bears have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/c662dd9d-e188-40b0-bc72-abfe67ed6d5d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Strong selling has pulled the price below the ascending channel on Aug. 26. If bears sustain the price below $20,762, the selling could intensify and the BTC/USDT pair could drop to $18,900. This level may again act as a strong support but if it breaks, the decline could extend to the June 18 intraday low at $17,622.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($22,414). Such a move will indicate that lower levels continue to attract buyers. The pair could then attempt a rally to the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Buyers could not push Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($1,697) on Aug. 25, indicating that bears are defending this level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/cee726ee-28c5-4145-88e7-20769d94669b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling picked up momentum and the bears have pulled the price below the 50-day SMA ($1,588). A close below this support could sink the ETH/USDT pair to $1,500. If the price slips below this crucial support, the pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders pattern. The target objective of this setup is $1,050.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the $1,500 support, the bulls will again attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $1,700. If they succeed, it will suggest that the pair could rise toward the overhead resistance at $2,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  above the 20-day EMA ($300) on Aug. 25 but the long wick on the candlestick suggests that bears are selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/159c6deb-82d8-4bda-975b-bd09ada6c398.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has turned down on Aug. 26 and the bears are attempting to sink the price below the immediate support at $275. If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders pattern. That could result in a decline to $240 and then to the pattern target at $212.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up and breaks above $308, it could catch the aggressive bears off guard. The pair could then rally to the overhead resistance of $338. If bulls clear this hurdle, the pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  inverse head and shoulders pattern.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the moving averages on Aug. 26 but the long wick on the candlestick suggests strong selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/23a218f0-6ad0-423e-8d48-65530ffc9591.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price turned down sharply and the bears are attempting to sink the XRP/USDT pair below the immediate support at $0.33. If they succeed, the next stop could be the critical support at $0.30. A break and close below this level could indicate the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off $0.30, it will suggest that bulls continue to buy at this level. That could increase the possibility that the pair may remain stuck between $0.30 and $0.39 for some more time.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) recovery turned down sharply from the 20-day EMA ($0.49) on Aug. 26, suggesting that the higher levels continue to attract strong selling by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/c18fb1a1-2af0-4805-b206-387a8bbaf5cb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price could reach the immediate support at $0.43 and if that level also gives way, the next stop could be the crucial level at $0.40. The bulls successfully defended this support on two previous occasions; hence, the level may again attract buying.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level or $0.40, the bulls will again try to clear the overhead hurdle at the moving averages. If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to the downtrend line where the bears may mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been gradually declining toward the strong support at $32, which suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/1995da96-7414-435e-ba9f-0a03e1f7c4ce.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($38) is sloping down and the RSI is in the negative territory, indicating advantage to bears. If the $32 support collapses, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to the vital support at $26. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break below it could signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the support at $32, it will suggest that bulls are buying the dips to this level. The buyers will have to push the price above the 50-day SMA ($39) to indicate that the range-bound action between $32 and $48 may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) marginally rose above the 20-day EMA ($0.07) on Aug. 25 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that bears are defending the level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/0473aa4f-8dfe-44a2-88d2-f90eb7506426.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Strong selling on Aug. 26 pulled the price below the trendline of the ascending triangle pattern. If the price sustains below the triangle, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. The DOGE/USDT pair could then decline to $0.06 and later to $0.05.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the current level, the buyers will again attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the pair could rally to $0.08 and thereafter to $0.09.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-price-pumps-and-dumps-amid-mysterious-51m-whale-transfers-what-s-next"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP price pumps and dumps amid mysterious $51M whale transfers \u8212\'20\'14 What's next?}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls could not push Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above the 50-day SMA ($7.82) in the past few days, indicating that bears continue to sell on minor rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/ef4fa2b4-cffe-42cf-a5f3-8b418d301a2a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($7.93) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears have a slight edge. The negative momentum could pick up if bears sink the price below the strong support at $7. If that happens, the DOT/USDT pair could decline to the crucial support at $6.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from the current level or $7 and rises above the moving averages, the pair could attempt a rally to $9.17 and then to the overhead resistance at $10.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  picked up and the bulls pushed the price above the overhead resistance at $0.000014 on 25 August. However, the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/5c35f0ec-1c99-485d-b9a9-23299b2a8e7d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers are currently attempting to sustain the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.000013). If they succeed, the SHIB/USDT pair could drop to the next support at $0.000012. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if it cracks, the decline could extend to $0.000010.\par \par \uc2 To invalidate this negative view, the buyers will have to push and sustain the price above $0.000014. If they manage to do that, the pair could rally to the stiff overhead resistance at $0.000018.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) rebound off the strong support at $0.75 is facing resistance near the 20-day EMA ($0.85). This suggests that the sentiment remains negative and bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/07445f73-0426-4de8-b439-a6bb20e2088c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers will make an attempt to sink the price below the strong support at $0.75. If they succeed, the MATIC/USDT pair could decline to $0.63. The bulls may mount a strong defense at this level but if the support cracks, the next stop could be $0.52.\par \par \uc2 This negative view could be invalidated in the near term if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the pair could attempt a rally to the stiff overhead resistance of $1.05.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDgvYTdiY2VkNzQtZDAwMC00NjVlLTkwZjMtYTk2NGFjNTlhZTU3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220826ei8q000dz\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 XRP\par \b \uc2 XRP price pumps and dumps amid mysterious $51M whale transfers \u8212\'20\'14 What's next?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  Yashu Gola \par \uc2 462 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 August 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 XRP risks declining further in the coming weeks despite its eye-grabbing intraday price moves.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  price saw a major spike on Aug. 26, hinting at a possible effect from some big traders.\par \par \uc2 Large XRP transfers, Ripple Swell Global event\par \par \uc2 Notably, XRP's price jumped 6% to $0.37, a two-week high, during the early London hours. The token's upside move occurred hours after its network processed three massive transfers worth $51 million involving {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/el-salvador-bitcoin-wallet-shows-strong-sign-of-adoption-exec-says"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto exchanges Bitso}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/el-salvador-bitcoin-wallet-shows-strong-sign-of-adoption-exec-says"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/el-salvador-bitcoin-wallet-shows-strong-sign-of-adoption-exec-says}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/alameda-research-and-ftx-merge-vc-operations-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/alameda-research-and-ftx-merge-vc-operations-report}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/alameda-research-and-ftx-merge-vc-operations-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 FTX, as highlighted}}}\uc2  by Whale Alert.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/193962e7-2b3b-4cdc-ad8c-24e0355c7bfe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD hourly price chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 XRP's gains also came as a part of a broader upside move that started on Aug. 25, a day after Ripple {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Ripple/status/1562501033469026304"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  its flagship event, "Ripple Swell Global," to be held in London in November 2022. The market has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/swell-the-news-xrp-drops-5-as-ripples-flagship-event-kicks-off"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seen similar reactions}}}\uc2  to the Swell event in the past.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  reversal setup in play\par \par \uc2 XRP's intraday spike left behind a "{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-12-30-btc-eth-xrp-ltc-bch-dot-ada-bnb-link-bsv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-12-30-btc-eth-xrp-ltc-bch-dot-\b  \highlight22ada\b0 \highlight22 -bnb-link-bsv}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-12-30-btc-eth-xrp-ltc-bch-dot-ada-bnb-link-bsv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Graveyard Doji," a \b  \highlight22bearish\b0 \highlight22  reversal candlestick}}}\uc2  with open, close and low prices near each other with a long upper wick. This candlestick suggests that the price rally witnessed at the beginning of the session was overwhelmed by bears by the end of it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/f5377656-d8cd-48c6-b6d9-3b7d0ac7e905.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USD four-hour price chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 XRP now trades nearly 4% below its intraday high, testing a support confluence. The confluence comprises the upper trendline of XRP's previous "ascending triangle" (at $0.35) and the 50-4H exponential moving average (50-4H EMA; the red wave in the chart above) near $0.343.\par \par \uc2 From a technical perspective, a break below the support confluence risks re-triggering the ascending triangle setup, with its profit target at around $0.33. In other words, a 7% price decline by September when measured from Aug. 26's price.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ripple-cto-lashes-back-at-vitalik-buterin-for-his-dig-on-xrp"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple CTO lashes back at Vitalik Buterin for his dig at XRP}}}\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a rebound after testing the support confluence could have XRP eye a recovery rally toward the $0.36\u8211\'20\'13$0.38 range (marked in red in the chart above). This area served as XRP's consolidation range in recent months.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDgvZGYyNzcwZWUtYzhhYi00NDBiLThlMzItOGZmZDVlMzRlMDk4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220826ei8q0008d\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/24: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, SHIB, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,909 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 August 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Crypto traders expect a range expansion once the Jackson Hole symposium is complete and the Fed\u8217\'20\'19s perspectives on inflation are made public.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and several major cryptocurrencies have been trading sideways as traders avoid taking large bets before the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2 's Jackson Hole Economic Symposium, which begins on Aug. 25. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-breakout-possible-as-whales-close-in-on-sideways-btc-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22  is likely to soar}}}\uc2  as investors get some clarity on the Fed's stance in the next few days.\par \par \uc2 On Aug. 23, a team led by \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  chief economist \uc2 Jan Hatzius{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.msn.com/en-us/money/markets/dont-count-on-the-fed-to-hike-by-75-basis-points-as-it-sticks-to-its-slowdown-at-jackson-hole-goldman-sachs-says/ar-AA112OPE?fromMaestro=true"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  that Fed chair \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  could sound dovish when he speaks on Aug. 26, reiterating that the central bank may move at a slower pace in future meetings. The analysts expect the Fed to raise rates by 50 basis points in the September meeting, which would be less than the 75 bps hike done in June and July.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/da894585-687e-46ab-9642-b234ad1e1678.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Although the short-term price action remains uncertain, on-chain data suggests that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/a-bullish-bitcoin-trend-reversal-is-a-far-fetched-idea-but-this-metric-is-screaming-buy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin may be undervalued}}}\uc2 , meaning it could provide strong returns if history repeats itself. According to Jarvis Labs resident analyst JJ, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s Market Capitalization versus Realized Capitalization indicator reading is at its lowest level since 2015. Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s bottom in 2015 and 2019 formed when the indicator reached a low reading, but that has reached extremely low levels in 2022.\par \par \uc2 What are the critical levels to watch on the upside and the downside? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been trading near the support line of the ascending channel since Aug. 19. Although the bulls have defended the support successfully, they have failed to achieve a strong rebound off it. This indicates that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/c333ad4d-8060-42fb-b7b3-88ea35076b4f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($22,523) has started to turn down and the relative strength index (RSI) is near 41, indicating that bears have a slight edge. If the price breaks below the support line of the channel, the selling could intensify and the BTC/USDT pair could drop to $18,900.\par \par \uc2 To invalidate this negative view, the bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the moving averages. If they do that, it will suggest that the pair could gradually climb to the resistance line of the channel near $26,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are aggressively defending the 50-day simple moving average ($1,571) as seen from the long tail on the Aug. 22 and 23 candlestick. Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) will now attempt to rise above the 20-day EMA ($1,712).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/55ad8b82-20f8-4204-a570-255a42721e18.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the ETH/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rise toward the stiff overhead resistance near $2,000. The bears are expected to defend this level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, it will suggest that bears are attempting to flip the 20-day EMA into resistance. The pair could then remain stuck between the moving averages for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below the 50-day SMA and the $1,500 support, the selling could pick up momentum and the pair may plummet toward the strong support at $1,280.\par \par \uc2 A tight squeeze is usually followed by an expansion in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  but it is difficult to preempt the direction of the breakout with certainty. Therefore, it is better to wait for the breakout to happen before initiating fresh positions.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rebound off the $275 level has been facing stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($301). A minor positive is that the bulls have not given up much ground as they expect the up-move to continue.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/fdbc9dd0-2fb0-46b2-b948-3343c9fcb9bd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $305, the BNB/USDT pair could rise toward the overhead resistance at $338. Such a move will form an inverse head and shoulders pattern, which will complete on a break and close above $338.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the pair could rally to $420 and then to $460. The pattern target of this \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup is $493.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down sharply from the current level, the pair could drop to $275. A break below this level will complete a head and shoulders pattern. The pair could then decline to $240 and later to $212.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  has been trading in a tight range between $0.33 and $0.35 for the past four days. This suggests indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/1be0d830-0453-4c2c-ba23-3907dc32e7d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below $0.33, the advantage could tilt in favor of the sellers. The XRP/USDT pair could then decline to the crucial level at $0.30. The bulls are likely to defend this level aggressively. A strong rebound off this level will suggest that the pair may remain range-bound between $0.30 and $0.39 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price breaks above $0.35 and the moving averages, it will suggest that bulls are attempting to form a floor at $0.33. The pair could then rise to $0.39 which is an important level to keep an eye on. If bulls clear this hurdle, the pair could rally to $0.48.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading between $0.43 and $0.47 for the past four days. Although the bulls bought the dip to $0.43 with vigor, they have not been able to clear the overhead hurdle at $0.47.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/67399227-f733-495b-9dd3-7a94940994e6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price action formed an inside-day candlestick pattern on Aug. 24, indicating indecision among buyers and sellers. If bulls thrust the price above $0.47, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to the moving averages. A break and close above this resistance could open the doors for a possible rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below $0.43, the pair could slide to the strong support at $0.40. This is an important level to watch out for because if it cracks, the pair could resume its downtrend.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is struggling to start a recovery as bears are posing a strong challenge near $37. The bears may now attempt to pull the price to the strong support at $32.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/e530fcfc-052a-4dec-82ad-c34b0a6f35e7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls have successfully defended the $32 support on two previous occasions, hence the level may again attract buyers. If the price rebounds off $32, the bulls will again try to push the SOL/USDT pair above the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $48. The buyers will have to propel the price above this level to signal a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and breaks below $32, it will suggest that bears are in control. The pair could then drop to the crucial support at $26.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the trendline on Aug. 22 but the bulls purchased the drop as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. However, a negative sign is that the bulls failed to clear the overhead resistance at the 50-day SMA ($0.07).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/8d7c714d-3c2d-41ae-bf71-fc1637677e10.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will once again attempt to sink the price below the trendline. If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair could decline to $0.06. If this support also cracks, the next stop could be the crucial level of $0.05.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA ($0.07), it will suggest strong demand at lower levels. The pair could then rise to the overhead resistance at $0.08 and later to $0.09.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-reasons-why-chiliz-is-up-35-this-week-where-is-chz-price-heading-next"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 3 reasons why Chiliz is up 35% this week \u8212\'20\'14 and where is CHZ price heading next?}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been attempting to climb above the 50-day SMA ($7.81) but the bears have held their ground. The long tail on the Aug. 22 and 23 candlestick shows strong buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/f354162d-251e-43ca-9e79-0b4f5b41bdb5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push the price above the 50-day SMA and the 20-day EMA ($8.07) to clear the path for a possible rally to $9.17 and then $10. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close above it could signal that the DOT/USDT pair may have bottomed out. The pair could then rise to the overhead resistance at $12.44.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels. The sellers will then attempt to sink the pair below $7. If they manage to do that, the pair could slide to $6.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade near the 20-day EMA ($0.000013) for the past few days, which suggests a state of indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/be45b9bd-0662-446e-a708-8042d3e13b9d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint suggest that the SHIB/USDT pair could remain range-bound for the next few days. If the price sustains below the 20-day EMA, the pair could slide to $0.000012. This is an important support for the bulls to defend because a break below it could open the doors for a fall to $0.000010.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up and breaks above $0.000014, the pair could start its northward journey toward $0.000018. The bulls will have to overcome this barrier to signal the start of a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) has been rising along the 50-day SMA ($0.82) for the past four days as bulls are buying the dips. The bears will attempt to stall the recovery at the 20-day EMA ($0.86).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/fc638264-a4c4-4742-99b8-b7850d488697.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will make one more attempt to sink the MATIC/USDT pair below the critical level at $0.75. If that happens, the pair could slide to the next major support at $0.63.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the support at $0.75 holds, the pair will attempt to climb above the 20-day EMA and rally to the overhead resistance at $1.05. The bulls will have to overcome this barrier to indicate the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDgvMjMzMjMyYjMtMDQ0NS00OTBjLTliYmEtZjA1ODdhNzMwZDVjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220824ei8o000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Cryptocurrencies react to Jackson Hole, Fed rate hike plans and a weakening bear market rally\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,923 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 August 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The price action in Bitcoin, altcoins and stocks reflects investors\u8217\'20\'19 anxiety, a bear market rally and the Jackson Hole economic symposium.\par \par \uc2 The European stock markets and the United States equities markets are both deep in the red on Aug. 22 as investors fear that aggressive rate hikes may not be off the table.\par \par \uc2 Another thing keeping investors nervous could be the upcoming Jackson Hole economic symposium, which is scheduled to begin on Aug. 25. Investors are concerned that Federal Reserve chairman \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  could further elaborate on the Fed's hawkish stance and plans for future interest rate hikes.\par \par \uc2 This macro uncertainty has kept the institutional investors away from the crypto markets. \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  data showed that crypto investment products recorded weekly volumes of $1 billion, which is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/summer-doldrums-crypto-volumes-are-down-55-according-to-coinshares"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 55% lower than the yearly average}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/a03332ec-231e-4881-a4b7-af2f2e3d23da.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 On-chain analytics resource Material Indicators said that Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has not broken below the July lows. This suggests that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whales-attack-sellers-at-22-3k-as-euro-drops-below-usd-parity"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bear market rally is not yet over}}}\uc2 . However, buyers will have to push the price above the 200-week moving average of near $23,000 to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and most major altcoins make a strong comeback in the next few days and what are the critical levels to watch out for? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The buyers defended the support line of the ascending channel on Aug. 19 and started a bounce but the recovery stalled at $21,800. This suggests that bears are posing a strong challenge near the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/6d2d851b-2dd1-4960-ba50-388c76b0fcb0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor positive is that the long tail on the Aug. 22 candlestick shows that bulls are attempting to defend the support line with vigor. If bulls push the price above $21,800, the BTC/USDT pair could rise to the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($22,725).\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this resistance, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned negative and traders are selling on rallies. That could increase the possibility of a break below the channel. If that happens, the selling momentum could pick up and the pair could plummet toward the June 18 low at $17,622.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if buyers thrust the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the channel for a few more days. The bulls will then try to push the price toward the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the 20-day EMA ($1,718) and the breakout level of $1,700 on Aug. 19, which suggests that traders who had purchased at lower levels were exiting their positions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/dc226560-3be4-423c-83ee-0eb90bac90db.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls attempted to stall the decline at the 50-day simple moving average (SMA)($1,549) but the weak bounce off it suggests a lack of aggressive buying at the level. This increases the likelihood of a break below the support.\par \par \uc2 If that happens and the ETH/USDT pair breaks below $1,500, the selling could intensify as the bulls may wait for the price to reach the next strong support before buying again. The pair could therefore decline to $1,280.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price bounces off the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA, traders who did not buy at the 50-day SMA may buy aggressively lest they miss out on the up-move. That could push the price toward $2,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounce off the strong support at $275 is facing stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($301) but a minor positive is that the bulls have not ceded ground to the sellers. This indicates that buyers expect the recovery to continue further.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/9601048d-0c68-4c3e-bbca-1034e0762ffc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rises above the 20-day EMA, the BNB/USDT pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $338. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close above it will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  inverse head and shoulders pattern. This setup has a pattern target of $493.\par \par \uc2 It may not be a straight dash to the target objective as bears may attempt to stall the rally at $420 and then again at $460.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below $275, the pair will complete a short-term head and shoulders pattern. That could start a decline toward the pattern target of $212.\par \par \uc2 It is better to wait for either pattern to complete before establishing a position because the setups tend to break down more often than not.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) remains stuck inside the range between $0.30 and $0.39. The bulls are attempting to defend the support at $0.33 but are facing stiff resistance at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/01d5f6e7-9d9b-4a16-a97e-82bef11da85d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below $0.33, the likelihood of a drop to $0.30 increases. This level has previously acted as a strong support; hence, traders may buy the dip expecting a rally back to $0.39.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price bounces off $0.33 and breaks above the moving averages. If that happens, the XRP/USDT pair may rally to the stiff overhead resistance at $0.39.\par \par \uc2 It is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout from a range. Therefore, traders may wait for the break to happen before establishing fresh positions.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) slipped below the 50-day SMA ($0.49) on Aug. 19, indicating that bears have the upper hand. Buyers tried to start a relief rally on Aug. 20 but the weak bounce shows a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/87219416-5179-4b41-9a98-719742a71c34.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to sink the price to the strong support at $0.40. This is an important level to keep an eye on because the bulls have defended the level successfully since May 12. A break and close below this support could signal the start of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off $0.40, the buyers will attempt to push the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair above the moving averages. If they manage to do that, the pair could rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke below the moving averages on Aug. 19, indicating that bears have the upper hand in the near term. The sellers will try to sink the price to the immediate support at $32.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/4956ab91-9be3-4a82-9abd-2191d28e646c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $32, the bulls will attempt to push the SOL/USDT pair above the moving averages. If they succeed, it will suggest that the pair may rise toward the overhead resistance at $48.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price slips below $32, the pair could slide to the crucial support at $26. The bulls are expected to defend this level with all their might because the failure to do so may signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the trendline on Aug. 20 but the bulls could not clear the overhead hurdle at the 20-day EMA ($0.07). This indicates that bears do not want to surrender their advantage and are selling on minor rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/764137b8-aeb0-4fe5-94d2-330d12528561.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair formed a Doji candlestick pattern on Aug. 21, which resolved to the downside on Aug. 22 and the price slipped below the trendline. If the price sustains below the trendline, the pair could further decline to $0.06. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break below it could result in a drop to the crucial support at $0.05.\par \par \uc2 To invalidate this \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view, the bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA. If that happens, it will suggest that bulls aggressively purchased the drop below the trendline. That could open the doors for a possible rally to the overhead resistance at $0.08.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-miners-exit-capitulation-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC to lose $21K despite miners\u8217\'20\'19 capitulation exit? 5 things to know in Bitcoin this week}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 50-day SMA ($7.78) on Aug. 19, indicating a lack of buying support from the bulls. The bears will now attempt to sink the price to the strong support at $6.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/62c197ad-ec10-4489-bc7c-c26533a114aa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 When the price is trading inside a large range, traders generally buy the rebound off the support by keeping a tight stop-loss. This improves the risk-to-reward ratio. Therefore, the likelihood of a bounce off the $6 support is high. If that happens, the DOT/USDT pair may remain range-bound between $6 and $10 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move could start on a break below $6 or on a break above $10. If the support at $6 gives way, the pair may start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a tussle near the 20-day EMA ($0.000013) with both the bulls and the bears vying for supremacy. The buyers are attempting to push the price above the overhead resistance at $0.000014 but the bears have held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/bcf0a5d9-69de-414c-b94c-c60eff9a6a75.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the relative strength index (RSI) is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. This balance could tilt in favor of the bulls if the price rises above $0.000014. If that happens, the SHIB/USDT pair could rise to the stiff overhead resistance at $0.000018.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks below $0.000012, the pair could tilt in favor of the sellers. The pair could then drop to the next strong support at $0.000010.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating in a large range between $0.75 and $1 for the past few days. The bulls purchased the dip to the support of the range but the rebound is facing stiff resistance from the bears at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/ed2571d8-0ba0-41dd-8ecc-17e34dc30807.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.86), the MATIC/USDT pair could attempt a rally to the overhead resistance at $1 where the bears are likely to mount a strong defense. If the price turns down from this resistance, the pair could extend its stay inside the range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below $0.75, it will suggest that bears are back in command. The pair could then decline to the next support at $0.63.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDgvZWZlMDUyYTYtMGMzNS00MjA3LThhNjEtMWZhMjQ3ZWMzOTJkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220822ei8m000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/19: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, SHIB, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,821 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 August 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins sold-off sharply on Friday, leading technical traders to forecast a possible drop to new yearly lows.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and most major altcoins {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-market-bloodbath-leads-to-over-500m-in-liquidations-in-24-hours"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 witnessed a sharp sell-off on Aug. 19}}}\uc2 , but there does not seem to be a specific trigger for the sudden drop. The sharp fall resulted in liquidations of more than $551 million in the past 24 hours, according to data from Coinglass.\par \par \uc2 Barring a V-shaped bottom, other formations generally take time to complete as buyers and sellers try to gain the upper hand. This tends to cause several random volatile moves that may be an opportunity for short-term traders, but long-term investors should avoid getting sucked into the noise.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/2e1de761-5756-4d92-a161-75a91af474a0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Glassnode data shows that investors who purchased Bitcoin in 2017 or earlier are just doing that by holding their positions. The percentage of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-liveliness-lowest-since-2021-amid-new-5-year-btc-hodl-record"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin supply dormant for at least five years}}}\uc2  hit a new all-time high of 24.351% on Aug. 18, suggesting that holders are not willing to sell in panic or for minor gains.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and most altcoins challenge their June lows or will the bulls buy the current dip? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s major trend is down but the bulls are attempting to form a bottom. The price has been rising inside an ascending channel for the past few days. The failure of the bulls to push the price above the resistance line of the channel may have tempted short-term traders to book profits. That has pulled the price below the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/0064ddad-2f97-4c50-8287-5cdc92fbce62.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair decline to the support line of the channel and when the price trades inside an ascending channel, traders usually attempt to buy the dips to the support line and sell near the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 Therefore, the likelihood of a bounce off the support line is high. If that happens, the buyers will try to push the pair above the moving averages. A break and close above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($23,265) could open the doors for a possible rally to the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate if the price breaks and sustains below the channel. Such a move could open the doors for a possible drop to $18,626.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) dipped below the 20-day EMA ($1,771) on Aug. 19, which is the first sign that the recovery may be losing steam. The important level to watch on the downside is $1,700 as it had acted as a strong support between Aug. 6 and 10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/94ccdf44-878b-417b-a1a3-5cb446c1cd4f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $1,700 with strength, it will suggest that bulls are attempting to flip this level into support. The ETH/USDT pair could then rise to $1,960 and later to $2,030. A break above this level could indicate the resumption of the uptrend. The pair could then rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price breaks and sustains below $1,700, it will suggest that traders who may have purchased at lower levels are aggressively closing their positions. That could pull the pair to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($1,519).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  plummeted below the 20-day EMA ($304) on Aug. 17, indicating that the short-term traders may be booking profits. The decline continued further and the price slipped to the 50-day SMA ($272) on Aug. 19. This is an important level for the bulls to defend if they want to keep the recovery intact.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/4b3714ae-e300-4433-a218-22a08340f982.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA, the BNB/USDT pair could rise toward the overhead resistance at $338. That could form an inverse head and shoulders pattern, which will complete on a break and close above $338.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks below the 50-day SMA, the pair could slide to $240. Such a move will suggest that the pair may remain stuck inside a large range between $183 and $338 for some time.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls failed to push Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $0.39 on Aug. 17, which suggests that bears continue to defend the level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/efd149a2-e7b5-44b4-9984-93d306f96138.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Usually, in a range, traders buy near the support and sell close to the resistance and that is what happened with the XRP/USDT pair.\par \par \uc2 The bulls may now wait for the price to drop near the support at $0.30 before buying. If the price rebounds off $0.30, it will indicate that the range-bound action may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The next directional move could start after buyers drive the price above $0.39 or bears sink the pair below $0.30. The price action inside a range is usually random and volatile. Hence, experienced traders generally wait for the breakout to happen before entering a position.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke below the 20-day EMA ($0.52) on Aug. 18, indicating that the bulls may have been hurrying to close their positions. This gave the bears a slight edge.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/f190aa0a-5d9a-466c-b24b-eb386b5e03dd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers pressed on with their advantage on Aug. 19 and pulled the price below the 50-day SMA ($0.49). This increases the possibility that the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could decline to the crucial support at $0.40.\par \par \uc2 The bulls have defended this level on two previous occasions, hence the odds favor a bounce off it. If that happens, the pair could oscillate between $0.40 and $0.60 for some time. The bears will have to sink the pair below $0.40 to start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the support line on Aug. 18 and the bulls tried to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($41). However, the bears defended the level successfully.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/7723e121-f6f4-474e-bea6-0b884809f53f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This exacerbated the selling on Aug. 19 and pulled the price below the 50-day SMA ($39). This invalidated the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern. The bears will now attempt to sink the SOL/USDT pair to $34.50.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $34.50, the pair could attempt a rally above the moving averages. If that happens, the pair could consolidate between $34.50 and $48 for some time. Conversely, a break below $34.50 could sink the pair to $31.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned down and broke below the breakout level of $0.08 on Aug. 18. This was the first indication that the break above $0.08 on Aug. 14 may have been a dead cat bounce.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/2fc01ead-4e22-4a46-a68c-7e3ef111dd8b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears continued their selling and have pulled the price to the trendline of the ascending triangle pattern. A break below this level could invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup and open the doors for a possible drop to $0.06. This level is likely to attract strong buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the current level, it will suggest that the bulls are attempting to defend the trendline. The buyers will have to push the DOGE/USDT pair back above $0.09 to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/nearly-55m-worth-of-bored-ape-cryptopunks-nfts-risk-liquidation-amid-debt-crisis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Nearly $55M worth of Bored Ape, CryptoPunks NFTs risk liquidation amid debt crisis}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) closed below the 20-day EMA ($8.46) on Aug. 17, which was the first indication that the break above $9 may have been a sucker\u8217\'20\'19s rally. Sellers took advantage of the situation and pulled the price below the 50-day SMA ($7.75) on Aug. 19.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/b8affe39-9cfc-44a3-be20-bf5b724c4ff4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This opens the doors for a possible drop to the crucial support at $6. This level acted as a strong support on two previous occasions; hence, the bulls will again try to defend the level with all their might.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $6, the DOT/USDT pair could continue to trade inside a large range for a few days. The next strong move could start after bulls push the price above $10 or bears sink the pair below $6.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 In a downtrend, strong rallies usually end up as bull traps and that is what happened with Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ). The buyers could not sustain the price above $0.000017 on Aug. 17 and build upon the momentum. That may have resulted in profit-booking by the short-term traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/bbea3d73-39b2-4d9a-bcdf-1045b73a9954.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to resume the up-move on Aug. 16 but the bears held their ground. That aggravated the selling pressure and the bears pulled the price below $0.000014 on Aug. 18. The bears will try to solidify their position by sinking the price below the 50-day SMA ($0.000012).\par \par \uc2 To invalidate this \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view, the bulls will have to push the price back above $0.000014. If they do that, it will suggest strong buying at lower levels and could clear the path for a possible rally to $0.000017. The SHIB/USDT pair could signal a trend change above $0.000018.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) could not sustain above the breakout level of $26.38 on Aug. 17, indicating that traders were rushing to the exit. The selling continued and the price broke below the 50-day SMA ($22.93) on Aug. 19.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/4e4f0a20-edd3-4f70-8dd3-d065f8df0a06.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls have to defend the support line or else the selling could intensify and the AVAX/USDT pair could decline to $16 and then to $13.71. A break and close below $13.71 could signal the start of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the support line, it will suggest that bulls are attempting to form a higher low. The buyers will have to push and sustain the price above $26.38 to gain the upper hand. Such a move will increase the likelihood of a break above $31.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDgvNTRhMTVhNTAtMGZkZC00OTMxLWE1YTMtNzgxZWJlMzMzMTY2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220819ei8j000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, SHIB, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,920 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 August 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Crypto markets corrected as traders grew nervous before the FOMC minutes, but the stress point is whether traders will \u8220\'20\'1Cbuy the dip.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) bounce fizzled out near $24,500 on Aug. 17, indicating that the recovery still faces stiff resistance from the bears. On-chain monitoring resource Material Indicators said the ask liquidity on the Fire Charts was similar to prior local tops.\par \par \uc2 Another reason for caution among crypto investors was that the recovery in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-hits-multi-day-low-as-data-warns-of-overbought-stocks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 S&P 500 was reaching extreme overbought levels}}}\uc2  in the near term. Jurrien Timmer, director of global macro at asset manager \uc2 Fidelity Investments\uc2 , said that 88% of stocks in the S&P 500 were trading above their 50-day moving average, which was \u8220\'20\'1Cstunning.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Some were also cautious as Michael Burry, the investor who famously shorted the 2008 housing bubble, almost {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/experts-explain-what-big-short-michael-burry-s-portfolio-dump-means-for-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 emptied his equity portfolio}}}\uc2  in the second quarter of this year in expectation of a sharp fall in the stock markets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/a6a18386-1e13-456b-a2ce-4506cf183f08.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 While the short-term looks uncertain, corporate investors who usually are in the game for the long term have increased their investments in the blockchain industry, including the crypto space. The top 40 publicly traded companies {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/google-invested-a-whopping-1-5b-into-blockchain-companies-since-september"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 invested approximately $6 billion into blockchain startups}}}\uc2  between September 2021 to June 2022, according to a blog by Blockdata on Aug. 17. That is more than three times the $1.9 billion invested by corporations between January 2021 to September 2021.\par \par \uc2 What are the critical levels on the downside that will suggest that the recovery could be faltering? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls attempted to push Bitcoin above the overhead resistance at $24,668 on Aug. 17 but the long wick on the candlestick shows that bears are defending the level aggressively. The price turned down and has reached the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($23,496). This level is likely to attract strong buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/166524bc-6d3a-461b-90b1-dc0f8439a495.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the relative strength index (RSI) has dropped close to the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. If the price sustains below the 20-day EMA, the balance could tilt in favor of the bears and the pair may drop to the 50-day SMA ($22,160).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the current level and breaks above $25,200, it will suggest that bulls are back in command. The BTC/USDT pair could then rally to $28,000 where the bears may again mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned up from $1,853 on Aug. 16 and the bulls tried to push the price above $2,000 on Aug. 17. However, the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that traders may be lightening positions on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/72b243e4-e7af-4a13-9aca-5dbc3b8c8b51.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to take advantage of the situation and attempt to pull the price to the strong support zone between the 20-day EMA ($1,772) and $1,700. This is an important zone for the bulls to defend if they want to keep the uptrend intact.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this support zone, the ETH/USDT pair could retest the resistance at $2,030. A break and close above this level could clear the path for a rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the $1,700 support cracks, the pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($1,492). That could delay the start of the next leg of the up-move and keep the pair range-bound for a few days.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The buyers tried to push {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  higher on Aug. 17 but the long wick on the candlestick suggests that bears are active at higher levels. That pulled the price to the 20-day EMA ($307).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/288bfdd3-370b-4800-ba5d-23b67a1bed31.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price slips below the 20-day EMA, the BNB/USDT pair could decline to the 50-day SMA ($270). This level may again attract buying and if the price rebounds off it, the pair could consolidate between $270 and $338 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price rebounds off the current level with strength. If that happens, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will then again attempt to clear the overhead resistance zone between $338 and $350. If they succeed, the pair could start a rally to $383 and then to $413.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully defended the zone between the moving averages and tried to push Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $0.39 on Aug. 17. The long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that bears are not willing to surrender and they continue to defend the overhead resistance with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/ae421c8a-affd-416f-877a-f6792cdad02f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks and closes below the 20-day EMA ($0.37), the next stop could be the 50-day SMA ($0.35). This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break and close below it could suggest that the XRP/USDT pair may continue its range-bound action between $0.30 and $0.39 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the moving averages, the bulls will again try to clear the overhead hurdle at $0.39. If they succeed, the pair could rally to $0.48 and then to $0.54.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) bounced off the breakout level of $0.55 on Aug. 16 but the bears continue to pose a strong challenge at higher levels as seen from the long wick on the Aug. 17 candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/b0996fd3-52f0-46be-beec-995de905a9eb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sharp selling by the bears has pulled the price to the important support at the $20-day EMA ($0.53). A break and close below this level will suggest that the short-term advantage has tilted in favor of the sellers. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then decline to the 50-day SMA ($0.49).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest strong demand at lower levels. The bulls will then try to resume the up-move by pushing the pair above $0.60. That could open the doors for a possible rally to $0.63 and then to $0.70.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) attempted a rebound off the 20-day EMA ($42) but the long wick on the Aug. 17 candlestick shows that the bears are selling on every minor rise.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/7dfd4dfa-ae99-476c-a716-a5a94a2e3662.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to sink the price below the support line. If they manage to do that, it will invalidate the developing \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern. The SOL/USDT pair could then decline to $37.50 and later to $34.50.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the moving averages, it will indicate that bulls may be accumulating on dips. The buyers will then try to push the price above the overhead resistance at $48. If they succeed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup will complete and the pair may start a rally to $60.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) below the breakout level of $0.08 on Aug. 15 but could not sustain the lower levels. The bulls purchased the dip aggressively and resumed the recovery on Aug. 16.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/48721f81-4901-4e18-9d91-93329785ffdd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to stall the recovery at $0.09 but if bulls do not allow the price to dip below $0.08, the likelihood of a rally to $0.10 increases. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close above it could signal a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.07) has started to turn up and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating that bulls have the upper hand. To invalidate this \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view, the bears will have to sink and sustain the price below the trendline of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fake-manchester-united-token-soars-3-000-after-elon-musk-jokes-about-buying-team"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Fake Manchester United token soars 3,000% after Elon Musk jokes about buying team}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully defended the 20-day EMA ($8.62) on Aug. 15 and 16 but could not achieve a strong rebound off it. Attempts by the bulls to push Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $9 met with stiff resistance on Aug. 17.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/1b59d168-d7db-49c5-a0dc-824aa3644660.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are attempting to sustain the price below the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, it could trap several aggressive bulls who may have purchased at higher levels. That could sink the DOT/USDT pair to the 50-day SMA ($7.72).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above $9, it will suggest that bulls are buying aggressively at lower levels. The bulls will then attempt to push the pair above the overhead resistance at $9.68 and resume the recovery. The pair could then rally to $10.80 and later to $12.44.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB's}}}\uc2  ) correction stalled at $0.000015 on Aug. 15 but the bulls are facing stiff resistance at the overhead resistance of $0.000017 as seen from the long wick on the Aug. 16 and 17 candlesticks.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/85a380d0-44d4-4091-95e8-53c7c0f7584b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure to clear the overhead hurdle may embolden the bears who will try to pull the price to the strong support at $0.000014. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break and close below it could weaken the positive momentum.\par \par \uc2 The SHIB/USDT pair could then remain stuck inside a large range between $0.000010 and $0.000018 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above the $0.000017 to $0.000018 overhead resistance zone, the pair could rise to $0.000022. If bulls clear this hurdle, the rally could extend to $0.000026.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) continues to slide toward the breakout level of $26.38. The bulls are likely to buy the dip and attempt to flip this level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/ce897796-7aaa-4f6e-bbb6-79e72e0d46c7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $26.38 with strength, the buyers will again try to push the AVAX/USDT pair above the overhead resistance at $31. If they succeed, the pair could rally to $33 and later to the pattern target of $39.05.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price breaks below the breakout level, several aggressive bulls may get trapped. That could result in a decline to the 50-day SMA ($22.70) and then to the support line of the ascending triangle.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDgvODAzMmJmMDMtNTU2ZS00NWJhLTliNDctMGNhNGFhNWJjMjRmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220817ei8h000e4\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/17: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, SHIB, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,917 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 August 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Crypto and stock markets corrected as traders grew nervous ahead of Wednesday\u8217\'20\'19s FOMC minutes, but the real stress point is whether traders will \u8220\'20\'1Cbuy the dip.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) bounce fizzled out near $24,500 on Aug. 17, indicating that the recovery still faces stiff resistance from the bears. On-chain monitoring resource Material Indicators said the ask liquidity on the Fire Charts was similar to prior local tops.\par \par \uc2 Another reason for caution among crypto investors was that the recovery in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-hits-multi-day-low-as-data-warns-of-overbought-stocks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 S&P 500 was reaching extreme overbought levels}}}\uc2  in the near term. Jurrien Timmer, director of global macro at asset manager \uc2 Fidelity Investments\uc2 , said that 88% of stocks in the S&P 500 were trading above their 50-day moving average, which was \u8220\'20\'1Cstunning.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Some were also cautious as Michael Burry, the investor who famously shorted the 2008 housing bubble, almost {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/experts-explain-what-big-short-michael-burry-s-portfolio-dump-means-for-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 emptied his equity portfolio}}}\uc2  in the second quarter of this year in expectation of a sharp fall in the stock markets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/a6a18386-1e13-456b-a2ce-4506cf183f08.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While the short-term looks uncertain, corporate investors who usually are in the game for the long term have increased their investments in the blockchain industry, including the crypto space. The top 40 publicly traded companies {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/google-invested-a-whopping-1-5b-into-blockchain-companies-since-september"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 invested approximately $6 billion into blockchain startups}}}\uc2  between September 2021 to June 2022, according to a blog by Blockdata on Aug. 17. That is more than three times the $1.9 billion invested by corporations between January 2021 to September 2021.\par \par \uc2 What are the critical levels on the downside that will suggest that the recovery could be faltering? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls attempted to push Bitcoin above the overhead resistance at $24,668 on Aug. 17 but the long wick on the candlestick shows that bears are defending the level aggressively. The price turned down and has reached the 20-day exponential moving average ($23,496). This level is likely to attract strong buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/166524bc-6d3a-461b-90b1-dc0f8439a495.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the relative strength index (RSI) has dropped close to the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. If the price sustains below the 20-day EMA, the balance could tilt in favor of the bears and the pair may drop to the 50-day SMA ($22,160).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the current level and breaks above $25,200, it will suggest that bulls are back in command. The BTC/USDT pair could then rally to $28,000 where the bears may again mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned up from $1,853 on Aug. 16 and the bulls tried to push the price above $2,000 on Aug. 17. However, the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that traders may be lightening positions on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/72b243e4-e7af-4a13-9aca-5dbc3b8c8b51.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to take advantage of the situation and attempt to pull the price to the strong support zone between the 20-day EMA ($1,772) and $1,700. This is an important zone for the bulls to defend if they want to keep the uptrend intact.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this support zone, the ETH/USDT pair could retest the resistance at $2,030. A break and close above this level could clear the path for a rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the $1,700 support cracks, the pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($1,492). That could delay the start of the next leg of the up-move and keep the pair range-bound for a few days.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The buyers tried to push Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) higher on Aug. 17 but the long wick on the candlestick suggests that bears are active at higher levels. That pulled the price to the 20-day EMA ($307).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/288bfdd3-370b-4800-ba5d-23b67a1bed31.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price slips below the 20-day EMA, the BNB/USDT pair could decline to the 50-day SMA ($270). This level may again attract buying and if the price rebounds off it, the pair could consolidate between $270 and $338 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price rebounds off the current level with strength. If that happens, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will then again attempt to clear the overhead resistance zone between $338 and $350. If they succeed, the pair could start a rally to $383 and then to $413.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully defended the zone between the moving averages and tried to push {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  above the overhead resistance at $0.39 on Aug. 17. The long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that bears are not willing to surrender and they continue to defend the overhead resistance with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/ae421c8a-affd-416f-877a-f6792cdad02f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks and closes below the 20-day EMA ($0.37), the next stop could be the 50-day SMA ($0.35). This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break and close below it could suggest that the XRP/USDT pair may continue its range-bound action between $0.30 and $0.39 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the moving averages, the bulls will again try to clear the overhead hurdle at $0.39. If they succeed, the pair could rally to $0.48 and then to $0.54.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) bounced off the breakout level of $0.55 on Aug. 16 but the bears continue to pose a strong challenge at higher levels as seen from the long wick on the Aug. 17 candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/b0996fd3-52f0-46be-beec-995de905a9eb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Sharp selling by the bears has pulled the price to the important support at the $20-day EMA ($0.53). A break and close below this level will suggest that the short-term advantage has tilted in favor of the sellers. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then decline to the 50-day SMA ($0.49).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest strong demand at lower levels. The bulls will then try to resume the up-move by pushing the pair above $0.60. That could open the doors for a possible rally to $0.63 and then to $0.70.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) attempted a rebound off the 20-day EMA ($42) but the long wick on the Aug. 17 candlestick shows that the bears are selling on every minor rise.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/7dfd4dfa-ae99-476c-a716-a5a94a2e3662.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to sink the price below the support line. If they manage to do that, it will invalidate the developing \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern. The SOL/USDT pair could then decline to $37.50 and later to $34.50.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the moving averages, it will indicate that bulls may be accumulating on dips. The buyers will then try to push the price above the overhead resistance at $48. If they succeed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup will complete and the pair may start a rally to $60.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) below the breakout level of $0.08 on Aug. 15 but could not sustain the lower levels. The bulls purchased the dip aggressively and resumed the recovery on Aug. 16.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/48721f81-4901-4e18-9d91-93329785ffdd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to stall the recovery at $0.09 but if bulls do not allow the price to dip below $0.08, the likelihood of a rally to $0.10 increases. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close above it could signal a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.07) has started to turn up and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating that bulls have the upper hand. To invalidate this \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view, the bears will have to sink and sustain the price below the trendline of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fake-manchester-united-token-soars-3-000-after-elon-musk-jokes-about-buying-team"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Fake Manchester United token soars 3,000% after Elon Musk jokes about buying team}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully defended the 20-day EMA ($8.62) on Aug. 15 and 16 but could not achieve a strong rebound off it. Attempts by the bulls to push Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $9 met with stiff resistance on Aug. 17.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/1b59d168-d7db-49c5-a0dc-824aa3644660.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are attempting to sustain the price below the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, it could trap several aggressive bulls who may have purchased at higher levels. That could sink the DOT/USDT pair to the 50-day SMA ($7.72).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above $9, it will suggest that bulls are aggressively buying at lower levels. The bulls will then attempt to push the pair above the overhead resistance at $9.68 and resume the recovery. The pair could then rally to $10.80 and later to $12.44.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) correction stalled at $0.000015 on Aug. 15 but the bulls are facing stiff resistance at the overhead resistance of $0.000017 as seen from the long wick on the Aug. 16 and 17 candlesticks.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/85a380d0-44d4-4091-95e8-53c7c0f7584b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure to clear the overhead hurdle may embolden the bears who will try to pull the price to the strong support at $0.000014. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break and close below it could weaken the positive momentum.\par \par \uc2 The SHIB/USDT pair could then remain stuck inside a large range between $0.000010 and $0.000018 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above the $0.000017 to $0.000018 overhead resistance zone, the pair could rise to $0.000022. If bulls clear this hurdle, the rally could extend to $0.000026.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) continues to slide toward the breakout level of $26.38. The bulls are likely to buy the dip and attempt to flip this level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/ce897796-7aaa-4f6e-bbb6-79e72e0d46c7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $26.38 with strength, the buyers will again try to push the AVAX/USDT pair above the overhead resistance at $31. If they succeed, the pair could rally to $33 and later to the pattern target of $39.05.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price breaks below the breakout level, several aggressive bulls may get trapped. That could result in a decline to the 50-day SMA ($22.70) and then to the support line of the ascending triangle.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDgvODAzMmJmMDMtNTU2ZS00NWJhLTliNDctMGNhNGFhNWJjMjRmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220817ei8h000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/15: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, SHIB, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,862 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 August 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins met selling at key overhead resistance levels and investors are unsure whether traders will buy the current dip.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the $25,000 level. A clear winner may not emerge in the short term due to a lack of a catalyst and because there is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/final-week-of-the-bear-rally-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 no major macro economic data scheduled}}}\uc2  for this week in the United States. Data points from Asia or Europe may increase \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but they are unlikely to start a new directional move.\par \par \uc2 Anthony Scaramucci\uc2 , founder and managing partner of \uc2 Skybridge Capital\uc2 , in an interview with CNBC, advised investors to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/scaramucci-highlights-key-factors-why-crypto-market-will-soon-recover"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ride out the current uncertainty}}}\uc2  in cryptocurrencies and \u8220\'20\'1Cstay patient and stay long term.\u8221\'20\'1D He expects Bitcoin to reward investors immensely with a sharp uptrend over the next six years.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/86b22232-430e-4091-9f4b-df63060c896e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Along with the focus on Bitcoin, investors are also keeping a close eye on Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) ahead of its Merge scheduled for Sept. 15. A whale address that had participated in the genesis ICO but had remained dormant for three years has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-ico-era-whale-address-transfer-145-000-eth-weeks-before-the-merge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 transferred about 150,000 Ether}}}\uc2  on Aug. 14. This has led to differing views with some speculating that the whale may dump his holdings after the Merge but others believe that the transfers may have been done to stake the huge quantity of Ether.\par \par \uc2 Could buying emerge at lower levels and resume the up-move in Bitcoin and the altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to resume the up-move in Bitcoin but the bears sold aggressively at $25,211 and pulled the price down to the 20-day exponential moving average ($23,483). This resulted in the formation of an outside-day candlestick pattern on Aug. 15.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/dd1b2b16-717a-4169-b76a-b869cc2b9fe3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The gradually upsloping 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory indicate advantage to buyers. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bulls are buying the dips to this level. That could improve the prospects of a break and close above $24,668.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the pair could start its northward march toward $28,000 where the bears may again pose a strong challenge.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the pair could drop to the 50-day simple moving average ($22,037) and later to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether repeatedly rose above the psychological resistance at $2,000 for the past two days but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that bears are posing a stiff challenge at this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/77404e2b-7dc1-450d-869c-864aaf2b576d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair could decline to the breakout level at $1,700. This is an important level to watch out for because if bulls flip $1,700 into support, it will increase the likelihood of a break above $2,000. If that happens, the pair could rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($1,756) and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that bulls are in control. To invalidate this \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view, bears will have to sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA. That could sink the pair to the 50-day SMA ($1,465).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) up-move hit a hurdle at the overhead resistance at $338. The bears will now try to sink the price to the immediate support at the 20-day EMA ($306).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/f3aa3bdc-81ae-4469-92dc-05a61e3b8ba7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this support, the buyers will make another attempt to push the BNB/USDT pair above the $338 to $350 resistance zone. The upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory indicate the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the short-term traders may rush to the exit and that could pull the pair to the 50-day SMA ($266).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  above the overhead resistance at $0.39 on Aug. 13 and Aug. 14 but the bears held their ground. This may have attracted profit-booking from the short-term traders which pulled the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.37).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/0d389152-a27e-4a60-a895-4fa2220a42d3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below the 50-day SMA, the XRP/USDT pair could stay range-bound between $0.30 and $0.39 for some more time. The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint also suggest a consolidation in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the moving averages, it will indicate that lower levels are attracting buyers. The bulls will then again try to clear the overhead hurdle and push the pair to $0.48 and later to $0.54.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $0.55 on Aug. 13 but could not maintain the momentum on Aug. 14. This suggests that bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/8c78e33f-9158-42ef-9658-4d0acb20a6ea.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price turned down on Aug. 15 and reached the breakout level of $0.55. The zone between $0.55 and the 20-day EMA ($0.53) is likely to attract strong buying by the bulls. If the price rebounds off this zone, the buyers will again attempt to resume the up-move and push the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair to $0.63 and then to $0.70.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the break above $0.55 may have been a bull trap. The pair could then drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.49).\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rose to the overhead resistance at $48 on Aug. 13 but the bulls could not overcome this barrier. The bulls again tried to clear the overhead hurdle on Aug. 15 but the bears did not relent.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/69b25d63-c303-4420-baa0-af0bcabe7d49.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the SOL/USDT pair breaks below the 20-day EMA ($42), the next stop could be the support line. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break and close below it could invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern. The pair could then decline to $32.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again try to push and sustain the pair above $48. If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup will complete and the pair could rally to $60.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($0.07) on Aug. 12 and broke above the overhead resistance at $0.08 on Aug. 14. This completed the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern but the bulls could not sustain the breakout.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/730af593-1a8f-4f4c-938f-e26b90233022.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears sold at higher levels and pulled the price back below the breakout level on Aug. 15. A minor positive is that lower levels are attracting buyers, as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. If the price sustains above $0.08, the buyers will try to resume the up-move and push the DOGE/USDT pair to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price slips below the moving averages and the trendline of the triangle, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. The pair could then sink to $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-focused-venture-firm-dragonfly-acquires-hedge-fund-bloomberg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto-focused venture firm Dragonfly acquires hedge fund: Bloomberg}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) rose above the overhead resistance of $9.65 on Aug. 13 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This may have tempted the short-term traders to book profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/88695cd9-605b-45e7-b5d9-e2036b6b9173.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOT/USDT pair dipped below the breakout level of $9 on Aug. 14 and the price reached the 20-day EMA ($8.63) on Aug. 15. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break below it could suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. The pair could then decline to the 50-day SMA ($7.68) and stay range-bound for some time.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will try to clear the overhead resistance at $9.68. If they pull it off, the pair could rise to $10.80 and later to $12.44.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) had been trading above $0.000012 since Aug. 7 but the up-move had failed to pick up momentum. That changed with the sharp rally on Aug. 14, which pushed the price above the overhead resistance at $0.000017.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/92f2a76a-99fc-47ba-82a6-bde18773e930.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the bears have not given up. They sold the rise above $0.000017 and pulled the price back below the level on Aug. 15. The SHIB/USDT pair could find support at $0.000015 and then at $0.000014. If the price rebounds off either level, the buyers will again try to clear the overhead hurdle. If they succeed, the pair could rally to $0.000022.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price breaks below $0.000014, it will indicate that the pair could oscillate in a large range between $0.000010 and $0.000018 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to push Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance on Aug. 13 but the bears stalled the attempt at $30.35. This suggests that bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/bee9de95-4be1-4301-85b2-08b43004e36b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The AVAX/USDT pair could decline to the breakout level of $26.38, which is just above the 20-day EMA ($26.34). The bulls are expected to defend this level with vigor. If the price rebounds off $26.38, it will suggest demand at lower levels. The pair could then consolidate between $26.38 and $31 for some time.\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below $26.38, several aggressive bulls may get trapped. That could sink the pair to the 50-day SMA ($22.39).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the current level and rises above $31, it will suggest the start of a rally to $33 and later to the pattern target of $39.05.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDgvMTk2YjBiODYtZmQ4OS00NTA5LWIyMjQtNTYzMThjMjJlODFmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220815ei8f000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Final week of the bear rally\u8217\'20\'19 \u8212\'20\'14 5 things to know in Bitcoin this week\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  William Suberg \par \uc2 1,639 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 August 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin starts the week volatile as bears and bulls square off over BTC price action.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) enters a new week with a bang after sealing its highest weekly close since mid-June \u8212\'20\'14 can the good times continue?\par \par \uc2 After a volatile weekend, BTC/USD managed to restrict losses into the later portion of the weekend to produce a solid green candle on weekly timeframes.\par \par \uc2 In what could shape up to be the last \u8220\'20\'1Cquiet\u8221\'20\'1D week of the summer, bulls have time on their hands in the absence of major macro market drivers involving the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Fundamentals remain strong on Bitcoin, which is due to an increase in its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-for-beginners/how-to-mine-bitcoin-a-beginners-guide-to-mine-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 mining}}}\uc2  difficulty for the second time in a row in the coming days.\par \par \uc2 On derivatives markets, encouraging signs are also present, with higher price levels accompanied by \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  data over sentiment.\par \par \uc2 The question for hodlers now is thus how robust the rally is and whether it is just that: a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  countermove within a broader bear market.\par \par \uc2 Cointelegraph presents five factors which may influence price this week and help decide on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s next steps.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin embraces \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  after multi-week high close\par \par \uc2 At around $24,300, the Aug. 14 weekly close was the best in two months for BTC/USD.\par \par \uc2 The weekly chart shows a steady grind upwards continuing to take shape after the June lows, and last week\u8217\'20\'19s candle totaled around $1,100 or 4.8%.\par \par \uc2 An impressive move by 2022, the gains sparked some \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  overnight into the first Wall Street trading day of the week, BTC/USD continuing to hit $25,200 on exchanges before reversing noticeably under the weekly close level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/d23a7533-ee25-42c1-b306-786efb29c0c4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-week candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Such {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hits-25k-as-bearish-voices-call-btc-price-double-top"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 moves characterized recent days}}}\uc2 , leading to little surprise for traders who continue to act cautiously on shorter timeframes.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CA new week begins, with the bears stepping in so far to retest some key levels,\u8221\'20\'1D popular trading account Crypto Tony {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoTony__/status/1559062806892347392"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2  in part of his latest \uc2 Twitter\uc2  update on the day:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COnce again, we should see an interesting week with price action. Been all over the shop on the lower time frames.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Should unpredictability keep coming, the chances of a downmove are clear, according to on-chain monitoring resource Material Indicators.\par \par \uc2 Following the close, the weekly chart began signaling \u8220\'20\'1Cdownward momentum,\u8221\'20\'1D it {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MI_Algos/status/1558978782907752448"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 warned}}}\uc2 , while daily timeframes were \u8220\'20\'1Cflat\u8221\'20\'1D as per its proprietary trading tools.\par \par \uc2 Its creator, Material Scientist, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Mtrl_Scientist/status/1558939011707797510"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 described}}}\uc2  this week as the \u8220\'20\'1Cfinal week of the bear rally\u8221\'20\'1D in his own comments.\par \par \uc2 Still entertaining a much deeper correction \u8212\'20\'14 perhaps unsurprisingly \u8212\'20\'14 was gold bug Peter Schiff, who maintained that $10,000 was still on the cards.\par \par \uc2 Just to put the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Bitcoin?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Bitcoin}}}\uc2  rally into perspective, take a look at this chart. The pattern remains very \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . There's both a double top and a head and shoulders top. There's a rising wedge forming below the neckline. At a minimum support will be tested below $10K. Look out below! {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/OHNhwsgxxs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/OHNhwsgxxs}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Peter Schiff (@PeterSchiff) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/PeterSchiff/status/1558841585726529541?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 14, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 On a longer-term basis, however, fellow trader and analyst Rekt Capital was calm on BTC price action.\par \par \uc2 A spot price below $25,000, he said, should be used to dollar cost average (DCA) into Bitcoin \u8212\'20\'14 buying a set amount per set period \u8212\'20\'14 until the next block subsidy halving event in 2024.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CTo succeed in Crypto, you need a dollar-cost averaging strategy, an investing thesis, a vision, & patience,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rektcapital/status/1558806537195380739"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2 Twitter\uc2  followers over the weekend:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMy DCA strategy is anything sub $25000. My thesis is based on the 2024 Halving event Vision is seeing Bull peak a ~year post-Halving. Now I\u8217\'20\'19m just patient.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Macro remains on a \u8220\'20\'1Cknife edge\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 After last week\u8217\'20\'19s United States inflation print, the coming five trading days look comparatively calm from a macro perspective.\par \par \uc2 The Fed is quiet, leaving only unexpected events in Europe or Asia to impact market performance.\par \par \uc2 The likelihood of crypto continuing knee-jerk reactions to macro triggers beyond inflation could already be lower than many think, however, according to one popular analyst.\par \par \uc2 In a fresh market update for his trading suite, DecenTrader Filbfilb {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.decentrader.com/market_updates/bitcoin-market-update-positive-cpi-data-what-next/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eyed}}}\uc2  decreasing correlation between BTC and what he called \u8220\'20\'1Clegacy markets\u8221\'20\'1D more broadly.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin was following a high correlation with legacy markets as shown below with the S&P500 in white and NASDAQ in blue, however since reaching the most recent bottom, all of the downside on the legacy markets has been regained and Bitcoin has failed to follow suit,\u8221\'20\'1D he wrote alongside a comparative chart.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/ebc40df5-613a-414f-960b-02fe03644c2e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD vs. Nasdaq mini futures vs. S&P 500 mini futures chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Since June\u8217\'20\'19s $17,600 lows, Bitcoin has not in fact rallied as strongly as its prior correlation would dictate, Filbfilb added, arguing that spot price should be above $30,000.\par \par \uc2 The reason lies in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/analysts-assess-the-aftermath-of-the-terra-luna-collapse-cointelegraph-interview"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/analysts-assess-the-aftermath-of-the-terra-luna-collapse-cointelegraph-interview}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/analysts-assess-the-aftermath-of-the-terra-luna-collapse-cointelegraph-interview"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Terra and Celsius debacles}}}\uc2 , providing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/celsius-network-is-bankrupt-so-why-is-cel-price-is-up-4-000-in-two-months"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 something of a perfect storm}}}\uc2  if taken in tandem with concerns over inflation and the Fed\u8217\'20\'19s reaction to it.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhat has not changed, is Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s propensity to be at the mercy of the Fed\u8217\'20\'19s policy to combat the inflation. Better than anticipated inflation data on Wednesday being the most recent example, which let Bitcoin take a leap north, alongside equities,\u8221\'20\'1D the update continued:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMoving forwards, the CPI data and following monetary policy decisions are going to continue to be paramount in determining what happens next.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Geopolitical factors including the Russia-Ukraine conflict, tensions over Taiwan and the looming European energy crisis provide further risk factors. The macro market situation, Filbfilb concluded, therefore remains on a \u8220\'20\'1Cknife edge.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Bucking the trend on the day, meanwhile, is news from China, which enacted a snap rate cut on disappointing economic data.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CJuly\u8217\'20\'19s economic data is very alarming,\u8221\'20\'1D Raymond Yeung, Greater China economist at \uc2 Australia & New Zealand Banking Group Ltd\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2022-08-15/china-central-bank-unexpectedly-cuts-key-rate-to-boost-growth?sref=323RPL5z"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  in response:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAuthorities need to deliver a full-fledged support from property to Covid policy in order to arrest further economic decline.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Lex Moskovski, CEO of Moskovski Capital, meanwhile, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/mskvsk/status/1559025061746642945"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 forecasted}}}\uc2  that all central banks would end up lowering, not raising, interest rates:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThey all will pivot,\u8221\'20\'1D he reacted.\par \par \uc2 Funding rates healthy despite run to $25,000\par \par \uc2 Taking a look at the impact of current spot price action on trading habits, meanwhile, it appears that conditions may still favor further upside.\par \par \uc2 Analyzing derivatives markets, Philip Swift, a builder at DecenTrader and founder of data resource Look Into Bitcoin, highlighted negative funding rates.\par \par \uc2 Indicating increasing conviction among traders that downside is due, moderate negative rates are, in fact, often the foundation for further gains. This is because the market expects downside and does not overly bet on gains materializing, allowing for short positions to be \u8220\'20\'1Csqueezed\u8221\'20\'1D by smarter money.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin, along with crypto markets in general, has a habit of doing the exact opposite of that which is expected by the majority.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CInteresting to see Funding Rate dip negative at times on this recent grind up for $BTC,\u8221\'20\'1D Swift {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/PositiveCrypto/status/1559036539094671362"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 commented}}}\uc2 , uploading a chart showing price behavior during similar setups in the past:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CNote how price has pumped after each occasion.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/83624a69-3d65-4df5-8b1c-f916610dee1a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD funding rates annotated chart. Source: Philip Swift/ \uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, data from analytics resource Coinglass {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coinglass.com/funding/BTC"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 showed}}}\uc2  the extent of negative funding relative to the weeks after the June spot price lows.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/1f07d927-48ee-4474-8b78-5ec8dcbde9bd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC funding rates chart. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 Difficulty due a second straight increase\par \par \uc2 For Bitcoin network fundamentals, meanwhile, it is a case of slow recovery rather than a race higher.\par \par \uc2 The latest data from statistics resource BTC.com {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://btc.com/stats/diff"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shows}}}\uc2  miners gradually returning to historical levels of activity.\par \par \uc2 Difficulty, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/largest-difficulty-drop-since-july-2021-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 after months of decline}}}\uc2 , is set to increase for the second time in a row at the upcoming automated readjustment this week.\par \par \uc2 While modest, the forecast 0.9% increase shows that competition among miners is nonetheless increasing and that higher prices are cathartic to what has been a highly pressured part of the Bitcoin ecosystem this year.\par \par \uc2 At the same time, hash rate estimates \u8212\'20\'14 an expression of the processing power dedicated to mining \u8212\'20\'14 remain flat below 200 exahashes per second (EH/s).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/b4591e7d-4c5d-4ea7-bdf8-ee9bdbcc1cfc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin network fundamentals overview (screenshot). Source: BTC.com\par \par \uc2 4-month highs for Crypto Fear & Greed Index\par \par \uc2 A two-month high for Bitcoin spot price action may be nice to look at, but it is not the only aspect of the market clawing back some serious lost ground this week.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/top-5-cryptocurrencies-to-watch-this-week-btc-ada-uni-link-chz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Top 5 cryptocurrencies to watch this week: BTC, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , UNI, LINK, CHZ}}}\par \par \uc2 According to the sentiment gauge the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://alternative.me/crypto/fear-and-greed-index/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto Fear & Greed Index}}}\uc2 , there is less \u8220\'20\'1Cfear\u8221\'20\'1D among crypto market participants than at any point since early April.\par \par \uc2 The latest data shows the Index, which creates a normalized score from a basket of mood factors, has retraced all the losses engendered by the Terra blowout and beyond.\par \par \uc2 Over the weekend, that score hit 47/100, its best since April 6, declining to 45/100 on the day.\par \par \uc2 While this corresponds to \u8220\'20\'1Cfear\u8221\'20\'1D being the overriding market force, the number is a far cry from the depths of \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme fear\u8221\'20\'1D which lingered for a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-s-longest-extreme-fear-streak-finally-breaks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 record period of time}}}\uc2  in 2022. The Index\u8217\'20\'19s lows this year were in mid-June, which printed a score of just 6/100.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/18d33e33-12dd-48d4-becf-42f8eaef7e7d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto Fear & Greed Index (screenshot). Source: Alternative.me\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDgvMWVkZjZmOWItNWU0Zi00OWY5LWI2MjEtZjJkYzJkZDcwYmRjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220815ei8f0002t\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Top 5 cryptocurrencies to watch this week: BTC,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , UNI, LINK, CHZ\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,638 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 August 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price is targeting $25,000 and holding this level could trigger breakouts in \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , UNI, LINK and CHZ.\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 rose for the fourth successive week as investors cheered on signs that inflation may have peaked. Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and select altcoins also extended their recovery, suggesting that investors are increasing their exposure to risk assets.\par \par \uc2 A similar trend has played out in the cryptocurrency markets. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/altcoins-for-beginners/what-is-an-altcoin-a-beginners-guide-to-cryptocurrencies-beyond-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Altcoins}}}\uc2 , led by Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), have outperformed Bitcoin after {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-hits-8-month-highs-in-btc-as-money-heads-for-riskier-altcoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 clarity on Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s Merge}}}\uc2 , according to analysts at Glassnode.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/bbd7edaf-95a4-4f87-84b9-246a9b1aaec4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, trading firm QCP Capital is cautious about the momentum in the altcoin market. They highlighted that the open interest on Ether options had surged to $8 billion, exceeding Bitcoin option OI which was at $5 billion. Glassnode suggested that traders have been booking profits on the spread between their spot long Ether versus the quarterly short Ether futures positions.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and the altcoins extend their recovery in the next few days? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-5 cryptocurrencies that may outperform in the near term.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin rose above the overhead resistance of $24,668 on Aug. 13 and Aug. 14 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This indicates that bears are selling on rallies but repeated breach of an overhead resistance tends to weaken it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/d1a17efa-1613-4fbe-a6d2-6a9dc05555da.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The gradually upsloping 20-day exponential moving average of $23,414 and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If bulls sustain the price above $25,000, the momentum could pick up further and the BTC/Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) pair could rally to $28,000.\par \par \uc2 This level may act as a stiff resistance but if bulls clear this hurdle, the rally could extend to $32,000. The critical level to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA. A bounce off it will indicate that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears remain active at higher levels. The pair could then drop to the 50-day simple moving average of $21,976.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/4e697163-e36a-4c41-a909-43dfe6269707.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The $24,668 level is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears. The upsloping moving averages indicate advantage to buyers but the negative divergence on the RSI suggests the momentum may be weakening.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below the 20-EMA, it will signal a minor advantage to the bears. The pair could then decline to the 50-SMA and later to $23,600. Alternatively, if the price turns up from the 20-EMA and rises above $25,050, the up-move may resume.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the overhead resistance at $0.55 on Aug. 13. This indicates that the uncertainty has resolved in favor of the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/ce7d3c5d-f14a-42cf-9c80-6b66fd7de0e5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA of $0.52 and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that bulls have the upper hand. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to $0.63 and then to the strong overhead resistance at $0.70. This level is likely to attract strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the break above $0.55 may have been a bull trap. The pair could then decline to the 50-day SMA of $0.49 and later to $0.45.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/dade0a33-b849-4339-99d5-42dc95ef3339.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The pair completed an ascending triangle pattern on a break and close above the overhead resistance at $0.55. This pushed the RSI on the 4-hour chart to overbought levels, which may have tempted short-term traders to book profits.\par \par \uc2 The price may drop to the breakout level of $0.55. If bulls flip this level into support, the pair may continue its up-move to the pattern target at $0.65. This positive view could invalidate in the near term if the price plummets below the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT\par \par \uc2 Uniswap ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/uniswap-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UNI}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating between $8.11 and $9.83 for the past few days. This suggests that the bulls are buying the dips but the bears are defending the overhead resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/6b9e6f1e-9297-4fd3-ad2e-bd9ac361c30e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The longer the price remains in the range, the stronger the breakout will be from it. The 20-day EMA of $8.54 is sloping up and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating an advantage to buyers. If bulls thrust the price above $9.83, the UNI/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally toward $10.55 and later to $12.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the pair may continue its range-bound action for some more time. The bears will have to sink and sustain the price below $8.11 to gain the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/5e0162ba-4b41-4ddf-addd-c9a5ba358f3b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 UNI/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that the bears are defending the zone between $9.50 and $9.83. If the price breaks below $8.74, the sellers will attempt to sink the pair to the strong support at $8.11. The buyers are expected to buy the dip to this level.\par \par \uc2 The flattening moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint suggest that the range-bound action may continue for some more time. The next trending move could start on a break above $9.83 or on a close below $8.11.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hits-25k-as-bearish-voices-call-btc-price-double-top"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin hits $25K as \b  \highlight22bearish\b0 \highlight22  voices call BTC price 'double top'}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) has been trading in a large range between $5.50 and $9.50 for the past several weeks. The bulls attempted to push the price above the range on Aug. 12 but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/f1d47650-7fa9-4fbe-b39a-82c3d7139d04.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA of $8.00 is sloping up and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating that bulls have the upper hand. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $9.50. If they succeed, the LINK/USDT pair could rally to $12.30 and then to $13.50.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that traders are booking profits near the resistance. That could sink the pair to the 50-day SMA of $7.00 and increase the stay inside the range for a few more days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/8935a6bc-e8b9-4aad-98fd-57fae6aac4dc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price turned down from the overhead resistance at $9.50 and broke below the 20-EMA on the 4-hour chart. This suggests that traders may be booking profits. The pair could drop to the 50-SMA, which may act as a strong support.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 50-SMA, the bulls will again try to push the pair above $9.50. If they succeed, the pair could start the next leg of the up-move. On the other hand, if the price slips below the 50-SMA, the pair could decline to $8.29.\par \par \uc2 CHZ/USDT\par \par \uc2 Chiliz (CHZ) has been in a strong recovery for the past few days but the long wick on the Aug. 14 candlestick suggests that bears are defending the overhead resistance at $0.19.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/498860ea-41d8-48a3-a8c0-c460005abf2f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 CHZ/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Although the rising 20-day EMA of $0.14 indicates an advantage to buyers, the RSI in the overbought territory suggests a minor correction or consolidation in the short term. If the price turns down from the current level, the first critical level to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off this level will suggest that the bulls are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity. That will improve the prospects of a break above the overhead resistance. If that happens, the CHZ/USDT pair could rally to $0.22 and then to $0.24.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price slips below the 20-day EMA, the pair could slide to the 50-day SMA of $0.12. Such a move will suggest that the pair may form a range in the near term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/04a27e1c-2fea-4179-931a-080d09386bc7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 CHZ/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sharp rally in the pair pushed the RSI deep into the overbought territory on the 4-hour chart, indicating that a correction or consolidation was possible. The same may have started and the pair could decline to the 20-EMA, which is an important level to keep an eye on.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-EMA, it will suggest that the positive sentiment remains intact. The buyers will then again try to resume the up-move. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated in the near term if the price breaks and sustains below the 50-SMA.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDgvZGVmODVkOWEtMGQ1My00MmMyLWJhOTgtMDIzNTY5MjZhOTI4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220814ei8e000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Ethereum hits 8-month highs in BTC as money heads for \u8216\'20\'18riskier\u8217\'20\'19 altcoins\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  William Suberg \par \uc2 618 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 August 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin faces stiff competition from Ethereum as ETH matches 2022 highs against BTC.\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is worth more in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) than at any time since the start of the year amid renewed appetite for altcoins.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/db374a02-3228-4dae-9f09-e5f6c98bbc12.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/BTC 1-day candle chart (Binance). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Altcoin market cap returns to $700 billio\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.142027444.742658523.1640948929-762064149.1640948929"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  confirms that ETH/BTC has cleared key resistance to pass 0.08 BTC on Aug. 13.\par \par \uc2 The move is impressive for the largest altcoin, Ether, as the area around 0.075 represented a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-traders-pinpoint-key-levels-to-watch-as-btc-price-tests-key-trendlines"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 troublesome}}}\uc2  sell zone that had previously kept bulls in check since January.\par \par \uc2 At the time of writing, ETH/BTC is working to retain the newly-won level, as traders query how long its strength might last.\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph reported earlier, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-traders-still-favor-new-20k-lows-as-ethereum-hits-2k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH/USD passed $2,000 overnight}}}\uc2 , a significant psychological boundary in itself unseen since May.\par \par \uc2 Not for long then\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Crypto Tony (@CryptoTony__) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoTony__/status/1558376916113031169?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 13, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Noting a trend to pile into altcoins developing, on-chain analytics firm Glassnode eyed a desire among investors to heighten risk exposure in the current atmosphere.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAccording to Swissblock\u8217\'20\'19s Altcoin Cycle Signal, some of bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s force tempered as investors divested into altcoins in a lower-risk environment,\u8221\'20\'1D co-founders Yann Allemann and Jan Happel {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://glassnode.substack.com/p/uncharted-21"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote}}}\uc2  in the latest edition of their "Uncharted" newsletter:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSince ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s merge became clearer, ethereum has outperformed bitcoin, driving altcoins higher.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The overall altcoin market cap also reached its highest since the end of May this week, passing $700 billion, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/charts/#dominance-percentage"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according}}}\uc2  to figures from TradingView and CoinMarketCap.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/be30e103-9178-430d-b844-986b59214e04.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Altcoin market cap 1-day candle chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 ETH price analysis still favors bear market\par \par \uc2 Turning to potential price targets for Ether, traders nonetheless remained conservative after months of upside.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-8-12-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-ada-sol-doge-dot-matic-avax"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, MATIC, AVAX}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C$ETH to $2200 as long as we stay above $1737,\u8221\'20\'1D popular account Crypto Chase {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Crypto_Chase/status/1558237538653016065"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2  :\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COnce untapped highs start getting tapped (and no reversal is given), the rest of the highs typically meet the same fate. Don\u8217\'20\'19t have my eyes on an exact level or setup for long opportunity just yet, but will update if I see one.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CLTF trend v \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 : I'm eyeing breakout if $2k is claimed --> $2.4K,\u8221\'20\'1D fellow account Karoush AK {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/KoroushAK/status/1558316315978481665"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 continued}}}\uc2  :\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHTF trend neutral \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 : It is not a bull market, just less of a bear market. Under water bag holders blessed with an opportunity to derisk at $2k resistance.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In its latest market update to Telegram channel subscribers, meanwhile, trading firm QCP Capital echoed the need for a cautious approach to further gains in a burgeoning altcoin market.\par \par \uc2 Of particular interest, staff wrote, was open interest (OI) on derivatives markets, with ETH eclipsing BTC activity by almost double.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CETHBTC has broken above the 0.08 level and ETH option Open Interest (OI) is at an all-time high of $8 billion, overshadowing BTC option OI of $5 billion. This is unprecedented,\u8221\'20\'1D it wrote:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CConcerns around a hard fork remain with September ETH futures trading below -8% (annualised) vs. spot. We have been taking some profit on our long spot vs. short futures spread position.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Ethereum's September Merge event, it added, could turn out to be something of an inflection point for markets.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDgvYjBmMjg0ZmUtNGNkOS00NjE4LWI0MjktY2YwYTljNmI5MDBiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220814ei8d0008d\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Ethereum hits 8-month highs in BTC as money heads for 'riskier' altcoins\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  William Suberg \par \uc2 618 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 August 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin faces stiff competition from Ethereum as ETH matches 2022 highs against BTC.\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is worth more in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) than at any time since the start of the year amid renewed appetite for altcoins.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/db374a02-3228-4dae-9f09-e5f6c98bbc12.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/BTC 1-day candle chart (Binance). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Altcoin market cap returns to $700 billio\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointele