'20\'19s merge became clearer, ethereum has outperformed bitcoin, driving altcoins higher."\par \par \uc2 The overall altcoin market cap also reached its highest since the end of May this week, passing $700 billion, according to figures from TradingView and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/charts/#dominance-percentage"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CoinMarketCap}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/be30e103-9178-430d-b844-986b59214e04.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Altcoin market cap 1-day candle chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 ETH price analysis still favors bear market\par \par \uc2 Turning to potential price targets for Ethereum, traders nonetheless remained conservative after months of upside.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-8-12-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-ada-sol-doge-dot-matic-avax"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 8/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, MATIC, AVAX}}}\par \par \uc2 "$ETH to $2200 as long as we stay above $1737," popular account Crypto Chase {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Crypto_Chase/status/1558237538653016065"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "Once untapped highs start getting tapped (and no reversal is given), the rest of the highs typically meet the same fate. Don't have my eyes on an exact level or setup for long opportunity just yet, but will update if I see one."\par \par \uc2 "LTF trend v \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 : I'm eyeing breakout if $2k is claimed --> $2.4K," fellow account Karoush AK {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/KoroushAK/status/1558316315978481665"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 continued}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "HTF trend neutral \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 : It is not a bull market, just less of a bear market. Under water bag holders blessed with an opportunity to derisk at $2k resistance."\par \par \uc2 In its latest market update to Telegram channel subscribers, meanwhile, trading firm QCP Capital echoed the need for a cautious approach to further gains in a burgeoning altcoin market.\par \par \uc2 Of particular interest, staff wrote, was open interest (OI) on derivatives markets, with ETH eclipsing BTC activity by almost double.\par \par \uc2 "ETHBTC has broken above the 0.08 level and ETH option Open Interest (OI) is at an all-time high of $8 billion, overshadowing BTC option OI of $5 billion. This is unprecedented," it wrote.\par \par \uc2 "Concerns around a hard fork remain with September ETH futures trading below -8% (annualised) vs. spot. We have been taking some profit on our long spot vs. short futures spread position."\par \par \uc2 Ethereum's September Merge event, it added, could turn out to be something of an inflection point for markets.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDgvYjBmMjg0ZmUtNGNkOS00NjE4LWI0MjktY2YwYTljNmI5MDBiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220813ei8d0008d\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, MATIC, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,707 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 August 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and many altcoins are carving out bottoming patterns as sentiment across the crypto and equities markets continues to improve.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) could not overcome the barrier at $25,000 on Aug. 11 even though {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-bitcoin-fund-launch-sends-btc-price-towards-25k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 it had two catalysts}}}\uc2  in the form of a "favorable" Consumer Price Index print and news that \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 the world's largest asset manager, overseeing over $10 trillion in total assets \u8212\'20\'14 had launched a spot Bitcoin investment product.\par \par \uc2 In comparison, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has managed to hold on to its recent gains on news that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-whale-transactions-peak-at-2-month-high-amid-goerli-testnet-merger"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Goerli testnet had successfully activated proof-of-stake}}}\uc2 , clearing the path for Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s mainnet transition planned for Sept. 15 or Sept. 16. Data from Santiment shows that Ether whale transactions have increased along with possible whale accumulation.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/1f14966b-6eb4-4213-9173-57980e906d79.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, analysts remain {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-battles-2-month-resistance-amid-most-hated-stocks-rally"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 divided about the prospects}}}\uc2  of the current recovery. While some believe that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/here-are-bitcoin-price-levels-to-watch-as-btc-dips-5-from-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally could rise above $28,000}}}\uc2 , others are not so \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and they expect the price to turn down and resume the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Could buyers clear the overhead hurdle in Bitcoin and select altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin nudged above the overhead resistance at $24,668 on Aug. 11 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This indicates that bears have not yet given up and are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/4c48633f-3f0c-4e69-8b0c-2ef6011ba1c0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price remains squeezed between the 20-day exponential moving average ($23,151) and $24,668. Usually, a tight range trading is followed by a range expansion but it is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout with certainty.\par \par \uc2 In this case, the 20-day EMA is gradually sloping up and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the positive territory, indicating the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 If buyers thrust and sustain the price above $25,000, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up and the pair could rally to $28,000 and then to $32,000.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. The pair could then decline to the 50-day simple moving average ($21,845).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether attempted to rise above $2,000 on Aug. 11 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears are defending the level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/f661ec60-0607-4bce-9cd1-18b863f95299.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, a positive sign is that the bulls have not ceded ground to the bears. This suggests that traders are not hurrying to book profits as they anticipate the up-move to continue.\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI near the overbought territory indicate advantage to buyers. If bulls drive the price above $2,000, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down sharply from the current level, the bears will try to sink the pair to the breakout level of $1,700. The bulls are expected to buy the dip to this support.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been facing stiff resistance at the overhead resistance zone between $338 to $350. Although bears have repeatedly thwarted attempts by the bulls to clear this hurdle, the buyers have not given up much ground. This indicates that the bulls are not rushing to the exit as they expect a move higher.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/b919cbfc-2532-4100-bb42-6c3adc2adde7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A tight consolidation near the overhead resistance increases the likelihood of a break above it. If that happens, the BNB/USDT pair could attempt a rally to $380 and then to $414.\par \par \uc2 The important support to watch out on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($300). If bears sink the price below this level, the pair could decline to $275 and then to the 50-day SMA ($261). A break below this support could tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  remains stuck between the overhead resistance at $0.39 and the 20-day EMA ($0.37). The bears attempted to resolve this uncertainty in their favor on Aug. 9 and Aug. 10 but the bulls purchased the dip and pushed the price back above the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/7f8b0a16-d175-48a5-b468-a5bc03250a61.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers tried to push the price above $0.39 on Aug. 11 but the bears held their ground. This indicates that $0.39 and the 50-day SMA ($0.35) are the critical levels to watch out for in the short term.\par \par \uc2 If buyers clear the overhead hurdle, the XRP/USDT pair could rally to $0.48 and later to $0.54. On the contrary, if the price slips below the 50-day SMA, the pair could slide toward the crucial support at $0.30.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Buyers attempted to push Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $0.55 on Aug. 11 but the bears held the level successfully. The price could now drop to the 20-day EMA ($0.51).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/90f623e1-8573-4b07-b4ec-bdbcd159ebaa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The tight range trading between the 20-day EMA and $0.55 is unlikely to continue for long. If buyers drive the price above $0.55, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to $0.63 and then to the stiff overhead resistance at $0.70.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, the bears will attempt to challenge the support at $0.45. If the support holds, the pair may extend the consolidation between $0.45 and $0.55 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 50-day SMA ($39) on Aug. 10 indicating that bulls continue to buy at lower levels. The bulls attempted to push the price to the overhead resistance at $48 but the bears stalled the recovery at $45.32 on Aug. 11.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/f833ce1f-39d8-4ab3-aea4-f363df6121ae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The SOL/USDT pair could continue to trade inside the ascending triangle formation for some more time. The bears will have to sink the price below the support line to invalidate this \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, the bulls will have to push and sustain the price above $48 to complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern. If that happens, the pair could rally to $60 and then make a move to the pattern target at $71.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) once again turned down from the overhead resistance at $0.08 on Aug. 11, indicating that bears continue to defend the level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/4d7eff1b-1b2c-4015-a7bd-aa603f1d9a73.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will attempt to sink the price below the moving averages and challenge the trendline of the ascending triangle pattern. A break and close below this support will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup, opening the doors for a possible retest of $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the moving averages, it will suggest that bulls continue to buy at lower levels. The bulls will have to push the price above $0.08 to complete the ascending triangle pattern. If that happens, the DOGE/USDT pair may rally to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-cryptocurrencies-that-stand-to-outperform-eth-price-thanks-to-ethereum-s-merge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 3 cryptocurrencies that stand to outperform ETH price thanks to Ethereum's Merge}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been witnessing a close battle between the bulls and the bears near the breakout level of $9. The bears are attempting to pull the price back below $9 while the bulls are trying to flip the level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/8e03031b-3d2b-4c6c-951a-29586faa2daa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($8.47) and the RSI in the positive territory, indicating advantage to buyers. If the price rises from the current level and breaks above $9.65, the DOT/USDT pair could rally to $10.80 and later to $12.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price breaks below the strong support zone of $9 and the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the recent breakout may have been a bull trap. The pair could then decline to the 50-day SMA ($7.62).\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) has been trading in a tight range between the 20-day EMA ($0.88) and $0.96 for the past few days, indicating indecision among buyers and sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/d0870d76-e113-4804-af38-f81c806e0754.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If this uncertainty resolves to the upside, the MATIC/USDT pair could rally to the stiff overhead resistance at $1.02. The bulls will have to overcome this barrier to signal the start of the next leg of the up-move to $1.26 and later to $1.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, the short-term advantage could tilt in favor of the bears. The pair could then decline to the strong support at $0.75.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has been trading above the breakout level of $26.38 for the past few days which suggests that bulls are in no hurry to surrender their advantage.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/98066eb0-b1e6-47b6-a8a2-971e71d88bad.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The gradually rising 20-day EMA ($25.6) and the RSI near the overbought zone indicate advantage to buyers. If bulls propel the price above $31, the AVAX/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally to $33 and later to the pattern target of $39.05.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the pair could decline to the 50-day SMA ($21.91) and then to the support line.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDgvMmJhOTk3YzUtNjNhNi00ZTYwLWJmNWMtZWMwMTI5ZDdhMWU0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220812ei8c000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/10: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, MATIC, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,833 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 August 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 After Aug. 8\u8217\'20\'19s neutral CPI print, Bitcoin and altcoins are attempting to flip stiff overhead resistance levels to support in order to prepare for the next leg up.\par \par \uc2 The Aug. 10 Consumer Price Index (CPI) report shows year-over-year inflation rose 8.5% in July and while this figure is below economists\u8217\'20\'19 expectations of 8.7%, it is still high. Although inflation remains much higher than the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 's 2% target, the marginal slowdown raises hopes that the rate hikes by the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  have started to work. That has reduced the probability of a 75 basis point rate hike in the September meeting from 68% on Aug. 9 to 37.5%, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cmegroup.com/trading/interest-rates/countdown-to-fomc.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according}}}\uc2  to \uc2 CME\uc2  group data.\par \par \uc2 Risky assets, including the cryptocurrency markets, responded positively to the CPI print. Compared to Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-dominance-hits-6-month-lows-as-metric-proclaims-new-alt-season"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 altcoins are enjoying a stronger rally}}}\uc2 . This has pulled Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s dominance near its yearly lows while Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has climbed near its yearly high.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/c2f407f0-5f27-43c2-84f9-46fdf0000245.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 According to \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  data, Ether-related products have seen {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutions-flocking-to-ethereum-for-7-straight-weeks-as-merge-nears-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 inflows of $159 million}}}\uc2  in the past seven weeks. This indicates that Ether seems to be garnering attention from institutional investors in anticipation of the Merge, which is scheduled for Sept. 19.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins sustain the higher levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned down from $24,245 on Aug. 8 and dropped to the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($22,966) on Aug. 9. The bulls aggressively purchased the dip on Aug. 10 and are attempting to push the price above the overhead resistance at $24,668.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/ca590766-5e3d-482a-a05f-609351188a9b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the BTC/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally to $28,000. The bears may mount a strong resistance at this level but if bulls overcome this barrier, the pair could rise to $32,000. The gradually upsloping 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory indicate the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from $24,668, the bears will again attempt to sink the pair below the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the pair could decline to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA ($21,708). A break below this level could tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether turned down from $1,818 on Aug. 8 but the bears could not sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($1,637). This suggests strong demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/5abf78f8-fe3b-4e42-9f63-c520a0334f2c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair rebounded off the 20-day EMA on Aug. 10 and has cleared the overhead hurdle at $1,818. If buyers sustain the price above this level, the pair could rally to the psychological level of $2,000 and then to $2,200. The rising moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated if the price turns down and plummets below the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the pair may drop toward the 50-day SMA ($1,388). That could delay the start of the next leg of the up-move.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  turned down from the overhead resistance zone of $338 to $350 on Aug. 8 but the bears could not sustain the lower levels on Aug. 10. This suggests that bulls are aggressively buying the dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/9b664b5d-a72e-4f54-85b3-7e7ad06a5a22.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will again attempt to clear the overhead zone. If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally toward $414. Although the rising moving averages indicate advantage to buyers, the overbought zone on the RSI indicates that a minor pullback or a consolidation is possible in the near term.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead zone, the first support is at $308. The bears will have to sink the price below this level to challenge the 20-day EMA ($296). This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close below it could sink the pair to $275.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls failed to push {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  above the overhead resistance at $0.39 on Aug. 8. This attracted sharp selling by the bears who pulled the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.37) on Aug. 9.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/7d669704-90b6-4fb8-b8d7-1c6db1d96451.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor positive is that the bulls bought the dip and have pushed the price back above the 20-day EMA on Aug. 10. The buyers will again attempt to push the price above the overhead resistance zone between $0.39 and $0.41. If they succeed, the XRP/USDT pair could rise to $0.48 and later to $0.54.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance and breaks below the 50-day SMA ($0.35), it will suggest that the pair may remain range-bound between $0.30 and $0.39 for a few more days.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance at $0.55 on Aug. 8 and dropped to the 20-day EMA ($0.51) on Aug. 9, indicating that bears continue to defend the overhead resistance aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/481a72f6-cfb7-4d5e-a071-322b0470bb55.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair rebounded sharply off the 20-day EMA on Aug. 10, suggesting that the bulls are buying the dips with vigor. If buyers clear the overhead hurdle, the pair could start its northward march to $0.63 and then to $0.70.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price once again turns down from $0.55, the likelihood of a break below the 20-day EMA increases. If that happens, the pair could remain range-bound between $0.45 and $0.55 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) to the overhead resistance at $48 on Aug. 8 but the bears had other plans. They stalled the recovery attempt at $44 and pulled the price back below the 20-day EMA ($40) on Aug. 9.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/55fc638d-4ea9-4e95-b177-64e4ac218a52.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have flattened out and the RSI is just above the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. If the price rises from the current level and breaks above $44, the SOL/USDT pair could challenge the stiff resistance at $48.\par \par \uc2 A break above this level will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern, opening the doors for a possible rally to $60 and then to the pattern target at $71.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the support line, the advantage could tilt in favor of the bears. The pair could then drop to $32.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) Aug. 9 candlestick shows that the bears are aggressively defending the overhead resistance at $0.08. The sellers are attempting to build upon their advantage by pulling the price below the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/31dd0b87-b510-430b-9ebd-38160e1dca75.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to the trendline of the ascending triangle pattern. A break and close below this support could invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. The pair could then decline to $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level, it will suggest that bulls continue to buy on dips. The bulls will then make one more attempt to push the pair above the overhead resistance and start a new up-move. If they succeed, the pair could rally to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/torn-price-sinks-45-after-u-s-treasury-sanctions-tornado-cash-rebound-ahead"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TORN price sinks 45% after U.S. Treasury sanctions Tornado Cash \u8212\'20\'14 Rebound ahead?}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the overhead resistance at $9 on Aug. 8 but the bulls could not build upon this strength. The bears sold aggressively and pulled the price back below $9 on Aug. 9.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/d6019900-499f-465d-b274-8df9262578e9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, a positive sign is that the DOT/USDT pair rebounded sharply off the 20-day EMA ($8.30). This indicates that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will attempt to push the price to $10.80 and later to $12.\par \par \uc2 To invalidate this view, the bears will have to pull the price back below the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest that higher levels continue to attract strong selling by the bears. That could result in a range-bound action for a few days.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls have successfully sustained Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.87) but have failed to challenge the overhead resistance at $1.02. This suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/257a6dad-df9a-4475-bd5f-43197e7393e0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The gradually rising 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory, indicate that bulls have the upper hand. If buyers push the price above $0.95, the MATIC/USDT pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $1.02. This is an important level for the bears to defend because a break above it could result in a rally to $1.26 and then $1.50.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the pair may oscillate between $0.75 and $1.02 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Avalanche\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) Aug. 8 candlestick shows that bears have not given up and they continue to sell on rallies. The price slipped back to the breakout level on Aug. 9 but the bulls successfully defended the level on Aug. 10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/2a8c0d43-587e-46ef-bd1b-8ee33e48126a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the rebound, the AVAX/USDT pair could break above the overhead resistance at $31. If that happens, the pair could resume its up-move to $33 and later to the pattern target of $39.05.\par \par \uc2 The key level to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($24.88). If bears sink the price below this support, it will suggest that the breakout above $26.38 may have been a bull trap. The pair could then decline to the support line.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDgvNDI1NDdlY2ItNGMxMS00ZDEyLWIzMDYtMmYxYmE2NTBiYzM4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220810ei8a000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/8: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, MATIC, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,802 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 August 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price aims to break from its current range and flip $24,000 to support, while altcoins try to confirm their bottoming patterns\par \par \uc2 The United States equities markets and the cryptocurrency markets have started the week on a strong note, indicating that traders are not nervous about buying ahead of the important Consumer Price Index (CPI) data for July, which will be released on Aug. 10.\par \par \uc2 Another positive sign is that the recent recovery in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has not tempted investors to exit their positions in fear of another leg down. Glassnode data shows that the percentage of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/has-us-inflation-peaked-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 supply that has stayed dormant}}}\uc2  for three or more years rose to a new all-time high of 38.426% on Aug. 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/e663fd2f-0e45-4fd2-af95-fc80d8574bcf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  CEO \uc2 Larry Fink\uc2  sold 44,000 \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  shares in August, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-targets-8-week-highs-as-ethereum-reaches-1-8k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 biggest sale since the COVID-19 crash}}}\uc2 . Some analysts are speculating that the current recovery in the equities markets is only a bear market rally. If that is the case, then a downturn in the equities markets could also increase the selling in crypto prices as both remain closely correlated.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and select altcoins climb above their respective overhead resistance levels and extend the recovery in the short term? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bounced off the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA)($22,846) on Aug. 7 and the momentum picked up on Aug. 8. The buyers pushed the price above $24,000 and could challenge the overhead resistance at $24,668.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/c4d3a74c-5165-4946-aa60-9d566b5cbb20.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is sloping up and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the positive territory, indicating that bulls are in control. If buyers propel the price above the overhead resistance, the BTC/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally to $28,000 as there is no significant resistance in between. The bears may try to stall the recovery at this level but if bulls overcome this barrier, the up-move could reach $32,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from $24,668, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA. This is an important level to watch out for because a break below it could drag the price to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA($21,594). A break below this level could put the bears back on top.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $1,700 on Aug. 5 and the bulls successfully defended the breakout level on Aug. 6 and 7. Buying resumed on Aug. 8 and the bulls pushed the price above the overhead resistance at $1,785.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/28c41e4c-5d9d-4205-89fc-be717bd7c0ff.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls sustain the price above $1,785, the ETH/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally to the psychological level at $2,000. This level may attract selling by the bears but if bulls arrest the next decline above $1,700, the likelihood of a break above $2,000 increases. If that happens, the pair could rally to the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate in the short term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($1,606). The pair could then slide to the 50-day SMA ($1,362).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  recovery has reached the strong overhead resistance zone between $338 and $350 where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/b6f316bf-964e-4e1e-aac9-119ea42e4129.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, the BNB/USDT pair could decline to the 20-day EMA ($289). This is an important level to keep an eye on because a strong bounce off it will suggest that the positive sentiment remains intact and traders are viewing dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will then make one more attempt to clear the overhead zone. If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could further pick up momentum and rally toward $414. This positive view could invalidate in the short term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple's ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) price has been squeezed between the 20-day EMA ($0.36) and the overhead resistance at $0.39 for the past few days. Usually, such tight ranges lead to a range expansion.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/60fa948b-2156-4c71-abff-8fd7b1dcd836.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive area indicate advantage to buyers. If bulls push and sustain the price above $0.39, it will suggest the start of a new up-move. The XRP/USDT pair could then rise to $0.48 and later to $0.54.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. The pair could then drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.35). Such a move will suggest that the pair may spend some more time inside the range.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($0.50) on Aug. 5 and has reached the strong overhead resistance at $0.55.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/82739cf4-124c-43d5-aac2-69a120d5be57.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is sloping up and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers thrust the price above $0.55, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could start its northward march toward $0.63 and then to $0.70. The bears may pose a strong challenge at this level.\par \par \uc2 To invalidate this positive view, the bears will have to sink and sustain the price below the 50-day SMA. That could extend the stay of the pair inside the range between $0.40 and $0.55 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day EMA ($40) on Aug. 5 and the bulls thwarted attempts by the bears to sink the price back below the level. The buying resumed on Aug. 8 and the bulls will attempt to push the price to the overhead resistance at $48.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/3068afc5-5858-4e83-857f-3a74a875dbf3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is rising up gradually and the RSI is in the positive zone, indicating that the bulls have the upper hand. If buyers drive the price above $48, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern will complete. The pair could then start a rally to $60 and thereafter to the pattern target at $71.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from $48 like the previous two occasions, it will suggest that bears are defending the level aggressively. That could keep the pair stuck inside the triangle for a few more days. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup will invalidate on a break below the support line.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($0.07) on Aug. 7, indicating that bulls are defending the moving averages with vigor. However, the long wick on the Aug. 8 candlestick suggests that bears are selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/ed3db67c-7fc4-499b-be03-179ab147b602.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages indicate a balance between supply and demand but the RSI in the positive territory suggests a minor advantage to the buyers. If bulls push the price above the overhead resistance at $0.08, it will complete the ascending triangle pattern. The pair could then start a rally to the psychological resistance at $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the DOGE/USDT pair could stay inside the triangle for a few more days. The bears will have to sink the price below the trendline to invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/metaverse-housing-bubble-bursting-virtual-land-prices-crash-85-amid-waning-interest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Metaverse housing bubble bursting? Virtual land prices crash 85% amid waning interest}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance at $9 on Aug. 6 but the bulls did not cede ground to the bears. They resumed their purchase on Aug. 7 and pushed the price above the overhead resistance on Aug. 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/992c1773-5568-4424-8ea7-b91e34c7de2b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is sloping up and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating that bulls have the upper hand. If buyers sustain the price above $9, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up and the DOT/USDT pair could rise to $10.80 and later to $12.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks back below $9, it will suggest that the breakout may have been a bull trap. The pair could then decline to the 20-day EMA ($8.07) and later to the 50-day SMA ($7.49).\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) formed a Doji candlestick pattern on Aug. 7, which resolved to the upside on Aug. 8. This suggests that bulls are buying the dips to the 20-day EMA ($0.86).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/8a4e1045-8ea8-4640-b6fd-96a36311251b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory indicate advantage to buyers. The MATIC/USDT pair could rise to the overhead resistance at $1.02 where the bears may mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 If bulls do not give up much ground from $1.02, the likelihood of a break above it increases. The pair could then rally to $1.26 and then to $1.50. The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below the 20-day EMA. That could open the doors for a possible drop to $0.75.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the strong overhead resistance at $26.38 on Aug. 6, indicating the completion of the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/aa7a31df-966b-4627-b8a3-4e1f577f5d67.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The AVAX/USDT pair could rise to $33 and later to the pattern target of $39.05. While the upsloping moving averages indicate advantage to buyers, the RSI has risen into the overbought zone, suggesting a minor correction in the near term.\par \par \uc2 If bulls flip the $26.38 level into support during the next correction, it will signal a potential trend change. This positive view could be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDgvOGY3ZTQyZjYtZGMxMi00NzZkLWJkY2UtODIwMWM4Mzg5YzU2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220808ei88000e4\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 What will cryptocurrency market look like in 2027? Here are 5 predictions\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Igor Varnavsky \par \uc2 1,316 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 August 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Here are five predictions for how the cryptocurrency landscape could change over the next several years.\par \par \uc2 The year is 2027. It\u8217\'20\'19s a time of great innovation and technological advancement, but also a time of chaos. What will the crypto market look like in 2027? (For those unfamiliar, that's a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0af2wvSdwwI"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 line}}}\uc2  from the 2011 video game, Deus Ex.)\par \par \uc2 Long-term predictions are notoriously difficult to make, but they are good thought experiments. One year is too short a period for fundamental changes, but five years is just enough for everything to change.\par \par \uc2 Here are the most unexpected and outrageous events that could happen over the next five years.\par \par \uc2 1. The metaverse will not rise\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/metaverse-for-beginners"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 metaverse is a hot topic}}}\uc2 , but most people do not have even the slightest idea of what it actually comprises. The metaverse is a holistic virtual world that exists on an ongoing basis (without pauses or resets), works in real-time, accommodates any number of users, has its own economy, is created by the participants themselves, and is characterized by unprecedented interoperability. A variety of applications could (in theory) be integrated into the metaverse, including games, video-conferencing applications, services for issuing driver\u8217\'20\'19s licenses \u8212\'20\'14 anything.\par \par \uc2 This definition makes it clear the metaverse is not such a novel phenomenon. Games and social networks that include most of the features stated above have been around for quite some time. Granted, interoperability is a problem that needs to be addressed seriously. It would have been a very useful feature to be able to easily transfer digital assets between games \u8212\'20\'14 or a digital identity \u8212\'20\'14 without being tethered to a specific platform.\par \par \uc2 But the metaverse will never be able to cater to every need. There is no reason to include some services in the metaverse at all. Some services will remain isolated due to the unwillingness of their operators to surrender control over them.\par \par \uc2 The "metaverse" is going to happen but I don't think any of the existing corporate attempts to intentionally create the metaverse are going anywhere. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/tVUfq4CWmP"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/tVUfq4CWmP}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 vitalik.eth (@VitalikButerin) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/VitalikButerin/status/1553526863783657472?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 July 30, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 And there is also the technical aspect to take into account. The cyberpunk culture of the 1980s and 90s postulated that the metaverse meant total immersion. Such immersion is now conceived as possible only with the use of virtual reality glasses. VR hardware is getting better every year, but it\u8217\'20\'19s not what we expected. VR remains a niche phenomenon even among hardcore gamers. The vast majority of ordinary people will never put on such glasses for the sake of calling their grandmother or selling some crypto on an exchange.\par \par \uc2 True immersion requires a technological breakthrough like {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/elon-musk-thinks-neuralink-is-better-than-metaverse-in-long-term"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 smart contact lenses or Neuralink}}}\uc2 . It is highly unlikely those technologies will be widely used five years from now.\par \par \uc2 2. Wallets will become \u8220\'20\'1Csuper apps\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 An active {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/defi-101/defi-a-comprehensive-guide-to-decentralized-finance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 decentralized finance (DeFi)}}}\uc2  user is forced to deal with dozens of protocols these days. Wallets, interfaces, exchanges, bridges, loan protocols \u8212\'20\'14 there are hundreds of them, and they are growing daily. Having to live with such an array of technologies is inconvenient even for advanced users. As for the prospects of mass adoption, such a state of affairs is all the more unacceptable.\par \par \uc2 For the ordinary user, it is ideal when a maximum number of services can be accessed through a limited number of universal applications. The optimal choice is when they are integrated right into their wallet. Storing, exchanging, transferring to other networks, staking \u8212\'20\'14 why bother visiting dozens of different sites for accessing such services if all the necessary operations can be carried out using a single interface?\par \par \uc2 Users don\u8217\'20\'19t care which exchange or bridge they use. They are only concerned about security, speed and low fees. A significant number of DeFi protocols will eventually turn into back-ends that cater to popular wallets and interfaces.\par \par \uc2 3. Bitcoin will become a unit of account on par with the U.S. dollar or Euro\par \par \uc2 Money has three main roles \u8212\'20\'14 acting as a means of payment, as a store of value and as a unit of account. Many cryptocurrencies, primarily stablecoins, are used as a means of payment. Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and \u8212\'20\'14 to a much lesser extent \u8212\'20\'14 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) are used as stores of value among cryptocurrencies. But the United States dollar remains the main unit of account in the world. Everything is valued in dollars, including Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 The real victory for sound money will be heralded when cryptocurrencies take over the role of a unit of account. Bitcoin is currently the main candidate for this role. Such a victory will signify a major mental shift.\par \par \uc2 Wheat up 43% in the first 5 months this year\par \par \uc2 Nat Gas 155% since Jan, +10% today\par \par \uc2 Gasoline 96%\par \par \uc2 Let's see how long the "consumer remains strong" as this whittles away at what little savings they have left and as debt racks up\par \par \uc2 Fight inflation w/ inflation, just print more lol {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/b19becqa2x"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/b19becqa2x}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Pentoshi (leading cattle to butcher) (@Pentosh1) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Pentosh1/status/1533873065800654850?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 June 6, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 What needs to happen in the next five years to make this a possibility?\par \par \uc2 A sharp drop in the confidence vested in the U.S. dollar and euro is a prerequisite for cryptocurrencies to take on the role of a basic unit of account. Western authorities have already done a lot to undermine said confidence by printing trillions of dollars in fiat money, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-holds-24k-as-us-dollar-taps-3-week-lows-on-eurozone-inflation-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 allowing abnormally high inflation to spiral}}}\uc2 , freezing hundreds of billions of a sovereign country\u8217\'20\'19s reserves, and so on. This may be just the beginning.\par \par \uc2 What if actual inflation becomes much worse than projected? What if the economic crisis is protracted? What if a new epidemic breaks out? What if the conflict in Ukraine spills into neighboring countries? All of these are feasible scenarios. Some are extreme, of course \u8212\'20\'14 but they are possible.\par \par \uc2 4. At least half of the top 50 cryptocurrencies will see their standing decline\par \par \uc2 There is a high probability that the list of top cryptocurrencies will radically change. Outright zombies such as Ethereum Classic ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/etc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETC}}}\uc2  ) will be ousted from the list, and projects that now seem to hold unshakable positions will not only be de-throned but may also vanish altogether.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/07/17/6-questions-for-lisa-fridman-of-quadrata"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 RELATED: 6 Questions for Lisa Fridman of Quadrata}}}\par \par \uc2 Some stablecoins will surely sink. New ones will take their place. Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) will slide down the list to officially become a living corpse. The project is moving agonizingly slowly. Developers not only fail to see this as problematic but even seem to view it as a benefit.\par \par \uc2 5. The crypto market will fragment along geographic lines\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrencies are global by default, but they are not invulnerable to the influence of individual states. The state always has an edge and an extra trick up its sleeve. A number of territories (the U.S., the \uc2 European Union\uc2 , China, India, Russia, etc.) have already introduced or are threatening to introduce strict \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  of cryptocurrencies.\par \par \uc2 The factor of international competition is superimposed onto internal state motivations. When Russia was heavily sanctioned, some crypto projects started {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cexs-refuse-blanket-asset-freeze-of-all-russian-users-though-questions-linger"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 restricting Russian users from accessing their services}}}\uc2  or even blocking their funds. This scenario may play out again in the future with respect to China.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/is-there-a-way-for-the-crypto-sector-to-avoid-bitcoin-s-halving-related-bear-markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 RELATED: Is there a way for the crypto sector to avoid Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s halving-related bear markets?}}}\par \par \uc2 It is not difficult to imagine a future in which parts of the crypto market will work in favor of some countries while closing to others. We are living in such a future already, at least to some degree.\par \par \uc2 The opinions expressed are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDgvZGIzYjlhNTctNWUyMy00MWM0LTg4ZDQtMDMzNmVjZDIzNmI0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220806ei860002t\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 What will cryptocurrency look like in 2027? Here are 5 predictions\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Igor Varnavsky \par \uc2 1,315 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 August 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Here are five predictions for how the cryptocurrency landscape could change over the next several years.\par \par \uc2 The year is 2027. It\u8217\'20\'19s a time of great innovation and technological advancement, but also a time of chaos. What will the crypto market look like in 2027? (For those unfamiliar, that's a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0af2wvSdwwI"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 line}}}\uc2  from the 2011 video game, Deus Ex.)\par \par \uc2 Long-term predictions are notoriously difficult to make, but they are good thought experiments. One year is too short a period for fundamental changes, but five years is just enough for everything to change.\par \par \uc2 Here are the most unexpected and outrageous events that could happen over the next five years.\par \par \uc2 1. The metaverse will not rise\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/metaverse-for-beginners"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 metaverse is a hot topic}}}\uc2 , but most people do not have even the slightest idea of what it actually comprises. The metaverse is a holistic virtual world that exists on an ongoing basis (without pauses or resets), works in real-time, accommodates any number of users, has its own economy, is created by the participants themselves, and is characterized by unprecedented interoperability. A variety of applications could (in theory) be integrated into the metaverse, including games, video-conferencing applications, services for issuing driver\u8217\'20\'19s licenses \u8212\'20\'14 anything.\par \par \uc2 This definition makes it clear the metaverse is not such a novel phenomenon. Games and social networks that include most of the features stated above have been around for quite some time. Granted, interoperability is a problem that needs to be addressed seriously. It would have been a very useful feature to be able to easily transfer digital assets between games \u8212\'20\'14 or a digital identity \u8212\'20\'14 without being tethered to a specific platform.\par \par \uc2 But the metaverse will never be able to cater to every need. There is no reason to include some services in the metaverse at all. Some services will remain isolated due to the unwillingness of their operators to surrender control over them.\par \par \uc2 The "metaverse" is going to happen but I don't think any of the existing corporate attempts to intentionally create the metaverse are going anywhere. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/tVUfq4CWmP"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/tVUfq4CWmP}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 vitalik.eth (@VitalikButerin) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/VitalikButerin/status/1553526863783657472?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 July 30, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 And there is also the technical aspect to take into account. The cyberpunk culture of the 1980s and 90s postulated that the metaverse meant total immersion. Such immersion is now conceived as possible only with the use of virtual reality glasses. VR hardware is getting better every year, but it\u8217\'20\'19s not what we expected. VR remains a niche phenomenon even among hardcore gamers. The vast majority of ordinary people will never put on such glasses for the sake of calling their grandmother or selling some crypto on an exchange.\par \par \uc2 True immersion requires a technological breakthrough like {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/elon-musk-thinks-neuralink-is-better-than-metaverse-in-long-term"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 smart contact lenses or Neuralink}}}\uc2 . It is highly unlikely those technologies will be widely used five years from now.\par \par \uc2 2. Wallets will become \u8220\'20\'1Csuper apps\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 An active {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/defi-101/defi-a-comprehensive-guide-to-decentralized-finance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 decentralized finance (DeFi)}}}\uc2  user is forced to deal with dozens of protocols these days. Wallets, interfaces, exchanges, bridges, loan protocols \u8212\'20\'14 there are hundreds of them, and they are growing daily. Having to live with such an array of technologies is inconvenient even for advanced users. As for the prospects of mass adoption, such a state of affairs is all the more unacceptable.\par \par \uc2 For the ordinary user, it is ideal when a maximum number of services can be accessed through a limited number of universal applications. The optimal choice is when they are integrated right into their wallet. Storing, exchanging, transferring to other networks, staking \u8212\'20\'14 why bother visiting dozens of different sites for accessing such services if all the necessary operations can be carried out using a single interface?\par \par \uc2 Users don\u8217\'20\'19t care which exchange or bridge they use. They are only concerned about security, speed and low fees. A significant number of DeFi protocols will eventually turn into back-ends that cater to popular wallets and interfaces.\par \par \uc2 3. Bitcoin will become a unit of account on par with the U.S. dollar or Euro\par \par \uc2 Money has three main roles \u8212\'20\'14 acting as a means of payment, as a store of value and as a unit of account. Many cryptocurrencies, primarily stablecoins, are used as a means of payment. Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and \u8212\'20\'14 to a much lesser extent \u8212\'20\'14 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) are used as stores of value among cryptocurrencies. But the United States dollar remains the main unit of account in the world. Everything is valued in dollars, including Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 The real victory for sound money will be heralded when cryptocurrencies take over the role of a unit of account. Bitcoin is currently the main candidate for this role. Such a victory will signify a major mental shift.\par \par \uc2 Wheat up 43% in the first 5 months this year\par \par \uc2 Nat Gas 155% since Jan, +10% today\par \par \uc2 Gasoline 96%\par \par \uc2 Let's see how long the "consumer remains strong" as this whittles away at what little savings they have left and as debt racks up\par \par \uc2 Fight inflation w/ inflation, just print more lol {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/b19becqa2x"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/b19becqa2x}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Pentoshi (leading cattle to butcher) (@Pentosh1) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Pentosh1/status/1533873065800654850?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 June 6, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 What needs to happen in the next five years to make this a possibility?\par \par \uc2 A sharp drop in the confidence vested in the U.S. dollar and euro is a prerequisite for cryptocurrencies to take on the role of a basic unit of account. Western authorities have already done a lot to undermine said confidence by printing trillions of dollars in fiat money, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-holds-24k-as-us-dollar-taps-3-week-lows-on-eurozone-inflation-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 allowing abnormally high inflation to spiral}}}\uc2 , freezing hundreds of billions of a sovereign country\u8217\'20\'19s reserves, and so on. This may be just the beginning.\par \par \uc2 What if actual inflation becomes much worse than projected? What if the economic crisis is protracted? What if a new epidemic breaks out? What if the conflict in Ukraine spills into neighboring countries? All of these are feasible scenarios. Some are extreme, of course \u8212\'20\'14 but they are possible.\par \par \uc2 4. At least half of the top 50 cryptocurrencies will see their standing decline\par \par \uc2 There is a high probability that the list of top cryptocurrencies will radically change. Outright zombies such as Ethereum Classic ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/etc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETC}}}\uc2  ) will be ousted from the list, and projects that now seem to hold unshakable positions will not only be de-throned but may also vanish altogether.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/07/17/6-questions-for-lisa-fridman-of-quadrata"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 RELATED: 6 Questions for Lisa Fridman of Quadrata}}}\par \par \uc2 Some stablecoins will surely sink. New ones will take their place. Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) will slide down the list to officially become a living corpse. The project is moving agonizingly slowly. Developers not only fail to see this as problematic but even seem to view it as a benefit.\par \par \uc2 5. The crypto market will fragment along geographic lines\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrencies are global by default, but they are not invulnerable to the influence of individual states. The state always has an edge and an extra trick up its sleeve. A number of territories (the U.S., the \uc2 European Union\uc2 , China, India, Russia, etc.) have already introduced or are threatening to introduce strict \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  of cryptocurrencies.\par \par \uc2 The factor of international competition is superimposed onto internal state motivations. When Russia was heavily sanctioned, some crypto projects started {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cexs-refuse-blanket-asset-freeze-of-all-russian-users-though-questions-linger"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 restricting Russian users from accessing their services}}}\uc2  or even blocking their funds. This scenario may play out again in the future with respect to China.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/is-there-a-way-for-the-crypto-sector-to-avoid-bitcoin-s-halving-related-bear-markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 RELATED: Is there a way for the crypto sector to avoid Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s halving-related bear markets?}}}\par \par \uc2 It is not difficult to imagine a future in which parts of the crypto market will work in favor of some countries while closing to others. We are living in such a future already, at least to some degree.\par \par \uc2 The opinions expressed are the author\u8217\'20\'19s alone and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. This article is for general information purposes and is not intended to be and should not be taken as legal or investment advice.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDgvZGIzYjlhNTctNWUyMy00MWM0LTg4ZDQtMDMzNmVjZDIzNmI0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220806ei8600001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/5: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, MATIC, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,755 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 August 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Strong demand at lower levels suggests the sentiment could be changing from selling on rallies to buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 The United States Labor market {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-fails-to-beat-23-4k-sellers-as-us-payrolls-upend-inflation-debate"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added 528,000 jobs}}}\uc2  in July, much better than the 258,000 estimate. Wages saw growth of 5.2% year-over-year and 0.5% over the month. This suggests that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-for-beginners/bitcoin-and-inflation-everything-you-need-to-know"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 inflation remains high}}}\uc2  and the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2  may continue with its rate hikes in the near future.\par \par \uc2 After staying in close correlation with the U.S. equities markets for the past several months, the crypto space could be ready to chalk out a new course.\par \par \uc2 Bloomberg Intelligence senior commodity strategist \uc2 Mike McGlone\uc2  and senior market structure analyst Jamie Coutts said in a recent report that Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has started {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-may-behave-more-like-us-treasury-bonds-bloomberg-intelligence"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 base building similar to the one}}}\uc2  seen near $5,000 in 2018\u8211\'20\'132019. They expect the recovery to decouple from stocks and behave more like U.S. "Treasury bonds or gold.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/00528093-790d-442f-a646-5bb23c75e9c5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Although crypto prices have plunged sharply during the ongoing bear market, it has not dented investors\u8217\'20\'19 appetite. A report by crypto analytics firm Messari and Dove Metrics showed that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-fundraising-already-outpacing-all-of-2021-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto space raised $30.3 billion}}}\uc2  in funds in 2022, surpassing the total amount raised in 2021.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin continue its recovery or will bears pose a strong challenge at higher levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-retests-key-22-8k-as-metric-points-to-btc-buying-spree"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 below the 20-day exponential moving average}}}\uc2  (EMA) ($22,630) on Aug. 4 but could not sustain the lower levels. This indicates that the bulls are defending the level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/ac9bd1f6-20fe-4401-9101-e4bf3577f78a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The gradually up-sloping 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory indicate a minor advantage to buyers. If the price rises off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will attempt to push the BTC/USDT pair to the overhead resistance at $24,668.\par \par \uc2 This is an important level to keep an eye on because if the price breaks above $24,668, the pair could pick up momentum and rally toward $28,000 and then on to $32,000. Such a move will suggest that the pair may have bottomed out.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears continue to sell on minor rallies. That could open the doors for a drop to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($21,388).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the 20-day EMA ($1,560) and the $1,700 resistance for the past four days. Usually, tight range trading is followed by a range expansion.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/dfc49ac5-23c0-4f05-8c8e-21cab879b0ae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The up-sloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive zone indicate advantage to buyers. A break and close above the overhead resistance zone between $1,700 and $1,785 could open the doors for a possible rally to $2,000 and later to $2,200.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the ETH/USDT pair turns down from the current level and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears continue to defend the overhead zone with all their might. That could result in a decline to the strong support at $1,280.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  bounced off the $275 support on Aug. 2 and broke above the immediate resistance at $302 on Aug. 3. This indicates the resumption of the up-move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/9b66e918-a25d-4555-88f2-6f98b23edc77.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The up-sloping 20-day EMA ($277) and the RSI in the overbought zone indicate that bulls are in command. The BNB/USDT pair could rally to the stiff overhead resistance at $350. This level is likely to attract strong selling from the bears.\par \par \uc2 To invalidate this \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view, the bears will have to sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA. If that happens, short-term traders may rush to the exit and that could pull the pair down to the 50-day SMA ($246).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The buyers have successfully held the 20-day EMA ($0.36) support in the past few days but have failed to achieve a strong rebound in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2 . This suggests that bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/04d4e46f-aa2d-4e6b-9437-c1744bb07d8e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair could remain stuck between the 20-day EMA and the overhead resistance zone between $0.39 and $0.41. If bulls clear the overhead hurdle, the positive momentum could pick up and the pair could rally to $0.48 and then to $0.54.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the demand has dried up. That could sink the pair to the 50-day SMA ($0.34) and keep the pair range-bound between $0.30 and $0.39 for a few more days.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears repeatedly tried to sink Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) below the 20-day EMA ($0.50) in the past three days but the bulls held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/0c4464be-5616-4d87-813e-c1701c5bf623.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair has rebounded off the 20-day EMA and the buyers will attempt to push the price above the overhead resistance at $0.55. If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up and the pair could rise to $0.63 and later toward $0.70.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels. The sellers will then again attempt to sink the price below the moving averages and retain the pair inside the range between $0.40 and $0.55 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to sink the price below the support line on Aug. 3 but the bulls defended the level successfully. Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) formed an inside-day candlestick pattern on Aug. 4, which resolved to the upside on Aug. 5.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/b5165095-cdca-4ba1-9c12-4d34766c94eb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($40), the SOL/USDT pair could climb to $44 and then retest the stiff overhead resistance at $48. The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to signal the formation of an ascending triangle pattern. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a target objective of $71.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the support line, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup will be invalidated. The pair could then slide toward the strong support at $31.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 50-day SMA ($0.07) on Aug. 4 and the bulls extended the up-move above the 20-day EMA ($0.07) on Aug. 5.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/50608174-ec11-4215-884c-d4c399132b23.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will attempt to push the price toward the overhead resistance at $0.08. This is an important level for the bears to defend because a break and close above it will complete an ascending triangle pattern. The DOGE/USDT pair could then start an up-move to $0.10 and then to the pattern target at $0.11.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that bears are selling on rallies. The pair could then drop to the support line of the triangle. A break below this level could negate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-fails-to-beat-23-4k-sellers-as-us-payrolls-upend-inflation-debate"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin fails to beat $23.4K sellers as US payrolls upend inflation debate}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($7.78) on Aug. 3, indicating demand at lower levels. The buyers will attempt to push the price to the overhead resistance zone between $9 and $9.21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/111a9953-ed33-46ea-a444-3f1b4f4bd07a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls clear this overhead hurdle, the DOT/USDT pair could pick up momentum and start its northward march toward $10.80 and then $12. The up-sloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive zone indicate that buyers are in control.\par \par \uc2 To invalidate this \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view, the bears will have to sell aggressively and sink the pair below the moving averages. If that happens, the pair may remain stuck inside the range between $6 and $9 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The buyers have successfully held Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.85) during the correction, which suggests a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/6bc1048f-e909-4a16-8932-89d5d746e7d6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating advantage to buyers. If bulls thrust the price above the overhead resistance at $1.02, the MATIC/USDT pair could rally to $1.26 and then to $1.50.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the range between $0.75 and $1 for some more time. The sellers will gain the upper hand on a break below $0.75.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has bounced off the 20-day EMA ($22.86), indicating that bulls are buying the dips to this support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/2091ab34-fa60-4ea9-af21-868147ec735c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers will drive the price to the stiff overhead resistance at $26.38. The gradually up-sloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory indicate advantage to buyers. If bulls push the price above $26.38, the AVAX/USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern. The pair could then rally to $33 and later to $38.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance and breaks below the 20-day EMA, the pair could drop to the support line.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDgvYmU2OGMyMjItOGY4ZC00MTIxLWE5MDAtMDZiMGI3OGZiODNmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220805ei85000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/3: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, MATIC, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,694 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 August 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Buyers are attempting to stall the correction in Bitcoin and most major altcoins near the immediate support, suggesting that the sentiment has turned positive.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and altcoins are tracking the United States equities markets higher on Aug. 3 as traders buy the dip.\par \par \uc2 Smaller investors seem to be making the most of the bear market in Bitcoin as the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-wholecoiners-up-by-40k-since-june-crash-began"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 number of wholecoiners has soared by 40,000}}}\uc2  since the sharp fall in June. In comparison, wallet addresses with more than 1,000 Bitcoin have declined by 113 since May.\par \par \uc2 Some analysts believe that Bitcoin has not yet formed a macro bottom, however. Trading firm QCP Capital expects Bitcoin to gradually rise for most of the third quarter amid high \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 They believe Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-clips-23k-on-pelosi-taiwan-visit-as-trading-range-persists"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rally could hit a roof around $28,700}}}\uc2 . For the long-term, the firm did not rule out a final capitulation in Bitcoin to around $10,000, which may mark a bottom for the bear market.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/bb2a7b46-0892-4f3e-9567-4b229701e0cb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Nevertheless, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-for-beginners/how-to-mine-bitcoin-a-beginners-guide-to-mine-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin miners}}}\uc2  seem to be in an upbeat mode as they {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-miners-now-hold-a-record-1-856m-btc-new-data"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increased their Bitcoin holdings in July}}}\uc2  following the capitulation in June. According to data from on-chain analytics firm CryptoQuant, Bitcoin held by the miners hit the highest levels since.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins resume their up-move or will the recovery falter at higher levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin dropped to the 20-day exponential moving average ($22,632) on Aug. 2, which is acting as strong support. The gradually up-sloping 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory suggest that bulls have a slight edge.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/cbfa04c4-db07-4d0b-88d3-5427b0c219be.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now attempt to push the price above the overhead resistance at $24,668. If they succeed, the BTC/USDT pair could rally to $28,000 where the bears may mount a stiff resistance. If bulls clear this hurdle, the rally could extend to $32,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance, it will suggest that higher levels continue to attract selling from the bears. A break and close below the 20-day EMA could sink the pair to the 50-day simple moving average ($21,344) and then to the support line.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down and dropped to the 20-day EMA ($1,545) on Aug. 2 but the long tail on the candlestick suggests that the bulls aggressively purchased the dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/69dbe3bd-c7fb-4407-9dc5-61ac409d1b69.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will once again attempt to clear the overhead resistance zone between $1,700 and $1,785. If they succeed, it will indicate a potential trend change. The ETH/USDT pair could then rally to $2,000 and later to $2,200.\par \par \uc2 To invalidate this \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view, the bears will have to sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA. That could open the doors for a decline to the strong support at $1,280. A bounce off this level could keep the pair stuck between $1,280 and $1,700 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the $275 support on Aug. 2, indicating that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/de69f05f-105c-4d2c-a9d5-3a25b3953a12.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now make one more attempt to push the price above the overhead resistance at $300. If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally toward the stiff overhead resistance at $350.\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($268) and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view could invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s Aug. 3 candlestick indicates that bulls are attempting to defend the 20-day EMA ($0.36). The gradually up-sloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory indicate a slight advantage to buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/3ceb3559-f8fa-4d0b-8468-8c9a83dcacae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls push the price above the $0.39 to $0.41 resistance zone, the XRP/USDT pair could signal the start of a new up-move. The pair could then rally to $0.48 where the bears may again mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance, the possibility of a break below the 20-day EMA increases. If that happens, the pair may continue its range-bound action for a few more days.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been stuck in a large range between $0.40 and $0.55 for the past few days. The bulls are currently attempting to defend the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/99279929-2ee4-4919-abd4-e408ccf0a118.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could climb to the overhead resistance at $0.55. This remains an important level to watch out for. If bulls overcome this barrier, the pair could rally to $0.63 and later on to $0.70.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price breaks below the moving averages, the pair could slide to the immediate support at $0.45. A bounce off this level could form a new tighter range between $0.45 and $0.55 while a break below $0.45 could clear the path for a drop to $0.40.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) dipped below the 20-day EMA ($40) on Aug. 2 and dropped to the 50-day SMA ($37) on Aug. 3. The long tail on the candlestick suggests that traders are defending the support line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/531b5cc9-a6b1-47a6-bff5-abc8c96a3298.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the SOL/USDT pair could gradually climb up to $48. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close above it could complete the ascending triangle pattern that has a target objective of $71.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the rebound lacks strength, the bears will attempt to sink the pair below the support line. If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup will be negated and the pair may slide to $31.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to arrest Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) pullback at the 50-day SMA ($0.07). If the rebound sustains above the 20-day EMA ($0.07), a retest of $0.08 is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/727df0bf-ff75-433c-aba8-6fb0b30d87fd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above $0.08 to signal the completion of an ascending triangle pattern. If that happens, the DOGE/USDT pair could rally to $0.10 and then to the pattern target at $0.11.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the rebound lacks strength, it will suggest that demand dries up at higher levels. That could pull the price down to the trendline support. A break and close below this level could invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/lido-dao-ethereum-s-biggest-merge-staker-just-jumped-30-will-ldo-rally-into-september"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Lido DAO: Ethereum's biggest Merge staker just jumped 30% \u8212\'20\'14 will LDO rally into September?}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance and dipped to the 20-day EMA ($7.70) where the bulls are trying to stall the pullback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/9217561b-bb8e-4f0d-8b82-376aba3dcdf7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The gradually up-sloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that bulls have a slight edge. If bulls propel the price above the overhead resistance at $9, the DOT/USDT pair could rally to $10.80 and then to $12.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the range between $6 and $9 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($0.84) on Aug. 2, indicating that bulls are buying on dips. The price could next retest the $0.98 to $1.01 overhead resistance zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/ae9d4e2d-2d5e-4115-afa9-1a87908b90c4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Although the developing negative divergence on the RSI warrants caution, the up-sloping moving averages indicate advantage to buyers. If bulls clear the overhead resistance zone, the MATIC/USDT pair could rally to $1.26.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, the pair could drop to the strong support at $0.75. A sharp rebound off this level could keep the pair range-bound between $0.75 and $1 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to sink Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) below the 20-day EMA ($22.71) on Aug. 2 but the bulls held their ground. This indicates that traders are viewing the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/32dbaafe-822c-4250-8eea-fb9f95436af9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will attempt to push the price above the overhead resistance at $26.38. If they succeed, the AVAX/USDT pair could complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern, which has a target objective at $33 and then $38.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the 20-day EMA, the pair could slide to the support line. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break and close below it could tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDgvYzM1YmVmMzgtOGI1ZC00MDY5LTkyOWQtMjk4NGI5NjkxMjk0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220803ei830008d\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 Swiss Sygnum Bank expands crypto staking with Cardano\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Helen Partz \par \uc2 476 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 August 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Swiss crypto bank Sygnum has expanded its bank-grade staking offering with Cardano, allowing clients to generate rewards by staking \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  via the bank\u8217\'20\'19s institutional-grade platform.\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrency-friendly bank Sygnum Bank continues expanding its crypto services by launching support for Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) staking.\par \par \uc2 Sygnum {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.insights.sygnum.com/post/sygnum-bank-expands-bank-grade-staking-with-cardano-ada"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  on Tuesday that the firm has expanded its bank-grade staking offering with Cardano, allowing clients to generate rewards by staking \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  via the bank\u8217\'20\'19s institutional-grade platform.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  joins Sygnum\u8217\'20\'19s growing crypto-staking portfolio, which features three {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/blockchain-for-beginners/proof-of-stake-vs-proof-of-work:-differences-explained"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 proof-of-stake (PoS)}}}\uc2  protocols; Internet Computer, Tezos and soon, Ethereum 2.0.\par \par \uc2 According to the announcement, staking services make up an integral part of Sygnum\u8217\'20\'19s platform and are available to clients through the bank\u8217\'20\'19s eBanking platform. The services are fully integrated with Sygnum\u8217\'20\'19s banking platform, which is designed to provide institutional-grade security by applying segregated wallets, secure private key management and other tools.\par \par \uc2 Staking is the process of participating in the validation of transactions on a PoS blockchain in exchange for staking rewards. In contrast to proof-of-work (PoW) networks like Bitcoin, PoS blockchains do not need mining activity and instead rely on users locking up their coins to maintain a network.\par \par \uc2 A major regulated bank in Switzerland, Sygnum debuted cryptocurrency staking about two years ago, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.insights.sygnum.com/post/sygnum-becomes-first-bank-to-launch-tezos-staking-with-stake-rewards-of-up-to-5-annually"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launching}}}\uc2  Tezos staking in November 2020. Sygnum also announced in July 2021 that it would {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sygnum-becomes-first-bank-in-the-world-to-offer-eth2-staking"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 offer Ethereum 2.0 staking}}}\uc2  on its platform.\par \par \uc2 The addition of Cardano staking on Sygnum will increase exposure to the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  to many institutional investors. Following a tenfold increase in gross revenues in 2021, Sygnum\u8217\'20\'19s institutional client base was nearing 1,000 by early 2022, the firm {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.insights.sygnum.com/post/series-b-raises-usd-90m-accelerating-expansion-of-web-3-0-offerings-into-new-global-markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  in January.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis new offering allows Sygnum\u8217\'20\'19s clients to participate in our ecosystem, where they enjoy a risk-free staking experience without having to transfer the asset nor lock it,\u8221\'20\'1D Cardano Foundation CEO Frederik Gregaard said. He added that Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s architecture also provides both retail and institutional clients with a unique opportunity for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  holders. \u8220\'20\'1CYou always have the power over your \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,\u8221\'20\'1D he noted.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-staking-service-lido-announces-layer-two-expansion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum staking service Lido announces layer-2 expansion}}}\par \par \uc2 Amid the upcoming Cardano Vasil hard fork, many crypto companies have been working on Cardano-focused services. In late July, major hardware wallet firm Ledger {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Ledger/status/1552657635769339907?s=20&t=2D9F2UbUF_enMSMmkH50vw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  the integration of 100 Cardano tokens on its wallet software Ledger Live.\par \par \uc2 The Cardano Vasil hard fork is expected to significantly improve the Cardano network in terms of speed and scalability, making it more suitable for smart contracts and decentralized applications. After {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/disappointing-cardano-devs-delay-vasil-hard-fork-by-a-month"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 failing to go live in June}}}\uc2 , the Cardano Vasil hard fork {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-vasil-hard-fork-hit-with-another-delay-for-several-weeks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 was delayed again in July}}}\uc2 . According to Input Output Global, proceeding with the actual fork might take another \u8220\'20\'1Cfew weeks.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDgvZTg3M2I4MTEtZDE4NS00ZTczLWI1MDItNGY4ODMzZDMxMmMzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220802ei820005q\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 8/1: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, MATIC, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,796 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 August 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The bears continue to sell near overhead resistance levels, indicating that the up-move in Bitcoin and most major altcoins may have to wait.\par \par \uc2 After strong monthly gains in July, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and the altcoins have started the new month on a tentative note. Even the United States equities markets have started August on a soft note.\par \par \uc2 Is the bottom in?\par \par \uc2 BofA Securities\uc2  head of U.S. equity and quantitative strategy Savita Subramanian {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2022/07/31/stock-futures-fall-slightly-to-start-august-trading-with-market-coming-off-best-month-since-2020.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  in a recent note that the stock market usually bottoms after earnings estimates are revised lower but that has not yet happened during the current downturn.\par \par \uc2 Analysts in the crypto space also remain divided on whether the current rise is a bear market rally or the start of a new bull phase.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/288fb9d4-d15c-41d8-b22b-2fd99f817708.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 However, a minor positive is that the world\u8217\'20\'19s first {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-for-beginners/bitcoin-etfs-a-beginners-guide-to-exchange-traded-funds"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin spot price exchange-traded fund}}}\uc2  (ETF), the \uc2 Purpose Bitcoin ETF\uc2 , has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/best-monthly-gains-since-october-2021-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added 2,600 Bitcoin to its holdings}}}\uc2 . Although the total assets under management remain well below the all-time high, the recent addition is a sign that some institutional investors may have started bottom fishing.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins find buyers at lower levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls repeatedly failed to sustain Bitcoin above the overhead resistance at $24,276 in the past few days, indicating that the bears are defending the level with all their might.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/7155fe38-8f0f-4c23-83a1-82df48a9633b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has pulled back to the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($22,515), which is likely to act as strong support. If the price rises from the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again try to clear the overhead hurdle.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the BTC/USDT pair could pick up momentum and a rally to $28,171 is possible. The up-sloping 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) in the positive territory indicate advantage to buyers.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($21,310). The pair could then decline to the support line, which is an important level for the bulls to defend.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the important level at $1,700. Although the bulls repeatedly pushed the price above this level in the past four days, they could not continue the up-move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/14aac1a1-f9ec-4e76-bfce-7e8ca07eed3a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price to the 20-day EMA ($1,525) which is an important level to watch out for. If the price rebounds here, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 That could increase the likelihood of a break above the $1,700 to $1,785 resistance zone. If that happens, the ETH/USDT pair could rise to $2,000 and later to $2,200.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the pair may remain range-bound between $1,280 and $1,785 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  's recovery is facing strong resistance at $300 but the shallow pullback shows that the bulls are not closing their positions in a hurry as they expect the up-move to continue.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/d51a006e-33a5-483b-8c00-c2f878323b54.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will attempt to defend the zone between $275 and the 20-day EMA ($264). If the price rebounds off this zone, the bulls will again try to drive the BNB/USDT pair above $300. If they manage to do that, the pair could start its northward march toward the stiff overhead resistance at $350.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the pair could decline to the 50-day SMA ($240).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  price rose above the overhead resistance of $0.39 on July 30 and 31 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that the bears have not yet given up and continue to defend the $0.39 level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/7f600e09-dec1-4fed-85f6-d47947b78b05.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The gradually up-sloping 20-day EMA ($0.36) and the RSI in the positive territory indicate a slight advantage to buyers. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will improve the prospects of a rally above the overhead zone between $0.39 and $0.41. If that happens, the XRP/USDT pair could rally to $0.48.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price slips below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that traders are booking profits as they expect the pair to remain range-bound for a few more days. A break below the 50-day SMA ($0.34) could open the doors for a drop to $0.30.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance at $0.55 on July 30, indicating that the bears are in no mood to allow the bulls to have their way.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/3cad1a9f-cb15-42cb-ad33-973f9730f6aa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below the moving averages, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to $0.45. Such a move will suggest that the pair may remain stuck inside the large range between $0.40 and $0.55 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price rebounds off the moving averages, it will suggest that bulls are buying on dips. The bulls will then once again try to push the pair above $0.55. If they succeed, the pair could rise to $0.63, and later to $0.70.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears thwarted an attempt by the bulls to push Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $48 on July 30. This may have attracted profit-booking from the short-term traders and that has pulled the price to the 20-day EMA ($40).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/53162880-e764-48e1-acc0-e195e500efbf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will make one more attempt to push the SOL/USDT pair above the overhead resistance. If they succeed, the pair will complete an ascending triangle pattern that has a target objective of $71.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, the pair could challenge the support line of the triangle. If this level gives way, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup will be negated. That could open the doors for a decline to $30.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $0.08 but the bears had other plans. They sold at higher levels and have pulled the price back toward the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/92c13c8f-2054-406a-bff4-ebdf63bda599.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price continues lower and breaks below the moving averages, the trendline may be in danger of collapsing. If that happens, the developing \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern will be invalidated. That could tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the moving averages, it will suggest that bulls continue to buy at lower levels. The bulls will then again attempt to push the DOGE/USDT pair above $0.08 and start a new up-move to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/the-rise-of-fake-cryptocurrency-apps-and-how-to-avoid-them"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The rise of fake cryptocurrency apps and how to avoid them}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the overhead resistance of $8.50 on July 31 but the long wick on the candlestick shows selling at higher levels. The bears are attempting to trap the aggressive bulls by pulling the price back below the breakout level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/337047aa-2820-46bf-8bcd-802bd790cf7c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the DOT/USDT pair could decline to the 20-day EMA ($7.64). This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close below it will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the range between $6 and $8.50 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rises from the current level or the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bulls are buying on dips. That could improve the prospects of a rally to the psychological level of $10 and then to $10.80.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The buyers pushed Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) above the psychological resistance at $1 on July 31 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows aggressive selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/711ae894-67ab-443e-84d7-a3ab75c78c60.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price to the 20-day EMA ($0.82), which is likely to act as a strong support. If the price rebounds off this level, it will suggest that bulls continue to buy on dips. That may increase the possibility of a break above $1. If that happens, the MATIC/USDT pair could rally to $1.26.\par \par \uc2 The RSI is showing the first signs of forming a negative divergence, indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening. If bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the pair could drop to $0.75. A bounce off this level could suggest that the pair may remain range-bound between $0.75 and $1 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance at $26.38 on July 30, indicating that bears continue to defend the level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-08/41be1208-01ec-40b3-945b-5608071cbb19.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will attempt to sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($22.55). If they manage to do that, the AVAX/USDT pair could decline to the 50-day SMA ($19.73), which is placed just above the support line. A break and close below this support could suggest that bears are back in control.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off the moving averages, it will suggest that bulls continue to buy on dips. The bulls will then make another attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $26.38 and start the new up-move to $33, and then to $38.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDgvZmQ3N2FhZGYtMTJhMi00ZTRmLTk4M2UtYjI1ODBmNmY0YjIwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220801ei810008f\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/29: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, MATIC, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,821 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 July 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price has hit resistance at the $24,000 level, resulting in a slight pullback in select altcoins. Is the rally over?\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) hit a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bull-run-getting-interesting-as-btc-price-hits-6-week-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 six-week high above $24,000}}}\uc2  on July 29, extending its rally that picked up momentum after the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  hiked rates by 75 basis points on July 27. If the rally sustains for the next two days, Bitcoin could be on target to close the month of July with gains of more than 20%, according to data from Coinglass.\par \par \uc2 It is not only the crypto markets that have seen a post-Federal Open Market Committee (FOMC) rally. The U.S. equities markets {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2022/07/28/stock-market-news-updates-open-to-close-future.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 are}}}\uc2  on track for big monthly gains in July. The S&P 500 and the Nasdaq Composite are up about 8.8% and 12% in July, on track to their best monthly gains since November 2020.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/44ae6177-6b4b-4fbf-9c90-7b86fa83fb76.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 The crypto and equities markets have risen in the expectation that the pace of rate hikes by the Fed will slow down in the future. Arthur Hayes, ex-CEO of derivatives platform BitMEX, believes that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-holds-24k-as-us-dollar-taps-3-week-lows-on-eurozone-inflation-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Fed will not increase rates further}}}\uc2  and may eventually return to an accommodative monetary policy and more neutral rates.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins extend their recovery over the next few days? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin closed below the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($22,213) on July 25 but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. The bulls bought the dip below $21,000 and propelled the price back above the moving averages on July 27.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/d03b1fca-58c6-45b6-a0ab-dedad34d95d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the positive territory, indicating that bulls are in control. If buyers drive the price above $24,276, the BTC/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally toward the pattern target of $28,171. If this level is crossed, the next stop could be $32,000.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level or fails to sustain above $24,276, it will suggest that demand dries up at higher levels. In that case, the critical level to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA. If this support cracks, it will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. The pair could then decline to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($21,589).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rebounded sharply off the 20-day EMA ($1,470) on July 27 and broke above the critical resistance at $1,700 on July 28. However, the bears are not willing to relent and are trying to pull the price back below $1,700 on July 29.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/a6f964b2-76e1-4dad-8aa9-b25afa68322c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls and bears may engage in a tough battle near $1,700 but the upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive zone indicate an advantage to buyers. If bulls sustain the price above $1,700, the momentum could pick up and the ETH/USDT pair could rally to $2,000 and later to $2,200.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bears pull the price below $1,590, aggressive bulls could get trapped and the pair may drop to the 20-day EMA. A strong rebound off this level will increase the possibility of a break above $1,700 but a break below the 20-day EMA could sink the pair to $1,280.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  has been trading inside an ascending channel for the past few days. The price bounced off the 50-day SMA ($239) on July 26 and rose above the downtrend line, indicating a potential change in trend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/3f6cdfe2-6384-49cd-832c-2e1457178a3e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum continued and the buyers have driven the price above the resistance line of the ascending channel. If bulls sustain the price above the channel, the BNB/USDT pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $350.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls fail to sustain the price above the channel, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels. The pair could then re-enter the channel and drop to the downtrend line. A strong rebound off this level could improve the prospects of a break above the channel. The bears will have to sink the price below the channel to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) is range-bound in a downtrend. The bears pulled the price below the moving averages on July 25 but could not sustain the lower levels and challenge the strong support at $0.30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/2dc892d3-0e70-4c3e-a585-bd80a16ebf90.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This suggests strong demand at lower levels. The buyers pushed the price back above the moving averages on July 27 and are attempting to clear the overhead hurdle at $0.39. If they succeed, it will suggest the start of a new up-move. The pair could then rally to the target objective at $0.48.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, the price has turned down from $0.39. The bears will try to sink the XRP/USDT pair below the moving averages. If they do that, the pair could consolidate between $0.30 and $0.39 for a few more days.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the moving averages on July 27, indicating strong buying near the $0.44 support. The price has reached the overhead resistance at $0.55, which could act as a stiff barrier.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/f1763538-44f1-4571-9487-b198100b872a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $0.55, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to the moving averages. A break below this support could keep the pair range-bound between $0.44 and $0.55 for a few days. The bears will have to sink the pair below the $0.44 to $0.40 support zone to signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls thrust the price above $0.55, it will suggest the start of a new up-move. The pair could then rally to $0.63 and later to $0.70.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the support line on July 26, indicating strong buying at lower levels. The bulls built upon the momentum and pushed the price above the moving averages on July 27.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/80ded504-2831-4f55-b35c-f6ebea393311.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The SOL/USDT pair could reach the overhead resistance at $48, which is an important level to keep an eye on. If bulls overcome this barrier, the pair will complete an ascending triangle pattern. The pair could then start an up-move toward the pattern target at $71.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from $48, the pair may extend its stay inside the triangle for a few more days. A break and close below the support line could tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the trendline of the ascending triangle pattern on July 27 and rose above the moving averages. This indicates strong demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/8791c07d-f5a6-4388-b924-c9fd6eb31e20.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to push the price toward the overhead resistance at $0.08. The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI has jumped into the positive territory indicating advantage to buyers.\par \par \uc2 If bulls drive the price above $0.08, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup will complete and the DOGE/USDT pair could rally to the pattern target of $0.11. The bears will have to sink the price below the trendline of the triangle to invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bear-market-over-metric-hints-as-btc-exchange-balances-hit-4-year-low"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin bear market over, metric hints as BTC exchange balances hit 4-year low}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) turned up and broke above the moving averages on July 27, indicating that lower levels are attracting buyers. The price has reached the strong overhead resistance at $8.50 where the bears may mount a strong defense.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/fa80501f-a3fc-4f7b-8d29-4e1dd51d244d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating that the bears may be losing their grip. If bulls push and sustain the price above $8.50, it will suggest the start of a new up-move to $10 and later to $10.80.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from $8.50 and slips below the moving averages, it will suggest that the DOT/USDT pair may oscillate inside a range for a few more days. The bears will have to sink the pair below $6 to start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($0.79) on July 26 and rose above the downtrend line on July 27. This indicated that the minor corrective phase was over.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/6a6df489-e066-46c6-80ea-8faadfddbc69.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price to $0.98 on July 28 and 29 but the long wick on the candlesticks suggests that the bears are defending the level with vigor. The upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 If bulls push the price above the psychological level of $1, the MATIC/USDT pair could extend its rally to $1.26. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view could be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 50-day SMA ($19.48) on July 26 and is nearing the overhead resistance at $26.38 on July 29. The bears will try to stall the recovery at this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/3bf1a83a-473e-4e1a-a9cb-9077ea566449.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The gradually upsloping 20-day EMA ($22.10) and the RSI in the positive territory indicate an advantage to buyers. If bulls drive the price above $26.38, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up and the AVAX/USDT pair could rally to $33 and then to $38.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from $26.38 and breaks below the 20-day EMA, the bears will make one more attempt to sink the pair below the 50-day SMA and challenge the support line.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDcvMjMwMmI4ZGQtOWY4Yy00YzBmLWJiYTctN2JlYmJjYTM1NjZjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220729ei7t0008h\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 Cardano Vasil hard fork hit with another delay for several weeks\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Helen Partz \par \uc2 493 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 July 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 After failing to go live last month, the Cardano Vasil hard fork is delayed again as teams behind the Cardano blockchain development target a smooth network upgrade.\par \par \uc2 After failing to go live last month, the Cardano Vasil hard fork is delayed again as teams behind the Cardano blockchain development target a smooth network upgrade.\par \par \uc2 Input Output Global (IOG), the organization responsible for Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s research and development, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://youtu.be/mHHVaxkHFrE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 released}}}\uc2  a \uc2 YouTube\uc2  update on Thursday on the upcoming Vasil hard fork.\par \par \uc2 IOG technical manager Kevin Hammond announced that the Vasil hard fork will be postponed one more time to ensure that all parties, including exchanges and API developers, are \u8220\'20\'1Call ready for that.\u8221\'20\'1D Hammond said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CObviously, from where we are, there could be a few more weeks before we go to the actual Vasil hard fork [...] This is incredibly important. All the users must be ready to progress through the hard fork to ensure a smooth process.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Hammond pointed out that IOG has been focused on solving some testnet issues, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/input-output-hk/cardano-node/issues/4225"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 progressing}}}\uc2  with the Cardano node version 1.35.2. The new node version fixes issues related to stake pool operators, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/defi-101/what-are-dapps-everything-there-is-to-know-about-decentralized-applications"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 decentralized application (DApp)}}}\uc2  developers, internal testing and other issues identified on the testnet.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe goal is that it will flush out any final issues as we go to the Vasil hard fork. What we\u8217\'20\'19re doing is fixing on testing authority, getting it right and not rushing,\u8221\'20\'1D Hammond added.\par \par \uc2 Amid the expected update, Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) price has seen some significant \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coingecko.com/en/coins/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 surging}}}\uc2  more than 7% over the past 24 hours at the time of writing, trading at $0.537. The cryptocurrency has been up 21% over the past 14 days, according to data from CoinGecko.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/820e2ed6-a15d-46f3-9061-08ee6787fd77.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) 14-day price chart. Source: CoinGecko\par \par \uc2 The Vasil hard fork is the biggest upgrade to Cardano since the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-s-alonzo-hard-fork-was-a-success-but-real-utility-could-be-a-while"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Alonzo hard fork}}}\uc2 , which was completed in September 2021. The upcoming fork is positioned as a \u8220\'20\'1Cgame changer\u8221\'20\'1D in the Cardano development, as it\u8217\'20\'19s expected to improve the network in terms of speed and scalability, making it more suitable for smart contracts and DApps.\par \par \uc2 Input Output {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/InputOutputHK/status/1526546934189764608"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 released}}}\uc2  the roadmap for the Vasil hard fork in May 2022, originally aiming to execute the hard fork on the mainnet on June 29. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/disappointing-cardano-devs-delay-vasil-hard-fork-by-a-month"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hard fork was eventually delayed}}}\uc2  until the last week of July over several \u8220\'20\'1Csevere\u8221\'20\'1D bugs.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sell-the-news-cardano-price-risks-20-drop-despite-vasil-hard-fork-euphoria"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Sell the news? Cardano price risks 20% drop despite Vasil hard fork euphoria}}}\par \par \uc2 Vasil\u8217\'20\'19s delay comes amid the cryptocurrency community anticipating another important event for one of the largest cryptocurrencies by market capitalization. Ethereum, the second-largest blockchain by value, is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-dev-confirms-perpetual-date-for-pos-merge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 scheduled for a merger phase}}}\uc2  of its proof-of-stake (PoS) transition on Sept. 19. As previously reported, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-devs-tip-the-merge-will-occur-in-august-if-everything-goes-to-plan"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 phase was delayed multiple times}}}\uc2 , while the full upgrade is expected to go live in 2023.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDcvZjVmZWNlNTQtYjI0Yy00NDk5LWI3ZTctZTVjNmQ3NzliNzY3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220729ei7t00033\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin \u8216\'20\'18bear market rally continues\u8217\'20\'19 after BTC price jumps to $23.4K\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  William Suberg \par \uc2 627 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 July 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC price strength endures as $23,000 forms a focus after Bitcoin gets a fresh Fed boost.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) consolidated higher into July 28 after United States monetary policy changes fueled optimism in risk assets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/4672e40b-0a0d-4e6c-86f5-40cb2823c0e5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Fed hike instils fresh crypto optimism\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.142027444.742658523.1640948929-762064149.1640948929"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD climbing to highs of $23,452 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2  overnight.\par \par \uc2 The pair had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-spikes-above-22-2k-as-fed-votes-for-75-basis-point-rate-hike"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reacted strongly}}}\uc2  to the latest \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  key rate hike, despite this conforming to market predictions. Subsequent comments from Fed Chair \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  added to the breakout\u8217\'20\'19s momentum.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI think the reason this is providing some relief to the equity market is the Fed is acknowledging that there can be an impact on growth, to the economy, based on their policy,\u8221\'20\'1D Gargi Chaudhuri, head of asset management giant \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s iShares investment strategy Americas, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2022/07/27/real-time-updates-of-the-feds-big-rate-decision-and-powells-press-conference.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  CNBC.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThey\u8217\'20\'19re recognizing there are two sides of this \u8211\'20\'13 there\u8217\'20\'19s a growth tradeoff to fight inflation. The recognition is something we heard today that we didn\u8217\'20\'19t hear before.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Crypto commentators had already predicted that the Fed would find itself {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bullish-rate-hike-why-crypto-spiked-today-in-the-face-of-bad-news"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stuck between two stools}}}\uc2  in the form of forty-year-high inflation and the risk of a recession arising from fighting it.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWho's outperforming here? Nasdaq & Crypto,\u8221\'20\'1D Alf, creator of the Macro Compass Newsletter, wrote in part of a \uc2 Twitter\uc2  summary of the week\u8217\'20\'19s events.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf the Fed isn't gonna force tighter financial conditions on autopilot anymore, real yields will actually start declining again.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Finally, what's the bond market saying?\par \par \uc2 We priced away some hikes between now and December, and this is how we are left:\par \par \uc2 - 50 in Sep\par \par \uc2 - 25 in Nov\par \par \uc2 - 25 in Dec\par \par \uc2 DONE\par \par \uc2 - 50 bps of cuts in 2023\par \par \uc2 A higher likelihood that ''peak Fed hawkishness'' is behind us.\par \par \uc2 12/ {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/HyvXvnBf6P"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/HyvXvnBf6P}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Alf (@MacroAlf) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MacroAlf/status/1552395718727503878?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 July 27, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 He noted that forthcoming rate hikes were not being priced in as beating or even equalling the 75-basis-point July move, contributing to \u8220\'20\'1Ca higher likelihood that \u8216\'20\'18peak Fed hawkishness\u8217\'20\'19 is behind us.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Eyes on $23,500 daily close\par \par \uc2 When it comes to BTC price action, commentators were thus cautiously optimistic while waiting for the last remnants of \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  to clear the market.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-7-27-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-ada-sol-doge-dot-matic-avax"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/27: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, MATIC, AVAX}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CNot jumping the gun just yet, but daily closes above 23450 and I'll start to look for long setups towards 26500,\u8221\'20\'1D popular trader and analyst Crypto Tony wrote on the day.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin thus had to match its overnight highs and hold them to asset a change of trend.\par \par \uc2 A very \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  daily close- we closed above the body of our resistance zone. A \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  retest/rejection would have had us closing below it. We may have just put in our higher low. On LTF, pullbacks to green are healthy- hold it on a retest and this is likely a full-on reversal. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/bgUEWpjJfh"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/bgUEWpjJfh}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/FITJPNJRtL"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/FITJPNJRtL}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 CrediBULL Crypto (@CredibleCrypto) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CredibleCrypto/status/1552542352626950144?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 July 28, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 On-chain analytics resource Material Indicators meanwhile eyed what it described as a \u8220\'20\'1Cstrong long signal\u8221\'20\'1D on the daily close, something which was in the process of strengthening the short-term bull case.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBear Market Rally continues,\u8221\'20\'1D it {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MI_Algos/status/1552474855777472514/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 concluded}}}\uc2  in a tweet alongside a buy and sell signal chart.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDcvMjQ3NmNmOTAtMmM5OS00NWM1LThjODAtZTc1NDQ3NTM5YmU2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220728ei7s0002w\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/27: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, MATIC, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,753 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 July 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins surged ahead of today\u8217\'20\'19s FOMC meeting, but will the expected 75 basis point rate hike cap the current rally?\par \par \uc2 United States equities and cryptocurrency markets are heading into the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s interest rate decision on July 27 on a positive note. This suggests that the market participants believe the Fed will deliver a 75 basis point rate hike, which is in line with market expectations.\par \par \uc2 Some economists expect the Fed to calm the markets by indicating less aggressive rate hikes in the future. Trading firm QCP Capital said that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-heads-into-fomc-day-on-24-hour-highs-amid-concern-over-24-3k-top"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22market reaction\b0 \highlight22  has been positive}}}\uc2  to all the Federal Open Market Committee meetings this year and they expect the same with the latest one as well.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/b1bf48a0-a099-4ed0-bf9a-a5592e52e124.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/imf-recession-warning-sees-bitcoin-dip-under-21k-amid-fresh-1m-btc-price-forecast"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Analysts are divided on the next directional move}}}\uc2  for Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ). After the event has passed, some expect Bitcoin to turn down from the current level and drop to a new year-to-date low while others expect the recovery to pick up steam.\par \par \uc2 Do the charts support a relief rally or a further fall? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke below the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($21,738) on July 25 and re-entered the symmetrical triangle pattern. This suggests that the recent breakout from the triangle may have been a bull trap.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/294909fa-c208-4bf4-835e-958957cff58f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the relative strength index (RSI) is just below the midpoint, indicating a range-bound action in the near term. The price may remain stuck between the support line and $24,276 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 If buyers drive the price above the moving averages, the BTC/USDT pair could rise to the overhead resistance at $24,276. The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to signal the start of a new up-move.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the moving averages, the bears will try to pull the pair to the support line. A break below this level could open the doors for a possible drop to $18,626 and then to $17,622.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance and dropped to the 20-day EMA ($1,406) on July 26. The long tail on the candlestick shows strong buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/0f8a2104-7621-4a46-b011-39f64830842c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will attempt to push the price to the overhead resistance at $1,700. This is an important level to watch out for because a break and close above it will signal a potential change in trend. The ETH/USDT pair could then rise to $2,000.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bulls fail to achieve a strong rebound off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest a lack of aggressive buying. That could increase the possibility of a drop to $1,280. A strong rebound off this level could indicate a range-bound action in the near term but a break below it may sink the pair to $1,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  rebounded off the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($239) on July 26, indicating that the bulls are attempting to flip this level into support. The buyers have pushed the price above the 20-day EMA ($250) and will try to challenge the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/a643296b-aa15-460a-9a8b-7a2fd61c9fc1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls propel the price above the downtrend line, it will suggest a potential change in trend. The BNB/USDT pair could then climb to the resistance line of the ascending channel where the bears may mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level or the downtrend line, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels. The sellers will then make another attempt to sink the pair below the support line of the channel. If they do that, the pair could slide to the strong support at $211.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) dropped below the moving averages on July 25, opening the doors for a possible drop to the strong support at $0.30. In a range, traders usually buy near the support and sell at the resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/49703655-e291-4895-99ce-ae0ec8580e8b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Therefore, the bulls are likely to defend the $0.30 level aggressively. A strong rebound off this level could keep the XRP/USDT range-bound between $0.30 and $0.39 for a few days. The flattish moving averages and the RSI just below the midpoint signal a consolidation in the near term.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move could begin after bears sink the price below $0.30 or bulls drive the pair above $0.39. Until then, volatile range-bound action is likely to continue.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) dropped and closed below the moving averages on July 25. The bears tried to sink the price below the strong support at $0.44 but the bulls held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/654922c8-7c1b-4da6-8bae-9d0fad546f54.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers are attempting to push the price above the moving averages. If they do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to the overhead resistance at $0.55. The bears are expected to mount a strong defense at this level but if bulls overcome this barrier, the pair could climb to $0.63 and then to $0.70.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the moving averages and breaks below $0.44, the next stop could be $0.40. A break below this level could indicate the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) dipped below the moving averages and reached the support line on July 26. The bulls are attempting to defend the level but are struggling to push the price above the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/825a7da4-7bb3-4589-a91a-d1d38b407bc3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels. The 20-day EMA ($38) is flattish and the RSI is just below the midpoint, indicating equilibrium between buyers and sellers. This advantage could tilt in favor of the bears if the price breaks and closes below the support line. If that happens, the SOL/USDT pair could slide to $30.\par \par \uc2 To invalidate this \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view, the buyers will have to push the price above the 20-day EMA. If they do that, the pair could climb to the overhead resistance at $48. A break and close above this level will complete the ascending triangle pattern, which has a target objective at $71.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the trendline on July 26 but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. The bulls bought the dip and pushed the price back into the ascending triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/823daffb-ecc5-4922-88e8-3eb97802ef38.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have started to slope down and the RSI is in the negative territory, indicating that bears have the upper hand. If the price turns down and closes below the trendline, the likelihood of a drop to $0.05 increases.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the moving averages, the DOGE/USDT pair could rise to the overhead resistance at $0.08. The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to complete the ascending triangle pattern. The pair could then rally to the pattern target at $0.11.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-stock-coin-in-danger-of-another-60-crash-by-september-here-s-why"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coinbase stock (COIN) in danger of another 60% crash by September \u8212\'20\'14 Here's why}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the critical support at $6 and the 50-day SMA ($7.36) for the past few days. Although the 20-day EMA ($7.13) is flat, the RSI in the negative territory indicates a slight advantage to sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/ae760584-6152-457c-b3be-08673fb40f4e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or the 50-day SMA, the bears will make another attempt to sink the DOT/USDT pair below $6. If they succeed, the pair could start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price rises and breaks above the 50-day SMA, it will signal demand at lower levels. The pair could then rise to $8.79 where the bears may again offer a stiff resistance. A break and close above this level could open the doors for a rally to $10.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the 20-day EMA ($0.75) on July 26 but the bulls purchased the dip as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/28a200d3-8be3-4051-86e3-5a72219c7638.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers are attempting to resume the up-move which could face strong selling at the resistance line. If bulls clear this overhead hurdle, the momentum could pick up and the MATIC/USDT pair could rally to the psychological level at $1. A close above this level could open the doors for a rally to $1.26.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the resistance line, it will increase the possibility of a break below $0.75. If that happens, the index could slide to $0.63.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) dropped below the breakout level of $21.35 on July 25, indicating that bears are aggressively selling on rallies. A minor positive is that the bulls are attempting to defend the 50-day SMA ($19.45).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/f07fc599-4ae8-495c-8d19-6051a79296f8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($21.43) has flattened out and the RSI is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. This advantage could tilt in favor of the sellers if the price breaks below the support line.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the index sustains above the 20-day EMA, the AVAX/USDT pair could rally to $26.50. The bulls will have to clear this overhead hurdle to signal the resumption of the up-move. The pair could then rally toward $33.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDcvZmQxODAxNjEtYzA3OC00ZGQxLTk3NzktNDVjMzEzYmMwYTIyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Docume