ome around every once in a while.\par \par \uc2 Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://degrain.io"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://degrain.io}}}\par \par \uc2 Presale: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://presale.degrain.io"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://presale.degrain.io}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/degrainio"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/degrainio}}}\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/degrainio"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://twitter.com/degrainio}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020220725ei7p0012x\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/25: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, MATIC, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,733 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 July 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most major altcoins turned down from their overhead resistance levels and declined to their support levels, indicating that bears are in control.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and most major altcoins are witnessing profit-booking on July 25 as the bulls scale back their positions before the Federal Open Market Committee meeting on July 26 through July 27. This indicates that the sentiment remains fragile and that bulls are not confident about carrying long positions into the event.\par \par \uc2 Several analysts have retained their \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view after Bitcoin failed to sustain above the 200-week moving average at $22,780. CryptoQuant contributor Venturefounder expects the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/will-the-fed-prevent-btc-price-from-reaching-28k-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 selling to resume and Bitcoin to fall}}}\uc2  as low as $14,000 before a macro bottom is confirmed.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/e5250f3a-f7a6-4bdf-8f17-5ecff9e46a3c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 The institutional investors seem to be absent from the markets and the recovery is being driven by the retail investors. Data from on-chain analytics firm Glassnode showed that investors holding {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-drops-below-21-8k-realized-price-as-fomc-spooks-markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 one Bitcoin or less have been aggressively accumulating}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cmore now than ever.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Could retail investors continue their frantic pace of purchasing and put a floor below Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin rebounded off the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($21,857) on July 23 but the bulls could not clear the hurdle at $23,363 on July 24. This suggests that bears are aggressively defending the overhead resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/c818220a-624d-4d30-b013-fd321a0ca6c2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has returned to the 20-day EMA, which is an important level to keep an eye on. If this level cracks, the BTC/USDT pair could drop to $20,750. Such a move will invalidate the breakout from the symmetrical triangle.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the relative strength index (RSI) has dropped to the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 This advantage could tilt in favor of buyers if the price breaks above $23,363. If that happens, the pair could rally to $28,171 and then to $30,000. The bears will have to sink the price below the support line to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears have successfully defended the overhead resistance at $1,700 in the past few days. However, a minor positive is that the bulls have not allowed Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) to drop below $1,464, indicating buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/d86d6e6c-ca69-4bb5-90ac-3b0116ec62db.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price once again rebounds off $1,464, the ETH/USDT pair could continue its tight range-bound action for a few more days. The rising 20-day EMA ($1,397) and the RSI in the positive zone indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above $1,700 could signal the resumption of the up-move. The pair could then rally to $2,000.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate if the price slips below the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the pair may drop to $1,280. A strong rebound off this level could keep the pair range-bound between $1,280 and $1,700 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  turned down from the downtrend line on July 23, indicating that the bears continue to defend the level with vigor. The bears will now attempt to sink the price below the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/961ac000-4d0e-4e26-99b8-3c52398f8fcf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could test the support line of the ascending channel. If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will again try to push the pair above the downtrend line and challenge the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the bears sink the price below the support line of the channel. If that happens, the advantage will tilt in favor of the bears and the pair could decline to the strong support at $211.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating between $0.30 and $0.39 for the past few days. Although the price bounced off the moving averages on July 23, the rally could not reach the overhead resistance at $0.39. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/096ec254-f833-4120-adae-c44087f77fe9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to sink the price below the moving averages. If they manage to do that, the XRP/USDT pair could gradually decline toward $0.30. The buyers are likely to defend this level with all their might because if the support cracks, the pair could resume the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will again try to clear the overhead hurdle at $0.39 and start a new up-move. The pair could then rally to $0.50.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) attempted to rise above the overhead resistance at $0.55 on July 24 but the bears successfully defended the level. That may have attracted profit-booking from the short-term traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/7698bfed-861a-4c19-8a14-d8b08242b3bb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are attempting to sink the price below the moving averages. If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to $0.44. If the price rebounds off this level, the pair may oscillate between $0.44 and $0.55 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price rebounds off the moving averages. If that happens, the bulls will again try to push the pair above the overhead resistance. If they succeed, the pair could pick up momentum and rally to $0.63 and then to $0.70.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) failure to rebound off the 20-day EMA ($39) indicates that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening. The bears will attempt to sink the price to the support line, which is an important level to keep an eye on.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/9497aa5c-e3fc-48c3-8c33-3e489b32bcf1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the support line, the buyers will make another attempt to push the SOL/USDT pair toward the overhead resistance at $48. The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to signal the completion of the ascending triangle pattern. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a target objective of $71.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bears sink the price below the support line, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern will be negated. The pair could then decline to $30. A break below this level will indicate that the bears are back in control.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears have pulled Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) below the moving averages on July 25, which opens the doors for a decline to the trendline. The bulls are likely to defend this level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/bf1c85f1-544e-40ca-92c0-29171548f58f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the trendline, the bulls will attempt to push the DOGE/USDT pair above the moving averages. If that happens, the pair could rise to the overhead resistance at $0.08. A break and close above this level will complete an ascending triangle pattern that has a target objective of $0.11.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks below the trendline, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup will be negated. That could sink the pair to $0.06 and later to the crucial support at $0.05.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-s-bearish-u-turn-eth-price-momentum-fades-after-1-6k-rejection"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum's \b  \highlight22bearish\b0 \highlight22  U-turn? ETH price momentum fades after $1.6K rejection}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls repeatedly failed to push Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above the 50-day SMA ($7.47) in the past few days, indicating that bears are defending the level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/69871d19-3126-40f7-8b0c-e7e67a4951be.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOT/USDT pair slipped below the 20-day EMA ($7.23) on July 25. If bears sustain the price below this level, the pair could slide toward the strong support at $6. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close below it could signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 50-day SMA. If that happens, it will suggest demand at lower levels. The pair could then rise to $8.79 and later to the psychological level of $10.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the resistance line on July 25, indicating that bears are selling on minor rallies. The bears will attempt to sink the price to the next support at $0.75.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/9c80cf37-6c72-4c47-ac85-828104b223d3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($0.75) and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that buyers have a slight edge. If the price rebounds off $0.75, the bulls will again attempt to push the MATIC/USDT pair above the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the pair could rally to the psychological level of $1. The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to start an up-move to $1.26.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price breaks below $0.75, it will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. The pair could then slide to $0.63.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) formed a Doji candlestick pattern on July 23 and an inside-day candlestick pattern on July 24, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/bfbd9ccf-e791-4e8c-b04f-880424d60089.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This uncertainty resolved to the downside on July 25 and the AVAX/USDT pair declined to the breakout level at $21.35. If the price rebounds off this level with strength, it will suggest that bulls are buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 That could increase the possibility of a retest at $26.50. A break above this resistance could clear the path for a rally to $29 and then to $33.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price breaks below $21.35, the pair could drop to the support line. The bulls are likely to defend this level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDcvMDVhODFhNTYtOTQ0My00MmFjLTkyNjctMTIyMmU5ZDFmMWE1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220725ei7p000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin must close above $21.9K to avoid fresh BTC price crash \u8212\'20\'14 trader\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  William Suberg \par \uc2 637 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 July 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin faces a key weekly close with BTC price action tackling critical moving averages.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) found strength at $22,000 into July 24 with bulls still aiming for a solid green weekly close.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/902a208c-909d-4c50-bcdd-e25631a3e5a2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Classic levels for end-of-week price focus\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.142027444.742658523.1640948929-762064149.1640948929"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD halting a weekend drop at $21,900 to return towards the $23,000 on the day.\par \par \uc2 The pair held a trading range closely focused on key long-term trendlines, which analysts had previously described as essential to reclaim.\par \par \uc2 These included the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-traders-eye-levels-to-hold-as-decision-time-looms-for-btc-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 50-day and 200-week}}}\uc2  moving averages (MAs), the latter particularly important as support during bear markets but which had acted as resistance since May.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C\b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  that we perfectly held the 13d ema + horizontal 21.9k,\u8221\'20\'1D popular \uc2 Twitter\uc2  trading account CryptoMellany argued in part of her {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMellany/status/1551130393121783808"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 latest update}}}\uc2  on the day.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI think we'll hang around 22.5k for today's weekly close, new week starting with action down to 21-21.6k and then up for the rest of the week, forming a bull flag.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The 50-day and 200-week MAs stood at $22,370 and $22,690, respectively, at the time of writing, with spot price at $22,670.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/4418d11e-aba6-48cd-beb1-aaec0c4d2fd1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-day candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ) with 50, 200-day moving average. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Continuing, fellow trader and analyst Jibon {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Trader_Jibon/status/1551076081850994688"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 described}}}\uc2  the upcoming weekly close as \u8220\'20\'1Cvery very important.\u8221\'20\'1D An accompanying chart singled out $21,944 and $22,401 as the lines in the sand for a \u8220\'20\'1Cbad\u8221\'20\'1D or \u8220\'20\'1Cgood\u8221\'20\'1D close.\par \par \uc2 Earlier in the week, Jibon had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-holds-5-week-high-as-trader-suggests-parabolic-bear-trend-is-over"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 warned}}}\uc2  that such a \u8220\'20\'1Cbad\u8221\'20\'1D result could be the start of a retracement to new macro lows for Bitcoin \u8212\'20\'14 as low as $12,000 \u8212\'20\'14 which continued strength could fuel a relief rally as high as $40,000.\par \par \uc2 If it were to close at current levels, BTC/USD would seal its highest levels since mid-June.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/063da399-f717-4c20-bca9-4ca12d187491.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-week candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Ethereum, Cardano lead altcoins as ETH outlows rise\par \par \uc2 On altcoins, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) were the standout weekend performers as both rejected lower levels.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-price-cup-and-handle-pattern-hints-at-potential-breakout-versus-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum price 'cup and handle' pattern hints at potential breakout versus Bitcoin}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/5ee8043a-7d05-4d91-9abd-85211c99d1b6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD 1-hour candle chart (Binance). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-wobbles-on-wall-street-open-as-ethereum-hits-1-6k-in-6-week-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 returned to $1,600}}}\uc2  on the day, while \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD likewise looked to challenge its $0.548 peak from during the week, this marking its best performance since June 12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/89407198-de00-4c1e-b410-6bda4edeffe2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD 1-day candle chart (Binance). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Analyzing the current environment, traders noted the significance of Ethereum's 2018 high of $1,530, a level which became long-term resistance and which returned as resistance again in June.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ETH&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ETH}}}\par \par \uc2 after spending few weeks below 2017 ATH level {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/ethereum?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #ethereum}}}\uc2  is trying to close above it\par \par \uc2 still has 2 days left for the weekly close though\par \par \uc2 close above and this pushes till 2300 imo\par \par \uc2 close below and this keeps chopping and maybe even make new lows..who knows {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/EGsvpyTB6T"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/EGsvpyTB6T}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 White Walker (@cryptowhitewalk) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/cryptowhitewalk/status/1550816581151768576?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 July 23, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 As price action strengthened, meanwhile, outflows of ETH from major exchanges intensified. On July 22, according to data from on-chain analytics firm {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptoquant.com/asset/eth/summary"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CryptoQuant}}}\uc2 , those flows totaled 1.87 million coins.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/f52b7cd4-4490-43c6-ac5a-03d84ca705fd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH outflows chart. Source: CryptoQuant\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDcvMjk5NjA3YjgtM2Q1NC00YjAxLThlODMtZDMzNzFkNDIzMWQyLmpwZWc=.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220724ei7o0005l\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/22: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, MATIC, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,782 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 July 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Traders are still buying BTC and major altcoins on each dip, but selling near overhead resistance could be a sign that price action will remain range-bound in the short-term.\par \par \uc2 In a downtrend, when markets do not respond negatively to \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  news, it is a sign that the selling may have reached exhaustion. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-dips-under-23k-after-earnings-report-reveals-tesla-sold-75-of-its-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Reports of electric vehicle maker Tesla dumping}}}\uc2  75% of its Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) holdings in the second quarter only caused a minor blip as lower levels attracted strong buying from the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Tesla\uc2  was not the only institution that sold its Bitcoin. Arcane Research analyst Vetle Lunde highlighted in a \uc2 Twitter\uc2  thread that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/large-institutions-sold-5-5b-in-btc-since-may-and-we-re-still-here"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 large institutions have sold 236,237 BTC}}}\uc2  since May 10.\par \par \uc2 It is encouraging to note that even after huge selling by institutions and the unfavorable macro environment, Bitcoin has held up quite well.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/a0c98a00-cf01-425e-9313-d5c36d40e74b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 The current bear market allows an opportunity for new traders to enter at lower levels. A report published by \uc2 Boston Consulting Group\uc2 , Bitget and Foresight Ventures shows that only {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-to-reach-1-billion-users-in-2030-bcg-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 0.3% of individual wealth is parked in crypto}}}\uc2  compared to 25% in equities. This shows that crypto is still in the early stages of adoption compared to legacy markets.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and major altcoins extend their recovery over the short term? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin slipped below the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($22,683) on July 21 but the bulls aggressively bought the dip as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. The buyers are currently attempting to sustain the price above the overhead resistance at $23,363.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/529df0c4-6b70-4ab0-a78b-11dffa4a8b80.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($21,729) and the relative strength index (RSI) in positive territory indicate the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 If bulls thrust the price above the $23,363 to $24,276 resistance zone, \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may pick up and the BTC/USDT pair could rally to $28,171 and then to $30,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears have not yet given up. The sellers will then strive to sink the pair to the support line. A break and close below this support could tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) pullback ended at $1,605 on July 21. This shallow correction indicates that traders are not hurrying to close their positions as they expect the up-move to continue.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/67763162-afbb-4c22-a544-e60b9e7a3ce1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($1,345) and the RSI near overbought territory indicate an advantage to buyers. The bulls will strive to propel the price above the overhead resistance at $1,700. If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally to the psychological level of $2,000.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from $1,700, it will suggest that bears are defending this level aggressively. The pair could then consolidate between $1,600 and $1,700 for a few days. A break below this support could pull the pair to the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  's correction took support near the 20-day EMA ($247) on July 21, indicating that bulls are accumulating on dips. The buyers will attempt to push the price above the downtrend line and resume the up-move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/32bfaf62-da10-46b0-8091-c81026f2068c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover on the moving averages and the RSI in positive territory indicates that bulls have the upper hand. If the price breaks above the downtrend line, the BNB/USDT pair could rise to $300 and then to $325.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the downtrend line, it will suggest that bears are defending the level with vigor. However, if bulls do not give up much ground from this level, the likelihood of a breakout increases. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view could be negated on a break below the 50-day SMA ($243).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) long tail on the July 21 candlestick shows that bulls are buying on dips to the moving averages. This suggests that the sentiment has shifted from selling on rallies to buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/1a13ca03-76bb-44bd-b175-1eef91b40754.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The gradually upsloping 20-day EMA ($0.35) and the RSI in positive territory indicate an advantage to buyers. The bulls will attempt to push the price above the immediate resistance at $0.39.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the XRP/USDT pair could extend its rally to the stiff overhead resistance at $0.45. The bears may pose a strong challenge at this level.\par \par \uc2 A break below the moving averages will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view. The pair could then consolidate in a large range between $0.30 and $0.39 for a few days.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) dipped below the 50-day SMA ($0.49) on July 20 but the bears could not pull the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.47). This suggests that lower levels are attracting buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/7c321841-4426-4754-b47a-0f59def8f663.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The gradually upsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in positive territory indicate that the bulls have a slight edge. The buyers will make one more attempt to clear the overhead resistance at $0.55.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could pick up momentum and start its northward march toward $0.70. Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, the pair may consolidate between $0.44 and $0.55 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) pullback from the $48 level took support at the 20-day EMA ($39). The buyers tried to push the price above the overhead resistance on July 22 but met with heavy selling pressure at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/1925f6b1-ce21-413d-80a5-fd7c60a129b2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance, the SOL/USDT pair could drop to the moving averages and spend some more time inside the ascending triangle pattern. A break below the support line will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup and put the bears back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the buyers will make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $48. If they manage to do that, the triangle pattern will complete. The pair could then start an up-move to $60. If this barrier is overcome, the next stop could be the pattern target of $71.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) below the 20-day EMA ($0.07) on July 21 but the bulls purchased the dip aggressively as seen from the long tail on the candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/636cd991-4014-4701-bc6b-5ac06c88b996.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This improves the prospects of a break above the overhead resistance at $0.08. If that happens, the DOGE/USDT pair could rally to $0.09 and then to $0.10. The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory indicate a minor advantage for the buyers.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from $0.08, it will suggest that bears continue to sell at higher levels. That could keep the pair stuck between $0.08 and $0.06 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-wobbles-on-wall-street-open-as-ethereum-hits-1-6k-in-6-week-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin wobbles on Wall Street open as Ethereum hits $1.6K in 6-week high}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) pulled back to the 20-day EMA ($7.25) on July 21 but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that bulls purchased at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/087e0bf7-26bd-41ef-8189-ddad53b4d66b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bounce off the 20-day EMA is a positive sign and it increases the likelihood of a break above $8.08. If that happens, the DOT/USDT pair could resume its recovery and rally to $8.79 and later to the psychological level of $10.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level or $8.08, it will suggest that demand dries up at higher levels. The bears will then try to sink the price below the 20-day EMA and challenge the crucial support at $6.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) remains in an uptrend. The pullback that started at $0.98 on July 19 rebounded off the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.80. This suggests that sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/c4cce256-b457-4bce-8b7a-05db8406038a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($0.72) and the RSI in positive territory indicate that buyers have the upper hand. The MATIC/USDT pair could rise to $0.98, where the bears may try to stall the recovery. If the price turns down from this level, the pair may remain range-bound between $0.80 and $0.98 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if buyers thrust the price above $0.98, \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up and the pair could soar to $1.26. The bears will have to sink the price below the 20-day EMA to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $26 on July 20 but the bears could not pull the price to the breakout level at $21.35. This suggests that bulls are buying on minor dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/523a4302-dff1-4ace-9ef8-fabb0660567d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($21.19) and the RSI in the positive zone indicate an advantage to buyers. If bulls drive the price above $26.50, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up and the AVAX/USDT pair could rise to $29 and later to $33.\par \par \uc2 To invalidate this \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view, sellers will have to pull the price back below $21.35. If they manage to do that, the pair could slide to the support line which may attract buyers. A break and close below this level could indicate that bears are back in control.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDcvYjhkZjIzNzQtNzVmYS00MWI3LTlmY2EtYWY4MmE5Yjg4MTU1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220722ei7m000e4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
