\par\par \b \uc2 Solana (SOL) and Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) See Holders Moving to New Crypto Token Degrain (DGRN)\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 519 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 July 2022\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2022, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Sometime in February 2022, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and Solana (SOL) occupied the 7th and 8th spots on the most valuable cryptocurrency list. The pair, two of the crypto world\u8217\'20\'19s most-exciting blockchain innovations, have had quite a success story since their launch.\par \par \uc2 However, as they say, getting to the top is easier than staying put. Both cryptocurrencies have lost investors in the past few weeks. The investor exodus doesn\u8217\'20\'19t seem likely to stop anytime soon. So, what has caught the attention of these two tokens? We will find out as we proceed.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) -\par \par \uc2 Named after \b \highlight22\uc2 Ada\b0 \highlight\uc2  Lovelace, Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) operates a decentralized smart contract system. Built on a proof-of-stake consensus protocol, transaction validation is energy-efficient. Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) can execute at least 250 transactions every second, with a block time of two minutes.\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s native token, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , is worth $0.439 as of July 16th, 2022, and has been enjoying a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  run of form. But for how long? The coin remains prone to being ditched for better promising tokens, as is presently the case. In the opinion of technical analysts, the Cardano token (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) will drop to $0.399 at the end of the year.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL)\par \par \uc2 Also running on a smart contracts platform, Solana came on the crypto scene in 2017. A brainchild of software expert Anatoly Yakovenko, the platform can run 50,000 transactions every minute and boasts a block time of thirteen seconds. Users can scale and enjoy low network fees while at it.\par \par \uc2 On the market, SOL stands at $37.38 per coin. Experts predict an 11.4% rise to $41.59 before the end of July, oscillating between $59.08 and $68.27 in December 2022.\par \par \uc2 Degrain (DGRN): Riding on the Waves\par \par \uc2 Degrain is the newest coin in town, sweeping the crypto world like a tornado and taking Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and Solana (SOL) investors along. Who can resist the promising future of the world\u8217\'20\'19s first cross-chain NFT marketplace? The platform aims to allow users to buy, sell, and trade NFTs on a different platform from where it was listed.\par \par \uc2 In an unlikely chance that you aren\u8217\'20\'19t already aware, Degrainlaunched its presale first phase on July 7th. In only a minute, the platform sold over 11 million coins at its $0.01 price. Experts are predicting a 5,000% \b \highlight22\uc2 price rise\b0 \highlight\uc2  which will produce an army of happy investors.\par \par \uc2 Degrain also charges low transaction fees on its platform while offering 100% discounts to its presale investors. Investing in Degrain could potentially be one of the highest potential investments this year and we highly recommend purchasing before the end of the first phase ending soon.\par \par \uc2 Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://degrain.io"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://degrain.io}}}\par \par \uc2 Presale: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://presale.degrain.io"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://presale.degrain.io}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/degrainio"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/degrainio}}}\par \par \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/degrainio"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://twitter.com/degrainio}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020220721ei7l000um\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin bulls miss key resistance flip as BTC price sheds 8%\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  William Suberg \par \uc2 777 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 July 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin halts its gains and misses a key support level with BTC price action falling 8%.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) extended losses on the July 21 Wall Street open after a key resistance level failed to hold as new support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/9dd92035-5c39-4053-9b35-5ca1eb86faf1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Dollar rises to squeeze risk assets\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.142027444.742658523.1640948929-762064149.1640948929"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD dropping to $22,340 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2  after the opening bell, down 8% from its local top.\par \par \uc2 The pair's progress had seen a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-battles-200-week-moving-average-after-930m-tesla-bitcoin-sale"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 challenge from Tesla}}}\uc2 , which revealed that it had sold 75% of its BTC position at a loss. Macro events then added to Bitcoin's woes in the form of fresh U.S. dollar strength and a surprise rate hike from the \uc2 European Central Bank\uc2  (\uc2 ECB\uc2 ) to combat inflation.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/873933de-e5d2-473a-9901-acdd2950951b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar index (DXY) 1-hour candle chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 At the time of writing, the U.S. dollar index (DXY) had regained 107, up 0.6% in an hour as U.S. equities conversely saw modest losses.\par \par \uc2 In Europe, meanwhile, the \uc2 ECB\uc2  decision failed to improve the fortunes of the euro, which gave back early gains as the Eurozone battled fresh political fallout in Italy.\par \par \uc2 Good Morning on historic {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/ECB?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #ECB}}}\uc2  day from Italy where key interest rate should be at 6% & so 6ppts higher than current rate, acc to Taylor Rule w/Italy's core {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/inflation?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #inflation}}}\uc2  at 3.4% way above \uc2 ECB\uc2  target & unemployment at 8.1% near NAIRU. \uc2 ECB\uc2  rates should be 7.4ppts higher for entire EZ. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/1Nh8yg4e6A"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/1Nh8yg4e6A}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Holger Zschaepitz (@Schuldensuehner) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Schuldensuehner/status/1549994469424074752?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 July 21, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 "Curious to see if we get a similar breakdown on equities that like we did before," popular trader Josh Rager {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Rager/status/1550127802355044354"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tweeted}}}\uc2 , eyeing an S&P 500 fractal from late May.\par \par \uc2 "Naturally, this would impact the price action of $BTC and crypto."\par \par \uc2 The macro impact had already cost Bitcoin its 200-week and 50-day moving averages at the time of writing, these both lingering at $22,800.\par \par \uc2 "Unfortunately for bulls, BTC lost the 50-Day MA and the key 200-Week MA," on-chain analytics resource Material Indicators wrote in part of its latest update, adding the nearest macro support level was now just below $20,000.\par \par \uc2 Retest of the 50-Day MA validated the Trend Precognition signals on the D chart. Unfortunately for bulls, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/BTC?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #BTC}}}\uc2  lost the 50-Day MA and the key 200-Week MA. The next technical support level is the green 21-Day MA just above the micro trend line. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/r5m5HFl15i"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/r5m5HFl15i}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Material Indicators (@MI_Algos) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MI_Algos/status/1550085623914106880?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 July 21, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 For popular trader and analyst Crypto Tony, $21,700 was now the level to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoTony__/status/1550081697059946497"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 preserve}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Comparing 2022 to previous bear markets, meanwhile, he argued that Bitcoin should still be in line for some upside before another downmove \u8212\'20\'14 a perspective {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-holds-5-week-high-as-trader-suggests-parabolic-bear-trend-is-over"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 echoed elsewhere}}}\uc2  this week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BTC}}}\uc2  / {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24USD&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $USD}}}\uc2  - Update\par \par \uc2 I have just gone over the prior bear markets while looking at time and the overall look. So far our move has taken 210 days while putting in the biggest drop with minimal relief\par \par \uc2 I think more relief than another drop later this year {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/pqjDEgOy1b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/pqjDEgOy1b}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Crypto Tony (@CryptoTony__) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoTony__/status/1550087676694593536?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 July 21, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Altcoins echo loss of momentum\par \par \uc2 On altcoins, \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  was commonplace as large-cap tokens faced uncertain headwinds.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-7-20-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-ada-sol-doge-dot-matic-avax"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 7/20: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, MATIC, AVAX}}}\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), previously the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-lurks-by-22k-as-us-dollar-falls-from-peak-ethereum-gains-20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 best performer}}}\uc2  in the top ten cryptocurrencies by market cap, fell up to 9.7% overnight.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/eace802c-64a6-4262-90e0-220c13ff0c0a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD 1-hour candle chart (Binance). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 At the time of writing, ETH/USD circled the $1,500 mark, while Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) also lost around 10% in 24 hours.\par \par \uc2 Commenting on the outlook, however, Jonah Van Bourg, head of trading at crypto liquidity provider Cumberland, pointed to Ethereum's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-s-next-for-the-future-of-ethereum-mihailo-bjelic-from-polygon-explains"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Proof-of-Stake transition}}}\uc2  as one factor to remain \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the largest altcoin.\par \par \uc2 "While the price action of the recent past has been technical and highly macro-correlated, this move has been crypto-fundamental: the Sepolia testnet successfully merged to proof-of-stake on July 6th, setting the stage for an early-autumn mainnet merge," one of a series of tweets published on the day {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CumberlandSays/status/1550051903769399297"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 read}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDcvNWJlZjEzMWMtZmQ2Yi00NzJlLTg2MmItNjlmZmQ1NjQ0MzQ4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220721ei7l0005l\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/20: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, MATIC, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,800 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 July 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Despite today's pullback, the market structure of BTC and most altcoins is still showing early signs of a trend reversal.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) briefly extended its recovery above $24,000 and the altcoins continued to make smart gains on July 20, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum of the week experienced a brief setback after {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/breaking-tesla-sold-75-of-bitcoin-holdings-in-q2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tesla's earnings report}}}\uc2  showed the company had sold 75% of its BTC position.\par \par \uc2 Although the sharp breakout of this week is a positive sign, analysts were quick to point out that a sustained recovery depends on a strong performance from Wall Street. Analyst Venturefounder pointed out that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-may-hit-120k-in-2023-says-trader-as-btc-price-gains-25-in-a-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rally was largely macro-driven}}}\uc2  and Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s correlation with NASDAQ remained at a historical high of 91%.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s sharp rally in the past few days has awakened hibernating bulls who are dishing out lofty targets. Analyst TechDev projected a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-may-hit-120k-in-2023-says-trader-as-btc-price-gains-25-in-a-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 target of $120,000 in 2023}}}\uc2 , while \uc2 Galaxy Digital\uc2  CEO \uc2 Mike Novogratz\uc2  told a \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  conference on July 19 that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-s-longest-extreme-fear-streak-finally-breaks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin could soar above $500,000}}}\uc2  within the next five years.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/ac541507-3b9d-42ea-98a4-21c8a7b80796.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Nevertheless, analysts remain divided in their near-term expectations and some are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-moves-toward-24k-and-traders-expect-further-upside-after-a-support-retest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 unconvinced that the trend has turned}}}\uc2 . These traders believe that the current rise is a bear market rally. On the other hand, some analysts expect the up-move to continue in the short term. On-chain data firm Whalemap suggests that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-holds-23-5k-leading-bulls-to-say-it-s-different-this-time"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the rally could extend to $27,100}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and major altcoins continue their rise or will bears trap the bulls and sink the price lower? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke and closed above the 50-day simple moving average (SM($22,966) and the overhead resistance at $23,363 on July 19. This indicates a potential trend change.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/091a70de-f114-466d-8e14-54e5144bd00b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above $23,363, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up further and the BTC/USDT pair could rally to the pattern target of $28,171. This level may witness profit-booking from short-term traders.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average (EMA)($21,461) has started to turn up and the relative strength index (RSI) has risen into the positive territory. This indicates an advantage to buyers.\par \par \uc2 To invalidate this positive view, the bears will have to pull the price below the 20-day EMA. If they do that, it will indicate that the recent breakout may have been a bull trap.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) recovery has reached near the strong overhead resistance at $1,700. The bears tried to pull the price down on July 19 but the bulls did not give up much ground. This suggests that traders are not booking profits aggressively as they anticipate a move higher.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/f7abac1c-9a97-4823-a508-181a770a5e83.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is near the overbought zone. This suggests that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers drive the price above $1,700, the ETH/USDT pair could rise to the psychological level at $2,000 and then to $2,200.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from $1,700 and breaks below $1,493, the bears will attempt to pull the price toward $1,280.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  relief rally is nearing the downtrend line, which could act as minor resistance. The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is near the overbought territory, indicating an advantage to buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/e6da4f16-0bb4-4895-bf7e-f4c8f19b8284.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or the downtrend line, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to the 20-day EMA ($244). This is an important level to keep an eye on because a strong bounce off it will suggest that bulls are buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 That increases the likelihood of a breakout of the downtrend line. If that happens, the pair could rise to $300 and then to $350.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The relief rally in Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) could face resistance at the overhead resistance at $0.39 as bears attempt to pull the price back below the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/b2c2e3e9-3627-4feb-b0f2-3e91eb594460.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the XRP/USDT pair rebounds off the moving averages, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will then make another attempt to clear the overhead hurdle and push the price to $0.45. This level could again attract strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 The positive view could invalidate in the short term if the price plummets below the moving averages. If that happens, the pair could again drop to the vital support at $0.30.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to stall Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) recovery near the 50-day SMA ($0.50) on July 19 but the bulls had other plans. They purchased the dip to the 20-day EMA ($0.47) and pushed the price above the overhead resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/700dd61f-2c66-4453-9d3d-8f54ef334163.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The up-move is facing resistance at $0.55, which could pull the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair to the 20-day EMA. The gradually rising 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory indicate advantage to buyers.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again attempt to clear the overhead hurdle. If they succeed, the rally could reach $0.62.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns down from the current level and remains stuck between the $0.44 to $0.55 range for a few days.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) recovery is facing resistance at $48 as seen from the long wick on the July 19 candlestick. This suggests that bears continue to sell at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/8f4ba9cf-ceba-4ed0-93e0-c40b3a200f88.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls do not cede much ground to the bears, it will improve the prospects of a break above the overhead resistance. The gradually upsloping 20-day EMA ($38) and the RSI in the positive zone indicate advantage to buyers. A break and close above $48 could open the doors for a possible rally to $60.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down sharply from the current level, the SOL/USDT pair could drop to the moving averages. The bears will have to sink the pair below the support line to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the 50-day SMA ($0.07) on July 19 but the rally is facing resistance near $0.08 as seen from the long wick on July 20 candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/1a274922-80ec-4fbc-9977-8b1f850fa04c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in positive territory, indicating that bulls have the upper hand. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA ($0.06), the bulls will again try to clear the overhead hurdle at $0.08 and push the DOGE/USDT pair toward $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price breaks below the moving averages, the pair could drop to $0.06. A bounce off this level could keep the pair range-bound between $0.06 and $0.08 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-price-enters-correction-territory-after-80-monthly-gains"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana price enters correction territory after 80% monthly gains}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) recovery reached the 50-day SMA ($7.73) on July 18 but the bulls are struggling to overcome this barrier. This suggests that the bears are defending this level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/5c491c3b-5162-4b17-a4d4-29675ddcdefe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($7.21) is flattish and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating a minor advantage to buyers. If the price turns down from the current level but rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that dips are being bought. The bulls will then strive to push the price toward $10.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate in the short term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. The DOT/USDT pair could then drop to the crucial support at $6.36.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) up-move in the past few days pushed the RSI deep into the overbought zone, indicating that the rally may have been overheated in the short term. That may have attracted profit-booking near the psychological level of $1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/0817dd96-b837-476f-aa93-4eac6124f308.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price could drop to the 20-day EMA ($0.68), which is likely to act as strong support. The rising 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive zone suggest that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the sentiment has turned positive and the bulls are buying on dips. The bulls will then attempt to push the price above $1. If they succeed, the MATIC/USDT pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $1.20.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break and close below the 20-day EMA could tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) broke out of the ascending triangle pattern on July 18 indicating the start of a new up-move. However, the long wick on the July 19 and 20 candlestick shows that bears are selling at higher levels and will try to pull the price to the breakout level at $21.35.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/216c5d48-8d37-4abb-9992-3f0def139567.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the positive zone, indicating advantage to buyers. If the price rebounds off $21.35, it will suggest that bulls have flipped the level into support. That could resume the uptrend toward the pattern target of $29.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate if the price turns down and plummets below $21.35. Such a move will suggest that bears continue to sell on rallies. The pair could then drop to the support line.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDcvMTVkYzljZWYtZmMyMC00ODQ4LWE2NGMtNTdmOGU2MjZiNmY2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220720ei7k000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/18: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, MATIC, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,828 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 July 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Did Bitcoin bottom? The weekend crypto rally has extended into the start of a new week, leading traders to question whether the bottom is in.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) rose above $22,000 and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) traded above $1,500 on July 18, indicating that bulls are gradually returning to the cryptocurrency markets. This pushed the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-recaptures-1-trillion-market-cap-btc-hits-22k-eth-giga-mooning"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 total crypto market capitalization above $1 trillion}}}\uc2  for the first time since June 13, raising hopes that the worst of the bear market may be behind us.\par \par \uc2 In another positive sign, more than 80% of the total Bitcoin supply denominated in the United States dollar has been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hodling-activity-resembles-previous-market-bottoms-glassnode"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dormant for at least three months}}}\uc2 , according to crypto intelligence firm Glassnode. During previous bear markets, such an occurrence preceded the end of the bear phase.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/bc178b9f-893b-4349-93c3-f9e197b1bd1e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 However, a report by Grayscale Investments voices a different opinion. It suggests that the current bear market in Bitcoin started in June 2022 and if history repeats itself, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-winter-has-250-days-left-if-the-market-cycle-repeats-grayscale"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bear phase could continue for 250 more days}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Can buyers maintain their momentum at higher levels or will bears continue to sell on rallies? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 After hesitating near the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($20,986) for two days, Bitcoin made a decisive move higher on July 18. This up-move has broken above the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle, indicating a possible trend reversal.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/519476b1-6c82-47a5-9620-6b6f60f2b82a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flat but the relative strength index (RSI) has risen into the positive territory, indicating that the momentum favors the buyers. The bulls will now attempt to overcome the barrier at $23,363.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this level but rebounds off the breakout level from the triangle, it will suggest buying at lower levels. That could increase the possibility of a break above $23,363. The pair could then rally to the pattern target of $28,171.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price fails to sustain above the triangle, it will indicate that the bears are aggressively defending the overhead zone between the resistance line of the triangle and $23,363. That could keep the pair inside the triangle for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether broke and closed above the overhead resistance at $1,280 on July 16, which completed the ascending triangle pattern The bears tried to stall the up-move at the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($1,336) on July 17 but the bulls did not relent.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/629e07ef-38b7-485d-a61f-9e2281bd9ba5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers resumed their purchase on July 18 and pushed the price above $1,500. This suggests the start of a new uptrend. The ETH/USDT pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $1,700 where the bears may pose a strong challenge.\par \par \uc2 If the next correction gets arrested at the 20-day EMA ($1,234), it will suggest that the sentiment has shifted from selling on rallies to buying on dips. That could enhance the prospects of a break above $1,700.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate in the short term if the price turns down and slips below the 20-day EMA. That could pull the pair to the support line of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  rose above the 20-day EMA ($238) on July 14 and cleared the overhead hurdle at the 50-day EMA ($247) on July 16. The bears tried to pull the price back below the 50-day SMA on July 17 but the bulls held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/f9bde853-a944-4368-828a-9d8aadbe56c5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair resumed its up-move on July 18, suggesting that the low may have been made at $183. The 20-day EMA has started to turn up and the RSI is in the positive zone, indicating that bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above the 50-day SMA, the pair could rally to $300 and then attempt an up-move to $350. This level is likely to act as a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate in the short term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. That could pull the pair to $211.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) broke above the downtrend line on July 16 but the bears stalled the relief rally at the 50-day SMA ($0.35). The sellers tried to pull the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.34) on July 17 but the bulls did not budge and bought the dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/d0c5e075-636c-4438-8727-0011afd2e7db.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn up gradually and the RSI has jumped into the positive zone, indicating advantage to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair cleared the overhead hurdle at the 50-day SMA on July 18, invalidating the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern. If bulls sustain the price above the 50-day SMA, the pair could pick up momentum and rally to $0.45.\par \par \uc2 To invalidate this \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view, the bears will have to pull the pair back into the triangle. Such a move could trap the aggressive bulls and sink the pair to the important support at $0.30.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 After struggling to push Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.46), the bulls finally managed the feat on July 18. The price has reached the 50-day SMA ($0.50) which could act as a strong resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/58d90a38-dd71-4f1d-83fd-391ab4fca396.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The RSI in the positive territory indicates that the momentum favors the buyers. If bulls push the price above the 50-day SMA, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to $0.60 and then make a dash toward the stiff overhead resistance at $0.70.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls fail to sustain the price above the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that bears continue to sell aggressively on rallies. The pair could then drop back toward the critical support zone between $0.44 and $0.40.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke above the symmetrical triangle pattern on July 16, indicating that the uncertainty resolved in favor of the buyers. The bears attempted to pull the price back into the triangle on July 17 but the bulls held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/f1123510-1bbf-471c-978a-f809512300f1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The SOL/USDT pair is attempting to rise above the immediate resistance at $43. If that happens, the pair could rally to the psychological level at $50. This level may act as a hurdle but if crossed, the up-move could reach $60.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from $43 and breaks below the moving averages, the pair could drop to the support line. A break and close below this level could suggest that bears are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) is trying to form a higher low at $0.06 and the bulls are attempting to push the price above the stiff overhead resistance at the 50-day SMA ($0.07).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/72e26ef7-668b-4fc2-be4c-e128e7027ebe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the DOGE/USDT pair could rally to $0.08. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close above it could clear the path for a rally to $0.09 and then to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate in the short term if the price turns down from the current level and slides below the intraday low made on July 13. That could sink the pair to the critical level at $0.05.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-nears-critical-200-week-moving-average-as-ethereum-touches-1-5k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price nears critical 200-week moving average as Ethereum touches $1.5K}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the 20-day EMA ($7.08) on July 16 but the bears pulled the price back below the level on July 17. This tough tussle between the bulls and the bears was resolved in favor of the buyers on July 18.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/4e45dca5-64db-4e9e-b3e0-cad63e2f9c3f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the RSI is just above the midpoint, indicating that the selling pressure may be reducing. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA ($7.79) to gain the upper hand. If they manage to do that, the DOT/USDT pair could rally to $10.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that the bears are defending the 50-day SMA aggressively. The pair could then remain stuck between $6.36 and the 50-day SMA for a few days.\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 50-day SMA ($0.55) on July 13 and rose above the overhead resistance at $0.63. This completed the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/5edc88e8-b00f-438f-bddb-30e04836fe89.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The MATIC/USDT pair picked up momentum and reached the pattern target of $0.95 on July 18. The sharp rally of the past few days has pushed the RSI into the overbought territory and the pair is near the psychological level of $1. This points to a possible consolidation or correction in the near term.\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($0.63). If the price rebounds off this level, it will suggest that bulls continue to buy on dips. The pair could then attempt a rally to the 200-day SMA ($1.25). This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view could invalidate on a break below $0.63.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has broken above the overhead resistance at $21.35, indicating the completion of the ascending triangle pattern. This increases the likelihood of a trend reversal.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/ede05ead-9f57-4d1b-8a0b-7cdcc6f50709.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($19.56) and the 50-day SMA ($19.79) are close to completing a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the positive territory indicating advantage to buyers. If bulls sustain the price above $21.35, the AVAX/USDT pair could start a new up-move. The pattern target of the breakout from the triangle is $29.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that bears continue to sell aggressively at higher levels. That could pull the pair down to the support line.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDcvZDljYjVhMzEtNDQ5OC00NzhjLTg1OWItYzZjNzhmMGNhOTViLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220718ei7i000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/15: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, SHIB, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,796 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 July 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and many altcoins are back at key overhead resistance levels, but will bulls gather enough momentum to produce a sustained breakout?\par \par \uc2 The recovery in the cryptocurrency markets is being led by Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), which has risen above the $21,000 level. However, BlockTrends analyst Caue Oliveira said that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whales-still-hibernating-as-btc-price-nears-21k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 on-chain data shows a decline}}}\uc2  in \u8220\'20\'1Cwhale activity\u8221\'20\'1D since the month of May, barring the flurry of activity during {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/analysts-assess-the-aftermath-of-the-terra-luna-collapse-cointelegraph-interview"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the Terra (LUNA) \u8212\'20\'14 since renamed Terra Classic (LUNC) \u8212\'20\'14 collapse}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 A survey conducted in China shows that most participants believe that Bitcoin could fall much further. About 40% of the participants said they would {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/two-bitcoin-price-prediction-polls-same-outcome-10k-btc-is-coming"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 buy Bitcoin if the price dropped to $10,000}}}\uc2 . Only 8% of the voters showed interest in buying Bitcoin if it drops to $18,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/c949b805-0979-41bf-b746-a7a8536d3826.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Millionaire investor {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-markets-need-to-hit-total-panic-before-revival-kevin-o-leary"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kevin O\u8217\'20\'19Leary told Cointelegraph}}}\uc2  that crypto markets are likely to witness \u8220\'20\'1Cmassive \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8221\'20\'1D and enter into a state of \u8220\'20\'1Ctotal panic\u8221\'20\'1D before entering an accelerated growth phase. He said that companies run by \u8220\'20\'1Cidiot managers\u8221\'20\'1D will face the heat, but that will result in the rise of stronger companies.\par \par \uc2 Could higher levels continue to witness aggressive selling by the bears? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin slipped below the support line of the symmetrical triangle on July 13, but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. This suggests that the bulls purchased the dip and have pushed the price to the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($20,842).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/980f222c-82cf-4803-afb9-c18e054f0877.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to sustain the price above the 20-day EMA to indicate that the bears may be losing their grip. Above the 20-day EMA, the recovery could extend to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($23,753).\par \par \uc2 A break and close above this resistance could indicate that the BTC/USDT pair may have bottomed out.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the support line. Such a move could increase the likelihood of a retest of the crucial support zone between $18,626 and $17,622\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke below the support line of the ascending triangle pattern on July 12 but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. The price turned up from $1,006 and re-entered the triangle on July 13. This suggests that the break below the triangle may have been a bear trap.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/fc6092f0-7651-40b4-ad46-6b0f77344b73.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers will try to propel the price above the overhead resistance at $1,280 and the 50-day SMA ($1,358). If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair could start a rally to its pattern target of $1,679. The bears are expected to pose a strong challenge at the breakdown level of $1,700.\par \par \uc2 Another possibility is that the price turns down from $1,280. In that case, the pair could again drop to the support line of the triangle. The bears will have to sink the pair below $998 to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  rebounded off the strong support at $211 on July 13, indicating that bulls are buying the dips to this level. The relief rally broke above the 20-day EMA ($233) on July 14 and the bulls will attempt to push the price to the 50-day SMA ($250).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/56dd934f-0972-4d9d-a94a-833a5a791178.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the positive territory, indicating that bulls are on a comeback. A break and close above the 50-day SMA could increase the likelihood that the BNB/USDT pair has bottomed out at $183. That could start a northward march toward $300.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the 50-day SMA and slips below the 20-day EMA, the pair could drop to $211. That may keep the pair range-bound between $211 and $250 for a few more days. A break and close below $211 could clear the path for a possible retest of the critical support at $183.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the strong support at $0.30, indicating that bulls are defending the level with vigor. On July 15, the recovery reached the downtrend line, which is acting as a formidable barrier.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/f82d475b-b33e-4b80-9508-525542cadea6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks and sustains below the 20-day EMA ($0.33), it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will then make one more attempt to pull the price to the strong support at $0.30.\par \par \uc2 If this level gives way, the XRP/USDT pair could complete a descending triangle pattern. That could signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above the downtrend line, it will invalidate the descending triangle pattern. The failure of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern is usually a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign as it may lead to short covering by the aggressive bears. The pair could then rise to $0.45.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) bounced off the crucial support at $0.40 on July 13 indicating that bulls are attempting to defend the level. The relief rally has reached the 20-day EMA ($0.46), which could act as a stiff resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/034c7c7d-3f2c-44ef-b442-b3218335ebff.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA, the possibility of a break below $0.40 increases. That could start the next leg of the downtrend, which could sink the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair to $0.33.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bulls push the price above the moving averages, it will suggest that the downtrend could be weakening. The pair could then rally to $0.54 where the bears may again pose a strong challenge.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke below the triangle on July 11 but the bears could not capitalize on this advantage and pull the price below the immediate support at $31. The price turned around from $32 on July 13 and has risen above the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/5b6e4ad0-c2d2-4ae4-ac9c-70ff2e6e4c8e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers will attempt to push and sustain the price above the resistance line of the triangle. If they succeed, it will suggest that the SOL/USDT pair may have formed a low at $25. The pair could then start an up-move toward $48.\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are on the verge of completing a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating that bulls have a slight edge. To invalidate this positive view, the bears will have to pull the price below $31.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) dipped below the immediate support at $0.06 on July 12 but made a strong recovery and climbed back above the level on July 13. This suggests that bulls are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/df453c30-a587-4593-b0e0-62a594fb9bf9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now attempt to push the price above the overhead resistance at the moving averages. If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair could rally toward $0.08 and then toward $0.09.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that bears remain in control. The sellers will then again attempt to sink the pair to the crucial support at $0.05. A break and close below this level could suggest the start of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-is-now-in-its-longest-ever-extreme-fear-period"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin is now in its longest-ever 'extreme fear' period}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) dropped below the strong support of $6.36 on July 12 but rebounded off $6 on July 13. This suggests that the bulls are attempting to trap the aggressive bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/6741a9f2-368d-4b02-a1d3-d4ac99b89c19.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has reached the 20-day EMA ($7.02), which could act as a strong resistance. If buyers drive the price above this level, the likelihood of a rally to the 50-day SMA ($7.94) increases. A break above this resistance could suggest that the DOT/USDT pair may have bottomed out.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will make one more attempt to sink the price below $6. If they manage to do that, the pair could start its downward move toward $5.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) dipped below $0.000010 on July 12 but the lower levels attracted strong buying by the bulls. That propelled the price back above the psychological level of $0.000010 on July 13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/33e94cfc-bfd0-402b-a19d-24c1d6906889.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers have pushed the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.000010) on July 15, which opens the gates for a possible rise to the overhead resistance at $0.000012. This level could again attract strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $0.000012, the SHIB/USDT pair could again drop toward $0.000010 and remain stuck between these two levels for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if bulls drive the price above $0.000012, the pair could rise to $0.000014. The gradually rising 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that bulls have a slight edge.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has formed an ascending triangle pattern that will complete on a break and close above the overhead resistance at $21.35.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/27969b9a-8411-4cdb-8fb2-9ae6bd9ee67c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($18.73) has flattened out and the RSI is at the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. This balance will tilt in favor of the bulls if they push and sustain the price above $21.35. If that happens, the AVAX/USDT pair could rally to the pattern target of $29.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate in the short term if the price turns down from the overhead resistance and breaks below the support line. That could invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup and open the doors for a possible drop to $13.71.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDcvYTlkNWIwOWQtMzIzZi00MTg3LWE3YTgtYjJjZjZlNTAyY2ZiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220715ei7f000e4\