}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 DXY moves bring yen, euro into focus\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.142027444.742658523.1640948929-762064149.1640948929"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD rebounding from lows sparked by a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-tanks-on-highest-cpi-data-since-1981-as-btc-price-dips-under-19k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fresh 40-year high}}}\uc2  for U.S. inflation as per the Consumer Price Index (CPI).\par \par \uc2 After briefly dipping under $19,000, the pair took a flight above $20,000 before consolidating immediately below that psychologically significant level.\par \par \uc2 For on-chain analytics resource Material Indicators, it was now \u8220\'20\'1Cdo or die\u8221\'20\'1D for BTC price action when it came to a key rising trendline in place since mid-June.\par \par \uc2 On the day, that trendline stood at around $19,600, with BTC/USD now preserving it as support.\par \par \uc2 Gut check time for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Bitcoin?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Bitcoin}}}\uc2  bulls fighting for the trend line. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/FireCharts?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #FireCharts}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/AUJmKXClU9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/AUJmKXClU9}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Material Indicators (@MI_Algos) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MI_Algos/status/1547274909402939393?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 July 13, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Significant gains meanwhile looked less likely for crypto markets thanks to the day once more being ruled by the U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 After tanking following the CPI print, the U.S. dollar index (DXY) returned with a vengeance to post its highest levels since 2002 \u8212\'20\'14 a phenomenon that had characterized much of the year.\par \par \uc2 The new peak measured 108.64, an increase of over 1% versus the 24-hour lows.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/488ae905-3edf-47da-8d11-506a943eeb4e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar Index (DXY) 1-hour candle chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Beyond the short-term negative impact for Bitcoin and risk assets, USD strength was also bad news for other major world currencies, with the Japanese yen particularly in focus for BTC commentators.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CYen getting battered again today. \uc2 Bank of Japan\uc2  frozen in place, waiting for Fed reversal. Until then, they will continue to destroy their currency because they have no other option\u8221\'20\'1D popular \uc2 Twitter\uc2  account Stack Hodler {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/stackhodler/status/1547492909016121345"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 argued}}}\uc2  on the day:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBoJ + Yen is a glimpse into the future for \uc2 ECB\uc2  + Euro. Are you seeing why Bitcoin matters yet?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph reported, some believe that the Fed will likewise have no choice but to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-circles-20k-pre-cpi-amid-warning-fed-risks-blowing-up-economy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 halt inflation-busting interest rate hikes}}}\uc2  toward the end of 2022.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIn response to today\u8217\'20\'19s CPI print which showed broad-based and accelerating inflation, short-term FF futures moved upward implying peak FF of 3.68% by 12/22 with the @federalreserve immediately thereafter cutting rates to reach 2.9% by 1/24,\u8221\'20\'1D investor and hedge fund manager \uc2 Bill Ackman{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/BillAckman/status/1547410075039551488"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote}}}\uc2  in part of a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/BillAckman/status/1547410075039551488"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Twitter thread}}}\uc2  in reaction to the CPI data:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CImplicitly the market expects a more aggressive Fed will push us into recession by year end and then cut rates in response.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Little belief in an altcoin rebirth\par \par \uc2 Turning to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/altcoins-for-beginners/what-is-an-altcoin-a-beginners-guide-to-cryptocurrencies-beyond-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 altcoins}}}\uc2 , flat progress over the past 24 hours was no reason to assume prices could not drop more, one analyst warned.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/how-bitcoin-s-strong-correlation-to-stocks-could-trigger-a-drop-to-8-000"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 How Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s strong correlation to stocks could trigger a drop to $8,000}}}\par \par \uc2 In fresh updates on the day, Il Capo of Crypto predicted \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves for at least two tokens in the top ten cryptocurrencies by market cap.\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), for example, was threatening a return to a three-figure price tag.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ETH&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ETH}}}\par \par \uc2 Testing previous ATH as resistance and forming a corrective move. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Clean break below $1k = $600-700 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/5qRscCVQ5G"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/5qRscCVQ5G}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 il Capo Of Crypto (@CryptoCapo_) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoCapo_/status/1547498013156851718?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 July 14, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) faced an even worse situation after fall through support, which had been tested {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-sharks-scoop-up-79-1-million-ada-ahead-of-vasil-hard-fork"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 six times in as many weeks}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "Support broken and now tested as resistance. Very \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoCapo_/status/1547495477746229249"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 commented}}}\uc2 . {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoCapo_/status/1547495477746229249/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://twitter.com/CryptoCapo_/status/1547495477746229249/photo/1}}}\par \par \uc2 Data from research firm Santiment nonetheless shed light on the potential for a possible rebound of an altcoin, which had \u8220\'20\'1Cdropped harder than most\u8221\'20\'1D this year.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Cardano?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Cardano}}}\uc2  's price is down 69% in 2022, and this has caused social sentiment toward the #8 market cap asset to drop harder than most. The last time the crowd was this negative in Jan, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ADA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  rebounded +24% in 5 days until sentiment turned positive again. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/4BLpLNDraG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/4BLpLNDraG}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/mJgnhtpB1V"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/mJgnhtpB1V}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Santiment (@santimentfeed) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/santimentfeed/status/1547357525955121153?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 July 13, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDcvNGQ5YTAyOTctNTBmNC00MDliLWFmMTktODk3MWQ0YTcxZGQ5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220714ei7e0005o\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  launches staked Algorand ETP on Deutsche Boerse Xetra\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Helen Partz \par \uc2 405 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 July 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 European ETP issuer \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  is expanding its crypto investment offering with the \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  Physical Staked Algorand, a new physically-backed staked Algorand ETP.\par \par \uc2 Major European cryptocurrency investment firm \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  is expanding its exchange-traded products (ETP) with a new physically-backed ETP based on Algorand.\par \par \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  on Thursday {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinshares.com/news/coinshares-bolsters-staked-etp-lineup-algorand"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  the listing of its physically-backed staked Algorand ETP on Xetra, the electronic trading platform run by Germany\u8217\'20\'19s exchange operator Deutsche Boerse.\par \par \uc2 Named the \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  Physical Staked Algorand, the new crypto investment product will be trading on Xetra under the ticker RAND. The ETP is enabled through \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 proprietary technology platform Galata, allowing investors to benefit from the 2% staking rewards associated with participating in Algorand's blockchain security.\par \par \uc2 The new Algorand ETP joins a family of \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s staked ETP offerings {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinshares.com/etps/physical"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 featuring}}}\uc2  blockchain networks and cryptocurrencies like Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ), Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xtz-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), Cosmos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/cosmos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ATOM}}}\uc2  ) and Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 Created in 2017, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-is-the-algorand-blockchain-and-how-does-it-work"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Algorand blockchain}}}\uc2  is a decentralized network and infrastructure aiming to enable an improved version of a proof-of-stake (PoS) blockchain, referred to as the pure PoS (PPoS). In contrast to many PoS networks, any network member can become a validator with the minimum stake required of 0.1 Algorand ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/algorand-algo-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ALGO}}}\uc2  ), or $0.03.\par \par \uc2 The launch of the \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  Physical Staked Algorand comes amid the ongoing bear market and extreme \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  in recent months, with the total market capitalization standing below the $1 trillion mark.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDespite the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  seen across \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets in recent weeks, we are encouraged by the demand we\u8217\'20\'19re seeing for our products, especially our range of bankruptcy-remote, physically-backed staked ETPs,\u8221\'20\'1D \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  head of product Townsend Lansing said.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-to-make-new-all-time-highs-within-24-months-coinshares-cso"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin to make new all-time-highs within 24 months: Coinshares CSO}}}\par \par \uc2 The launch also comes against the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/experts-weigh-in-on-european-union-s-mica-crypto-regulation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 backdrop of positive regulatory news}}}\uc2  following the finalization of the Markets in Crypto Assets (MiCA) regulations in Europe in late June, Lansing noted, adding:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe see [MiCA] as a fantastic first step towards a comprehensive and transparent regulatory regime governing digital assets.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The Algorand ETP launch comes shortly after \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  announced the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinshares-acquires-french-crypto-asset-manager-napoleon-am"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 acquisition of Napoleon Asset Management}}}\uc2  on July 4. The acquisition enabled \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  to offer products and services compliant with the Alternative Investment Fund Managers Directive, in addition to its major position as an issuer of crypto ETPs.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDcvOTgzZWQ3MjEtNDI0YS00ZjNlLWE0NGEtMTQwZWQ2NjQzZjBlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220714ei7e0005p\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin fights key trendline near $20K as US dollar index hits new 20-year high\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By  William Suberg \par \uc2 781 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 July 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC price focuses on $20,000 as Bitcoin faces another day of gains for the U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) found a new focus just under $20,000 on July 14 as U.S. dollar strength hammered out yet another two-decade high.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/b437f263-51e1-4900-89bb-a5145a47e0c6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 DXY moves bring yen, euro into focus\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.142027444.742658523.1640948929-762064149.1640948929"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD rebounding from lows sparked by a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-tanks-on-highest-cpi-data-since-1981-as-btc-price-dips-under-19k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fresh 40-year high}}}\uc2  for U.S. inflation as per the Consumer Price Index (CPI).\par \par \uc2 After briefly dipping under $19,000, the pair took a flight above $20,000 before consolidating immediately below that psychologically significant level.\par \par \uc2 For on-chain analytics resource Material Indicators, it was now "do or die" for BTC price action when it came to a key rising trendline in place since mid-June.\par \par \uc2 On the day, that trendline stood at around $19,600, with BTC/USD now preserving it as support.\par \par \uc2 Gut check time for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Bitcoin?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Bitcoin}}}\uc2  bulls fighting for the trend line. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/FireCharts?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #FireCharts}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/AUJmKXClU9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/AUJmKXClU9}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Material Indicators (@MI_Algos) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MI_Algos/status/1547274909402939393?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 July 13, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Significant gains meanwhile looked less likely for crypto markets thanks to the day once more being ruled by the U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 After tanking following the CPI print, the U.S. dollar index (DXY) returned with a vengeance to post its highest levels since 2002 \u8212\'20\'14 a phenomenon which had characterized much of the year.\par \par \uc2 The new peak measured 108.64, an increase of over 1% versus the 24-hour lows.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/488ae905-3edf-47da-8d11-506a943eeb4e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar Index (DXY) 1-hour candle chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Beyond the short-term negative impact for Bitcoin and risk assets, USD strength was also bad news for other major world currencies, with the Japanese yen particularly in focus for BTC commentators\par \par \uc2 "Yen getting battered again today. \uc2 Bank of Japan\uc2  frozen in place, waiting for Fed reversal. Until then, they will continue to destroy their currency because they have no other option," popular \uc2 Twitter\uc2  account Stack Hodler {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/stackhodler/status/1547492909016121345"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 argued}}}\uc2  on the day.\par \par \uc2 "BoJ + Yen is a glimpse into the future for \uc2 ECB\uc2  + Euro. Are you seeing why Bitcoin matters yet?"\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-circles-20k-pre-cpi-amid-warning-fed-risks-blowing-up-economy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 , some believe that the Fed will likewise have no choice but to halt inflation-busting interest rate hikes toward the end of 2022.\par \par \uc2 "In response to today\u8217\'20\'19s CPI print which showed broad-based and accelerating inflation, short-term FF futures moved upward implying peak FF of 3.68% by 12/22 with the @federalreserve immediately thereafter cutting rates to reach 2.9% by 1/24," investor and hedge fund manager \uc2 Bill Ackman\uc2  wrote in part of a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/BillAckman/status/1547410075039551488"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Twitter thread}}}\uc2  in reaction to the CPI data.\par \par \uc2 "Implicitly the market expects a more aggressive Fed will push us into recession by year end and then cut rates in response."\par \par \uc2 Little belief in an altcoin rebirth\par \par \uc2 Turning to altcoins, flat progress over the past 24 hours was no reason to assume prices could not drop more, one analyst warned.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/how-bitcoin-s-strong-correlation-to-stocks-could-trigger-a-drop-to-8-000"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 How Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s strong correlation to stocks could trigger a drop to $8,000}}}\par \par \uc2 In fresh updates on the day, Il Capo of Crypto predicted \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves for at least two tokens in the top ten cryptocurrencies by market cap.\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), for example, was threatening a return to a three-figure price tag.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ETH&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ETH}}}\par \par \uc2 Testing previous ATH as resistance and forming a corrective move. \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Clean break below $1k = $600-700 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/5qRscCVQ5G"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/5qRscCVQ5G}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 il Capo Of Crypto (@CryptoCapo_) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoCapo_/status/1547498013156851718?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 July 14, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) faced an even worse situation after fall through support, which had been tested {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-sharks-scoop-up-79-1-million-ada-ahead-of-vasil-hard-fork"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 six times in as many weeks}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "Support broken and now tested as resistance. Very \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoCapo_/status/1547495477746229249"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 commented}}}\uc2 . {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoCapo_/status/1547495477746229249/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://twitter.com/CryptoCapo_/status/1547495477746229249/photo/1}}}\par \par \uc2 Data from research firm Santiment nonetheless shed light on the potential for a possible rebound of an altcoin, which had "dropped harder than most" this year.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Cardano?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Cardano}}}\uc2  's price is down 69% in 2022, and this has caused social sentiment toward the #8 market cap asset to drop harder than most. The last time the crowd was this negative in Jan, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ADA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  rebounded +24% in 5 days until sentiment turned positive again. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/4BLpLNDraG"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/4BLpLNDraG}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/mJgnhtpB1V"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/mJgnhtpB1V}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Santiment (@santimentfeed) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/santimentfeed/status/1547357525955121153?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 July 13, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDcvNGQ5YTAyOTctNTBmNC00MDliLWFmMTktODk3MWQ0YTcxZGQ5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220714ei7e0002u\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  launches staked Algorand ETP on Deutsche Boerse Xetra\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Helen Partz \par \uc2 402 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 July 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 European ETP issuer \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  is expanding its crypto investment offering with the \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  Physical Staked Algorand, a new physically-backed staked Algorand ETP.\par \par \uc2 Major European cryptocurrency investment firm \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  is expanding its exchange-traded products (ETP) with a new physically-backed ETP based on Algorand ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/algorand-algo-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ALGO}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  on Thursday {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinshares.com/news/coinshares-bolsters-staked-etp-lineup-algorand"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  the listing of its physically-backed staked Algorand ETP on Xetra, the electronic trading platform run by Germany\u8217\'20\'19s exchange operator Deutsche Boerse.\par \par \uc2 Named the \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  Physical Staked Algorand, the new crypto investment product will be trading on Xetra under the ticker RAND. The ETP is enabled through \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 proprietary technology platform Galata, allowing investors to benefit from the 2% staking rewards associated with participating in Algorand's blockchain security.\par \par \uc2 The new Algorand ETP joins a family of \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s staked ETP offerings {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinshares.com/etps/physical"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 featuring}}}\uc2  blockchain networks and cryptocurrencies like Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ), Tezos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xtz-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XTZ}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), Cosmos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/cosmos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ATOM}}}\uc2  ) and Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 Created in 2017, Algorand is a decentralized network and infrastructure {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-is-the-algorand-blockchain-and-how-does-it-work"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 aiming to enable an improved version}}}\uc2  of a Proof-of-Stake (PoS) blockchain, referred to as the pure PoS (PPoS). In contrast to many PoS networks, any network member can become a validator with the minimum stake required of 0.1 ALGO ($0.03).\par \par \uc2 The launch of the \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  Physical Staked Algorand comes amid the ongoing bear market and extreme \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  in recent months, with the total market capitalization standing below the $1 trillion mark.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDespite the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  seen across \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets in recent weeks, we are encouraged by the demand we\u8217\'20\'19re seeing for our products, especially our range of bankruptcy-remote, physically-backed staked ETPs,\u8221\'20\'1D \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19 head of product Townsend Lansing said.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-to-make-new-all-time-highs-within-24-months-coinshares-cso"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin to make new all-time-highs within 24 months: Coinshares CSO}}}\par \par \uc2 The launch also comes against the backdrop of positive regulatory news following the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/experts-weigh-in-on-european-union-s-mica-crypto-regulation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 finalization of the Markets in Crypto Assets}}}\uc2  (MiCA) regulations in Europe in late June, Lansing noted, adding:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe see [MiCA] as a fantastic first step towards a comprehensive and transparent regulatory regime governing digital assets.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The Algorand ETP launch comes shortly after \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  announced the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinshares-acquires-french-crypto-asset-manager-napoleon-am"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 acquisition of Napoleon Asset Management}}}\uc2  on July 4. The acquisition enabled \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  to offer products and services compliant with the Alternative Investment Fund Managers Directive, in addition to its major position as an issuer of crypto ETPs.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDcvOTgzZWQ3MjEtNDI0YS00ZjNlLWE0NGEtMTQwZWQ2NjQzZjBlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220714ei7e0002v\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 7/13: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, SHIB, LEO\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,826 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 July 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price saw a brief pull-back following today\u8217\'20\'19s high inflation print, but the rebound seen in BTC and altcoins suggests that buyers are buying the dip.\par \par \uc2 The United States Consumer Price Index {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-tanks-on-highest-cpi-data-since-1981-as-btc-price-dips-under-19k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 soared to 9.1% in June}}}\uc2 , exceeding expectations of an 8.8% rise year-on-year. Currently, the Fed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2022/07/12/stock-market-futures-open-to-close-news.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 funds}}}\uc2  futures point to an 81 basis points rate hike for July, suggesting that some participants anticipate a 100 basis points hike.\par \par \uc2 Several on-chain {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-indicator-that-marked-2015-and-2018-bottoms-is-flashing"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 indicators have been pointing to a likely bottom}}}\uc2  in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) but the analysts from market intelligence firm Glassnode are not convinced that the low has been made. In \u8220\'20\'1CThe Week On-Chain\u8221\'20\'1D report on July 11, the analysts said that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/capitulation-ongoing-but-markets-not-at-the-bottom-yet-glassnode"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 market may have to fall further}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cto fully test investor resolve, and enable the market to establish a resilient bottom.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/26fd1196-1976-473f-a1f4-4b5fab3b98ab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 While the short term remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , strategists are confident about its long-term prospects. \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  chief strategy officer Meltem Demirors said on CNBC that Bitcoin may extend its \u8220\'20\'1Cdownward correction\u8221\'20\'1D in the near term but it is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-to-make-new-all-time-highs-within-24-months-coinshares-cso"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 likely to make a new all-time high}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cin the next 24 months.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 What are the important levels on Bitcoin and the major altcoins that could arrest the decline? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin dropped back to the support line of the symmetrical triangle on July 12, indicating that the break above the triangle on July 7 may have been a bull trap.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/258b5b0c-48ed-4d7e-aaef-b9397dee92b6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers are trying to defend the level but the long wick on the July 13 candlestick shows that the bears are selling near the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($20,796). Both moving averages are sloping down and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the negative zone, indicating that bears are in command.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below the support line, the BTC/USDT pair could drop to the $18,626 to $17,622 support zone. This is an important zone for the bulls to defend because if it gives way, the pair could decline to $15,000.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest strong buying at lower levels. That could increase the possibility of a rally to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA)($24,084).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke below the support line of the ascending triangle pattern on July 12, which invalidated the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. A minor positive is that the bulls are trying to push the price back into the triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/9be9bb64-7259-44cf-87fd-81c94d8035ca.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, it will suggest that the break below the triangle may have been a bear trap. The bulls will then strive to push the price back above the overhead resistance at $1,280. A break and close above the 50-day SMA ($1,383) could enhance the prospects of the start of a new up-move.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the support line, it will suggest that bears have flipped the level into resistance. The sellers will then try to sink the ETH/USDT pair below $998 and challenge the pivotal support at $881. If this support cracks, the pair could start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls could not capitalize on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  's break above the 20-day EMA ($231). This failure was exploited by the bears who sold aggressively at higher levels and pulled the price back below the 20-day EMA on July 11.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/e5bb0d2b-2589-4c00-a8b9-8d9e8ccdb1be.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair attempted a rebound off the strong support at $211 on July 13 but the long wick on the candlestick shows that the bears are selling near the 20-day EMA. If the price breaks below $211, the selling could intensify and the pair may slide to the vital support at $183.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off $211 and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest strong demand at lower levels. The buyers will then make another attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at the 50-day SMA ($253).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the support line of the symmetrical triangle on July 11. This indicates that the uncertainty among the bulls and the bears resolved to the downside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/2fb82c3e-e90d-4396-8c52-c784d51700ac.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push the price back into the triangle on July 13 but the long wick on the candlestick suggests that bears are selling on minor intraday rallies. If the price breaks below $0.30, the XRP/USDT pair could drop to the crucial support at $0.28. A break and close below this level could signal the start of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA ($0.33). Such a move will suggest that the slide below the triangle may have been a bear trap. The pair may signal a potential trend change on a break above the resistance line of the triangle.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) slipped below the immediate support at $0.44 on July 11, indicating that bears are in command. The selling continued and the bears pulled the price to the important support at $0.40.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/74589449-f16a-40e2-899d-7cbe289d137b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers attempted to start a recovery on July 13 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that bears are trying to flip the $0.44 level into resistance. If the price breaks below $0.40, the selling could pick up momentum and the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could resume the downtrend. The pair could then decline to $0.33.\par \par \uc2 To invalidate this negative view, buyers will have to push and sustain the price above the moving averages. If that happens, the pair could attempt a rally to $0.60.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke below the support line of the symmetrical triangle on July 11 and attempts by the bulls to push the price back into the triangle failed on July 12.\par \par {\field