arkets-not-at-the-bottom-yet-glassnode"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 market may have to fall further}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cto fully test investor resolve, and enable the market to establish a resilient bottom.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/26fd1196-1976-473f-a1f4-4b5fab3b98ab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While the short term remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , strategists are confident about its long-term prospects. \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  chief strategy officer Meltem Demirors said on CNBC that Bitcoin may extend its \u8220\'20\'1Cdownward correction\u8221\'20\'1D in the near term but it is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-to-make-new-all-time-highs-within-24-months-coinshares-cso"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 likely to make a new all-time high}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cin the next 24 months.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 What are the important levels on Bitcoin and the major altcoins that could arrest the decline? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin dropped back to the support line of the symmetrical triangle on July 12, indicating that the break above the triangle on July 7 may have been a bull trap.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-07/258b5b0c-48ed-4d7e-aaef-b9397dee92b6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers are trying to defend the level but the long wick on the July 13 candlestick shows that the bears are selling near the 20-day exponential moving average ($20,796). Both moving averages are sloping down and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the negative